ranquil retreat from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. Outside, the property continues to impress with its expansive backyard, providing endless possibilities for outdoor activities and entertainment. Imagine hosting barbecues, gardening, or simply relaxing while taking in the panoramic views of the city and the harbor. Located in the sought-after South Shores neighborhood, this home offers a serene and peaceful setting while being conveniently close to a variety of amenities. Enjoy easy access to nearby parks, schools, shopping centers, and dining options. Additionally, the property is just a short drive away from the beautiful beaches and recreational opportunities that San Pedro has to offer. Don't miss the opportunity to make this remarkable property your own. With its spacious layout, stunning views, and prime location, 1614 W. 21st St. is truly a gem in San Pedro's South Shores. Schedule your private showing today and experience the beauty and comfort this home has to offer.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Fred","DiBernardo","SDIBEFRE","SB1353620","2.5","%","Fred DiBernardo","1174000","False","Full Service","All showings will begin on Friday November 3rd. A family with children lives here so we are trying to keep all showings during the open house. Please TEXT 310-707-6525 for any questions or private showing requests.","True","","","","2254","Builder","","CA","Closed","Two","W","","21st","","1614","Street","","","Cal Vet Loan, Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","19063","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Marina, Neighborhood","True","https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/ouju8pet4deoulxtne0rq/CJ-SP-NEW-4k-Unbranded_1.mp4?rlkey=fcdtzug3j3uyw61dwrq8x76c1&dl=0","https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/ouju8pet4deoulxtne0rq/CJ-SP-NEW-4k-Unbranded_1.mp4?rlkey=fcdtzug3j3uyw61dwrq8x76c1&dl=0","","1963","90732","4306","LAR1"
