 a by-gone era. As you drive up this cul-de-sac street, the home?s clean lines and Palos Verdes stone fa?ade blend beautifully with the new desert inspired landscaping. Upon entering the home, you'll immediately notice the inviting open floor plan and the warmth of the wood beam ceilings that run throughout the main living areas. A wall of windows capture the stunning ocean and Catalina views, and allows natural light to flood the interior. The sunsets will not disappoint! The spacious living room is designed to take full advantage of the view, offering a tranquil setting for relaxation. The space is anchored by a unique fireplace and stone feature wall you?ll only find in a home of this vintage. The new paint and flooring throughout the house create a fresh and modern look while preserving the mid-century aesthetic. The adjacent dining room and galley style kitchen make family dining and entertaining a breeze!  This home also features three generously sized bedrooms with new textured carpet.  The primary bedroom offers a convenient 3/4 en-suite bathroom, while the other two bedrooms share a full bathroom with the original vintage double vanity and tub/shower combo. A long driveway leads to a two-car garage with an attached workshop/studio area offering space for your creative endeavors!  This home enjoys a prime location close to stores, major streets, easy access to the Elks Club and Friendship Park! If nature is your thing, the ocean and hiking trails are not far away. Be a part of the San Pedro renaissance with the upcoming West Harbor development offering a world-class waterfront experience. This is a great opportunity and not to be missed!","Tar/Gravel","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","White Point","San Pedro","Dana","","Scott","Heflin","sbheflsco","sb1350760","2.5","%","Compass","1179000","False","Full Service","First showings will be at Open Hou