e to discover a tastefully renovated kitchen, equipped with premium quartz counters, soft close cabinetry, and stainless steel appliances, including a double refrigerator, gas cooktop & oven, and range hood. Adjacent to the kitchen is a delightful dining room with sliding glass doors that lead out to the backyard, creating a seamless flow for indoor-outdoor living. Enjoy casual meals or entertain at the breakfast bar, complemented by a dry bar where the wine cooler is perfectly positioned for your finest selections. The windowed kitchen design ensures a bright and airy culinary experience. The warmth of hardwood floors extends throughout most of the home, enhanced by recessed lighting that creates a cozy ambiance. Gather around the fireplace for intimate evenings in the inviting living room. The primary ensuite offers a private retreat with modern renovations, ensuring comfort and style. Outdoors, the property shines with a fenced in backyard (with a mature mandarin orange and fig tree), perfect for relaxation or entertaining in the barbecue area. Rain gutters add practicality to its charming curb appeal. Additionally, the home is equipped with solar panels, offering an environmentally friendly and cost-effective energy solution. Convenience is key with an attached garage and laundry hookups, making daily life effortless. This home is a rare gem in a serene and desirable location, combining modern amenities with timeless style. Close to Friendship park and the new LA Waterfront!","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Danielle","Whitney Moore","SWHITNDA","S4726","","","Keller Williams Realty","1201000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Text Lynn (310)-291-1191 with date and time preferred and wait for confirmation back. Please provide 1 hour notice on the weekends and  2 hours notice after 6pm.","","None","False","","1520","Assessor","","CA","