ght from newer sliding glass doors and windows lead to a meticulously manicured backyard and patio perfect for entertaining and al fresco dining.  The primary suite leads out to a lush patio where you can sit and enjoy a cup of coffee or a favorite book.  A laundry area and oversized two car garage complete this picture-perfect package. In addition to the relaxing atmosphere of your new home, you are only steps away from nearby trails and walking paths along the beautiful cliffs and shore of the Pacific Ocean.","Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Workshop","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","Julie","DeCoste","SDECOJUL","sb1300260","2.5","%","Re/Max Estate Properties","1235000","False","Full Service","Showing by appointment only.  Please call or text Evon (310-503-9142) or Mary (310-502-6921) to show.  CBS code required.","True","None","False","","2041","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","W","","37th","","2300","Street","","","Cash, Conventional","","22374","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","None","False","https://ranchophotos.com/mls/2300-w-37th-st/","","","1960","90732","4508","LAR1"
