oom and kitchen overlook the lush backyard, with a sliding glass door from the dining room offering easy access outside. Hardwood floors in beautiful condition run throughout the main living areas, while both bathrooms are finished with granite countertops, tile flooring, and tiled showers. The primary suite includes its own ensuite bathroom for added privacy. The private, walled-in backyard is a true oasis, complete with a large stone patio, turf lawn, and a mini orchard with fruit trees and a magnolia. The low-maintenance front yard also features turf landscaping. The two-car garage includes a washer, dryer, and extra refrigerators, with convenient access just outside the front door. This is a rare opportunity to enjoy coastal living in one of San Pedro?s most desirable neighborhoods.","","Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Fred","DiBernardo","SDIBEFRE","SB1353620","","","Fred DiBernardo","1299000","False","Full Service","Owner occupied. Call owner after 11AM + give 2 hours notice (661) 644-5096","","","","","1608","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Abalone","","3408","Avenue","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","","1956","90732","",""
