sitioned to enjoy ocean breezes and unforgettable sunsets. Legally a 3-bedroom home, it is currently configured as a 2-bedroom and can be easily converted back. The spacious primary bedroom was created by combining two bedrooms and features ocean views, a cozy fireplace, custom built-ins, crown molding, and two sliding glass doors that open to the front yard. The living room is warm and inviting with double doors that open to the enclosed patio, creating a seamless flow between indoor and outdoor spaces. Two enclosed patios extend the living space and highlight the home?s indoor and outdoor flow. One sits off the living room and frames Catalina and the Pacific like a postcard. The other is just outside the original primary bedroom and overlooks the pool, creating an inviting spot to relax and unwind. Additional highlights include gleaming hardwood floors throughout most of the home, a laundry room inside, and beautiful custom wood trim throughout. The expansive kitchen features custom cabinetry, a built-in range, double oven, and refrigerator. Other features include a newer roof and plumbing, and a 2-car garage with alley access at the rear of the property on a non-through alley. This is a special home with incredible views, timeless charm, and spaces designed to make the most of coastal living.","","All Bedrooms Down, Converted Bedroom, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","White Point","San Pedro","Dana","","Zach","Deaso","PVDEASZAC","PV8629","","","Real Brokerage Technologies, I","1300000","False","Full Service","Appointment only. Text Russell Nomura at 310-846-8482 with your name, brokerage, DRE number, and preferred date and time. Please provide as much notice as possible and we will do our best to accommodate. One of the co-listing agents must accompany all showings.","False","In Ground","True","","1473","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","W","","25th","","1806","","","","Cash t