prime South Shores area of San Pedro.  This one owner home features 4 bedrooms and 3 baths in 2,386 sq ft plus a bonus room, on a spacious 6,439 sq. ft lot.  Viewing the home from the front, you will be captivated by the robust terraced landscaping, timeless curved used-brick staircase, and red tiled roof.  You enter the home through custom oak doors into a sunlit foyer on the second level.  To the immediate left, is the formal dining room which boasts a gorgeous crystal chandelier, views of the LA Harbor, and access to a viewing deck. Step up to the elegant living room with enormous viewing windows towards the easterly sunrises and mountain views.  The remodeled gourmet kitchen has granite countertops, generous designer wood cabinets, a pantry with pullout drawers, a 5-burner upscale gas stove top, a stainless-steel hood, a double oven, and a garden window over the sink.  The kitchen, which has a small eating area, flows into the family room, styled for great friends and family gatherings and entertaining.  It features a real brick fireplace and a powder room for guests.  The family room leads to the backyard that has a lovely flat area, featuring a tranquil seating area for dining al fresco under an elegant pergola covering.  The third level features 4 bedrooms with spacious closets and new blinds.  The primary bedroom has an enormous custom walk-in closet and an attached bathroom with double sinks, soak tub and shower, and a large linen closet.  You will also find another bathroom with a soak tub and separate shower for the other 3 bedrooms.  The large laundry room is conveniently located near the bedrooms and has a door to the outside area.  The upper backyard is a gardener?s dream with plenty of space for an herbal garden and vegetables.  There is a massive producing avocado tree, a tangerine tree, and apple trees.  Stairs from the kitchen/family room lead to a bonus room (not included in sq ft) with a cool bar and its own personal refrigerator.  This room is perfect for a ?man cave? or game room.  Other features are hardwood and vinyl plank flooring throughout, dual pane windows, garden drip system, tankless water heater, and a 3-car garage with built-in cabinets.  There are also two large under-house storage areas, so your home will never feel cluttered.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Game Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","Salvatore","Sorrentino","SSORRSAL","S4726","","","Keller Williams Realty","1313000","False","Full Service","Call listing agent then go direct. Supra will be installed after the first Brokers open. EASY TO SHOW CALL L/A GO Direct DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME!!!! WATCH FOR UPDATES. UPDATE PRICE REDUCTION TODAY SEPTEMBER 9TH ALL OFFERS TO BE SENT BY SEPTEMBER 13TH 5:00PM THANKS SALLY","True","None","False","True","2386","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Morse","","1607","Drive","","Contemporary, Custom Built, Traditional","1031 Exchange, Cash, Contract, Conventional, Submit, USDA Loan, VA Loan","","2974","","Single Family Residence","","Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Marina, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","https://ranchophotos.com/mls/1607-morse-dr/","","Double Pane Windows, Garden Window(s)","1974","90732","4335","LAR1"
