 Situated on this tiny street you?ll discover a beautiful 3 bedroom, 2 1/2 bath home with a nod to mid-century modern architecture. As you enter, you are greeted by original hardwood floors bathed?in natural light pouring in from the two sliding glass doors and the multiple skylights. Your spacious living room offers a gas fireplace and sliding glass doors to your backyard oasis. On the other side of that fireplace, the dining area offers multiple seating areas, two huge picture windows and sliding glass doors to your backyard which all flows seamlessly into the kitchen. This kitchen offers generous?counter space and abundant cabinet storage. Not only will you find a pantry and pull-out pots and pans drawers along with the upgraded appliances, you will also find a hidden office area and an additional pantry closet. The hallway offers a ton of storage as well as side-by-side washer and dryer inside the home. On the other side of the home, you will find two bedrooms and one bathroom that offers a deep tub and a spacious, dual sink vanity. More storage cabinetry can be found in the hallway that leads to the primary bedroom retreat. This bedroom offers two closets, sliding glass doors to the serene backyard, and is complemented?by an updated en-suite bathroom featuring a walk-in shower. Outside in this low maintenance, private backyard there is plenty of space for relaxation and entertaining complete with a gas line for your barbecue grill or outdoor kitchen. Fruit trees galore in this backyard, guava, grapefruit, mandarin, avocado, apricot, strawberries, kumquat & more! Updates include energy efficient heaters, copper plumbing, updated windows and electric panel, a new water heater and circulation pump, roof, gutters and paint. Another perk of this home is its excellent location within the coveted lower South Shores neighborhood near multiple restaurants, shops, parks and Royal Palms State Beach and just down the street you will find a hidden entrance to one of the best hiking trails on the peninsula. Don?t miss the opportunity to call this your new home.","Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","John","D'Amico","VDAMIJOH","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1320000","False","Full Service","TWO inspection reports in the supplement section  - sadly the buyers could not perform. Great Opportunity for your client!  Please text for an appointment confirmation. Easy to show but we need to notify owner.","True","None","False","","1736","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Shad","","3817","Place","","","Submit","","22374","","Single Family Residence","","Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","","","Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","1959","90732","4524","LAR1"
