with vaulted ceilings, wide-plank hardwood floors, and generous closets. Both bathrooms feature natural stone, granite, and custom cabinetry. A large indoor laundry room adds ample storage, a utility sink?and even an ocean view. Crown molding, Baldwin hardware, designer lighting, recessed lighting, and a spotless three-car garage complete this truly special home. ALSO FOR LEASE AT $5500/MONTH.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Walk-In Pantry","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Kerry","LaPine","PVLAPIKER","V8463","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1350000","False","Full Service","Super short notice is OK. Submit request through the Showingtime link in the MLS listing and then go. CBS code will be in the confirmation. Please be sure to turn off lights and lock all doors. Thanks for showing and good luck!","True","None","False","True","2059","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Perch","","1754","Street","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit, VA Loan","","19063","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, See Remarks","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=BJmP3KMLVor&brand=0","https://youtu.be/78zNJPf5hIY","Double Pane Windows","1955","90732","4218","LAR1"
