ost sought-after neighborhoods ? South Shores. This newly renovated, fully turnkey residence is competitively priced to offer exceptional value without compromise. Step inside to a layout that flows with light, openness, and a sense of arrival. With 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and thoughtfully designed living spaces, every detail has been elevated. The Venetian plaster fireplace creates a stunning focal point, while luxury vinyl plank flooring and a 12-foot accordion slider erase the boundary between indoors and out, letting the ocean breeze flow through. The custom kitchen cabinetry, high-end stainless steel appliances, and wine fridge set the stage for both daily living and memorable entertaining. A restored rare Cinderella bathtub nods to the home?s character, while partial ocean and Catalina views and a deck off the primary suite invite moments of coastal serenity. Other notable features include a 200-amp electrical panel, new front lawn perfect for kids or pets, and ethernet outlets in every room for both EMF-conscious living and lightning-fast connectivity. This exquisitely designed home showcases beauty, comfort, and longevity and is ready for you to move right in and start living the lifestyle you?ve imagined.","Shingle","Family Room, Kitchen, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Terry","Niemann","PVNIEMTHE","V8302","","","Terranea Real Estate","1360000","False","Full Service","Contact Mike Naylor at (310) 686-9361 text/call for more information or showings - GO DIRECT- Supra.    thank you!","","None","False","","1626","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","W","","27th","","1718","","","","Cash to New Loan","","17400","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","","1955","90732","",""
