ecial ONE LEVEL home in upper South Shores has been completely remodeled and expanded and is now over 1900 sq ft per plans.  The totally remodeled kitchen and informal breakfast area(in addition to formal dining room) features cherry wood cabinets with pull out shelves, granite counters, stainless steel appliances (installed in 2022), tile flooring and backsplash and stackable glass doors to the fabulous outdoor patio area and unique outdoor succulent garden.  The original 3 bedroom home is now 4 bedrooms with spacious primary suite with huge walk in closet and attached bath with double sinks and walk in custom tile shower.  All of the rooms in the home feature hardwood flooring except kitchen and baths. All windows and doors have been replaced with custom Cabana concept folding doors that open up from the kitchen and primary bedroom on to the patio connecting the interior to a  private outdoor paradise.  Located in the heart of the South Shores area of San Pedro, this home is walking distance to South Shores award winning magnet elementary school, Friendship Park and easy access to freeways, shopping, restaurants, golf courses and Long Beach.  This is a Winner! So pack your bags and get ready to live the good life in this lovely home.","","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Entry, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","Dana","","George","Nakhla","SBNAKHGEO","s6107","3","%","Beach City Brokers","1385000","False","Full Service","Call Phyllis for appointmemt","False","Bath","True","True","1965","Plans","","CA","Closed","One","","","Vallecito","","1814","","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","24790","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/451032","","Blinds, 