ng for residents and guests. The coveted South Shores community is located near the iconic South Bay hiking, surfing, golfing, and has easy access to the 110, 710, and 405. The highly-rated South Shore Elementary Magnet School for the Visual and Performing Arts is nearby, along with other excellent school options. Don?t miss your opportunity to own the perfect beach house in a prime location!","Tar/Gravel","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","Southshore","San Pedro","","","Jake","Sullivan","PVSULLJAK","V8407","","","Strand Hill Properties","1395000","False","Full Service","Please call Brice Neubauer for showings: (949) 370-6788","","Private, Above Ground","True","","1478","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Gurnard","","3420","Avenue","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","","1961","90732","4716","LAR1"
