"","","","Storage","Driveway - Combination, Garage","True","Concrete, Deck, Patio Open","True","58","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","624.72","This custom upper South Shores beauty checks all the boxes! Built by the original owners in 1967, this spacious 4 bedroom, 3 bath home offers an open floorplan with excellent views of the LA Harbor, Vincent Thomas Bridge, and surrounding mountain ranges from the backside of this fantastic home. Direct Catalina and ocean views from the front bedroom. Stylish hardwood flooring throughout with new carpet in all bedrooms and upper family room. Over 2,200 sf of living space, with a sizable kitchen and living room w/stone fireplace that flow seamlessly to the rest of the home. Large primary bedroom with two closets, including a walk in, and private ensuite bath. Upper family room is fully equipped with wet bar and opens to an outdoor balcony, perfect for taking in the scenic area views. The very private rear patio and backyard area is nicely landscaped and perfect for entertaining. The primary bedroom and living room both include newer sliding glass doors that lead to the peaceful backyard. Indoor laundry room with storage and sink area just off living room. The attached oversized 2 car garage allows for easy and secure access into the home. Additional recent improvements include remodeled half bath off living room, interior/exterior painting, new landscaping and sprinkler system, exterior entry light, etc. The custom home has a ton of character and includes charming built in features throughout with A/C and updated electrical. Ideally located and just minutes away from the rapidly progressing West Harbor Waterfront Development, Royal Palms State Beach, Cabrillo Marina, hiking trails, shopping, easy fwy access, etc. This is a great opportunity you don't want to miss!","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Dressing Area, Family Room, Formal Entry, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","",