 Entertainer's Delight home perched high off the street at the end of a private cul-de-sac in lower South Shores. The front stairway leads to the formal entry. Step inside to high vaulted beamed ceiling showcasing the fabulous views with walls of windows and sliding glass door out to a full-length deck...perfect for enjoying the cool ocean breeze and mesmerizing sunsets while sipping a glass of wine! The open concept floorplan, plank and stone flooring, a natural Palos Verdes stone fireplace, and rooms streaming with pure, natural light give the living space a peaceful and serene vibe. The cozy kitchen with oak cabinetry and granite countertops gives ""washing the dishes with a view"" a new meaning! Adjacent to the kitchen is a large family room (currently used as a formal dining room) that opens to the rear deck and upslope yard ...the perfect flow for entertaining and enjoying family gatherings and weekend BBQ's. The primary bedroom has its own ensuite and walk-in closet. There are two more spacious bedrooms and a full bath. There is a over-sized 2-car garage with tons of storage underneath the home. The long upslope driveway can accommodate 4+ cars for easy guest parking. Enjoy a peaceful evening watching the incredible sunset and majestic views from your front yard with firepit. With a few minor updates, you can make this home YOUR DREAM HOME! There are NO WIRES in this incredible view!","","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Santanya","Livsey","PLIVSAN","PB16251","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","1406250","False","Full Service","Text Sheri 310-940-1516 with day and time of requested appointment to show.","False","","","","1854","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Mulldae","","3400","Avenue","","","Conventional","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water 