h a layout that offers excellent privacy for all occupants, with 4bd and 3ba, including a downstairs bedroom perfect for guests with its own 3/4 bath. Incredible views from the deck are yet another wonderful feature, with stair access from backyard. Upon entry, you'll find yourself in the formal living room, with vaulted ceilings and a picture window looking out onto the hillside greenery. Head down a short staircase, and you'll find the open concept family room, dining and kitchen areas. Excellent for cooking while still being involved with entertaining. Easy access to flat grassy backyard and paver patio from family room sliders, or kitchen side door. With granite countertops, a new stainless steel fridge and custom paint throughout, the kitchen is a wonderful place to enjoy those ocean & Catalina views. The downstairs bedroom is located in the hallway off the kitchen, with easy access to the downstairs bathroom. Via a second short staircase, head upstairs past the formal living room and attached 2-car garage, to the upstairs (3rd level) bedrooms. The large primary bedroom is a true showstopper with plentiful ocean views and direct deck access. En suite bath includes separate shower and tub, as well as walk-in and additional closet. Down the hall is the third bathroom with tub/shower combo and two additional, generously sized bedrooms with more of those views, views, views. Some updates to the home include newer interior paint, stylish LVP flooring, newer double-paned windows and newer HVAC system. On a cul-de-sac with only 4 other neighbors, this is a peaceful setting to enjoy evening walks through the hills, and don't forget the gorgeous peacocks you'll be sure to encounter throughout the neighborhood. Upper South Shores is directly adjacent to Rancho Palos Verdes with its incredible hiking, golfing and eateries. Planned for opening in 2025 is the multi-million dollar West Harbor Project which will bring fabulous new retail, restaurants and harbor-side public spaces to San Pedro.","","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","CLW-X65250","Eva","Garber","CLW-C134625","CLW-X77432","2.500","%","TRG Realty Company, Inc.","1407000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Owner is LA2. Please text LA2 at 818-645-2894 to schedule showing. 24 hours' notice preferred but may be able to accommodate sooner, pls inquire. Showing Information: Agent or Owner to be Present,Appointment Only,24-hr Notice,Text LA 2 ","True","None","False","True","2547","","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Baleria","","2227","Drive","","","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Drapes","1964","90732","4112","LAR1"
