"46","","None","False","","742.19","Nestled in the picturesque South Shores, Vista Del Mar community of San Pedro, this beautiful single-family home offers an unparalleled coastal living experience. With ocean views stretching as far as the eye can see, this 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom sanctuary is a haven for those seeking both luxury and tranquility. As you step inside, you're greeted by an abundance of natural light streaming through the wall-to-wall sliding doors, seamlessly blending the indoor and outdoor spaces. The airy atmosphere is accentuated by tall ceilings adorned with rustic beams, creating an inviting ambiance throughout the home. The heart of this residence is the thoughtfully designed kitchen, boasting gleaming stainless steel appliances and elegant hardwood floors that extend into the kitchen, hall, and primary bedroom. Primary bedroom is cooled efficiently with a mini split a/c. The breakfast countertop offers a perfect spot for casual dining or enjoying your morning coffee while soaking in the breathtaking ocean vistas. Entertaining is a delight with the expansive viewing deck that spans the rear of the home, providing ample space for hosting gatherings or simply unwinding as you watch the sun rise and set over the horizon. A permanent patio bench sitting area invites you to relax and soak in the coastal breeze, while an additional paved patio and grassy area offer plenty of room for outdoor activities and barbecue parties. Whether you're lounging indoors or basking in the sunshine outside, every corner of this home exudes serenity and relaxation. With its seamless blend of indoor-outdoor living spaces, stunning ocean views, and stylish finishes, this South Shores gem offers a lifestyle of luxury and coastal charm.","","Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Monica","Flores","SBFLORMON","SB1388790","2.5","%","Seven Gables Real Estate","1425000","False","Full Service","