"","0.223","Property is being sold absolutely ""AS-IS"". Seller will not make repairs or issue credits. Make your clients aware before submitting their offer. Offers will be reviewed after 6:00 pm on Tuesday, February 13th. Email offer to gary@sellnsp.com with usual supporting documents. Recommend that your client submit their highest and best offer as there most likely will not be a multiple counter offer. Property will not qualify for VA or FHA financing. Seller has a loan of $560,000 at 4% interest that may be assumable.","Dishwasher, Gas Range","True","179 - South Shores","Unknown","True","7563034008","","0","","False","2","","","1","1","3","","San Pedro","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","24","1430000","#ERR","02/01/2024 2:02:06 PM","","","02/29/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/19/2024 5:36:02 PM","02/16/2024 12:00:00 AM","","02/01/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/29/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/03/2024 10:08:45 AM","03/19/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/19/2024 12:00:00 AM","","East","24","","True","Dining Room, In Kitchen, Country Kitchen, See Remarks","","","Wood","True","","Conventional","Living Room","True","Carpet, See Remarks","False","Central, Forced Air","True","","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.724719","In Kitchen, Inside","True","False","","","1199000","","","1199000","#ERR","310-732-1202","","gary@sellnsp.com","310-832-7682","Gary","310-519-8422","","Krill","","SKRILGAR","","","","","SB1350760","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.324192","","15","9714","Back Yard, Front Yard, Gentle Sloping, Yard","Biking , Dog Park, Fishing, Golf, Hiking , Park, Watersports, Preserve/Public Land, Sidewalks, Street Lights","","Assessor","","","SB24022450","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","Garage","True","Deck","True","54","","None","False","","805.18","Looking for a BIG view with a home that needs work? Well, you've found it! This home has the potential to offer the ultimate in California Coastal living. It sits on the hillside and offers BREATHTAKING UP CLOSE PANORAMIC views of the Pacific Ocean and Catalina Island. Where can you enjoy those views? Enter through the front door and the view is right there, you don't have to go looking for it. Sitting on the couch in the sunlit living room watching TV, there's the view. At the dining room table for dinner, the view is still right there. Washing dishes at the kitchen sink, you're staring at the blue Pacific. Wake up in the morning in the primary suite and you don't even have to lift your head off the pillow, the view is right there in front of you. Only the bathrooms and secondary bedrooms are on the non-view side of the home. The home itself is a blank canvas ready for you to use your imagination and creativity to turn it into the masterpiece that it can be. The floorplan is great and with the opening up of a few walls you would create an incredibly open design that would make the view even more expansive than it already is. Like to entertain family and friends? This home is ready for that. French doors from the living and kitchen open up to a spacious deck that runs along the south side of the home. From this space you can enjoy the captivating vistas, cheerful sunrises, relaxing sunsets and fresh ocean breezes that come with living in such close proximity to the water. The lot at over 9000 sq ft features a large gently sloping rear yard that can be utilized in so many different ways. Behind the property is a canyon that adds to the tranquility of the outdoor spaces. Location? How about being less than a 1/2 mile from the ocean bluffs and White Point Nature Preserve that you can discover while enjoying any of their many walking/hiking trails. Like to golf? Trump National and Terranea are incredible properties and both are just a short drive away. Lastly, keep in mind that a home can be turned into whatever you want it to be but you can't add a view to a home that doesn't already have one. If you're looking for a project where you can enjoy a relaxing atmosphere  and soothing views to relieve the stress that comes with a remodel, this one is for you. Don't miss it!","Composition","Kitchen, Living Room","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Dillon","Floyd","CLW-C132538","CLW-X83386","2.5","%","eXp Realty of Greater Los Angeles","1430000","False","Full Service","Submit request through Showingtime and CBS code will be in confirmation. Please be sure to turn off lights and lock doors. Thanks for showing and good luck!","True","None","False","","1776","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","S","","Anchovy","","3007","Avenue","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","22374","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=cv2amc4Txqs&brand=0","","","1964","90732","4545","LAR1"
