 have ample closet space and recessed lighting, and the bathroom has a lovely Coastal vibe with step-in stone shower in cool blue tones.  Don't miss the 3 unique yard spaces, the final one just outside the front door with built-in grill and burner to BBQ with family and friends.  Another must see is the finished separate office space above the garage (not inc. in square footage) but PERFECT for an office space, home gym or reading room with stunning views! Let's not forget all of this is in the heart of South Shores with access to South Shores Award Winning Elementary School, The Friendship Bell, Cabrillo Beach and hip eateries, coffee houses and shops!","Flat, Rolled/Hot Mop, Tar/Gravel","Den, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","Southshore","","","","Michelle","Velasco","SVELAMIC","S4703","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1500000","False","Full Service","NO OPEN HOUSES. Must have an agent take you for private showings only. Showing instructions: PLEASE TEXT agent Heidi for showings, do NOT go direct, there is a CBS code. Heidi 310-920-2129 Thanks for showing!","True","None","False","","2085","Seller","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Grandeur","","2152","Drive","","","Cash, Conventional, Submit","","23251","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Hills, Ocean, Water","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=qvsTvsWbk75&mls=1","https://www.youtube.com/embed/6C6nfo-x_SU","","1962","90732","4116","LAR1"
