ce flanked by built-in bookshelves on each side and large sliding glass doors that lead out to the back yard. Enjoy breakfast, lunch and dinners in the adjacent dining area with large windows giving a spectacular view of the ocean. There is an area adjacent to the Living Room that has a built-in display cabinet and 2 small closets. The kitchen also has beautiful ocean views and is a perfect place to cook while enjoying the scenery. It has built-in cabinets and appliances. What a treat it is to wake up to the ocean view from the primary bedroom which includes a 3/4 bath and an adjacent step up area that can be used as a dressing/sitting room or a home office. The second bathroom just off the hallway has a tub and dual sinks. The backyard is a perfect place for entertaining and barbeque get-togethers. Climb up the steps in the backyard and there is a perfect place for cozy dinners in a tranquil setting. Other features include: 2 car attached garage with laundry hookups, walkway and central heat.  This is a Trust sale and the property is being sold ""As Is"".  Seller will not make any repairs.  Buyer to do their own due diligence including inspections and verify all information to satisfy themselves.","","Den, Kitchen, Living Room","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Tony","Puma","SPUMAANT","S9298","2.5","%","Palm Realty Boutique, Inc.","1510000","False","Full Service","Please use supra lockbox on the gate.  Key works on gate and front door.","True","None","False","","1884","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Mulldae","","3514","Avenue","","See Remarks","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://player.vimeo.com/video/872657415","","","1964","90732","4722","LAR1"
