st!  Between the two rooms are large divided light double sliding glass doors that can easily be closed to create two separate living spaces if desired.  The eat in kitchen, just next to the family room, allows for cooking and eating while enjoying the view.  On the other side of the house you will find all four bedrooms; a perfect home set up!  Enjoy the ocean view from the primary bedroom that includes a custom closet organizer and its very own professionally designed 3/4 private bathroom with towel warmer, beautifully tiled shower, marble vanity, and brick floor.  The other two bathrooms are just as cute with their individualized designer touches.  Head down into the backyard either by the stairs from the sunroom or those from the kitchen. The expansive backyard has plenty of space for hosting large events with family and friends, or pick from two hang out spaces to relax around the pool.   The pool can also be enclosed by a removable fence if needed for safety.  Not only has this home been beautifully updated with many special touches, but the bones of the house have been cared for as well...new roof  (2023) , new pool filter and heater (2023), almost all new dual pane windows (2020-2022), new electrical panel (approx, 2015), simply safe window and door security devices, ring doorbell and flood light cameras, built in storage cabinets inside garage.  Come check out this home!  You won't be disappointed with it's amenities!","Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Sun, Walk-In Pantry","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Julie","Serber","CLW-C114826","CLW-X77432","2.5","%","TRG Realty Company, Inc.","1511250","False","Full Service","Please contact listing agent and give at least one days notice for showings.  There is no lockbox, but if agent is not able to open the house, a front door code can be provided.  Owners live at home. So please don't wa