mporary Dutch-style front door and into the heart of the home?a gourmet kitchen designed for your inner chef. Highlights include a 10? center island, quartz countertops, stainless steel Bosch appliances, a 19,000 BTU natural gas 5-burner cooktop, a WiFi-enabled oven, and a 53-bottle Zephyr wine cooler. The luxurious bathrooms boast quartz vanities, LED-lit anti-fog mirrors, custom tile and glass-enclosed showers with rainfall shower heads. Designed for seamless indoor-outdoor living, the open-concept layout is bathed in natural light and flows effortlessly into a beautifully terraced backyard. Take in the mesmerizing views while enjoying three tiers of mature fruit trees and a dedicated garden area.  The fully fenced backyard features custom Brazilian hardwood gates and Vista Pro automatic lighting and a BeeHive smart irrigation system for easy maintenance throughout the property. Additional upgrades include new electrical and plumbing in the kitchen and bathrooms (including main drain replacements), LED lighting, waterproof LVP flooring, double-paned Milgard windows, and solid wood slab doors throughout. The finished garage features clear epoxy-coated concrete floors, new electrical with a sub-panel ready for EV charging. This smart home is fully equipped with a Yale Nest keyless entry, Nest camera/doorbell, Nest Smart Thermostat, CO2 and smoke alarms, providing modern convenience and security. Come experience true Alfresco Living!!","","Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","George","Harris","SHARRGE1","S4723","","","Harris Realty","1557800","False","Full Service","Please give at least 6 hours notice for showings.  NO LOCKBOX.  CALL JAKKI TO SCHEDULE APPT.   Please call Jakki with all questions 562-999-6900. jakki.braden@me.com","True","","","True","1695","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","W","","22nd","","1627","Street","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","19063","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, City Lights, Ocean","True","https://www.wel