up you are greeted by a lush covered entry with double french doors.  From the moment you enter the main level, the ocean view makes it's grand appearance and can be seen from almost every room in the house.   Main level features a large living room with high ceilings, a gas fireplace with PV stone hearth, and lots of windows to enjoy the views.  This level also has a direct access  2 garage with custom flooring and added storage. Lower level features a designer kitchen with lots of counter space and storage.  There is ample recessed lighting and Cambria quartz counter tops.  A custom counter depth refrigerator (Liebherr) and Bosch dishwasher are discretely hidden behind pannels that match the cabinets.   Large kitchen island 68"" x 50"" adds added storage and a dining area.  Formal Dining room has crown molding and recessed lighting on dimmers that will set the tone for any event.   This level also includes a full bedroom and bath with direct porch access.  The back porch is where you will fall in love with this property.  It offers a large seating area, a mobile fire table for heat and ambiance, amazing views, and a small grass patch for pets or sunning.  The family room has vaulted ceiling with sky lights and a loft area.   Underneath the family room floor is a built in swimming pool that could be revived.  It was closed off with permits.  Upper level features 3  spacious bedrooms and a balcony with more amzing views.  BONUS  - look at the how big the lot size is!   Enough room to add an ADU, or maybe even  a second full sized house OR possibly subdivide the lot and recapture an large part of your purchase price.  Property runs from street and includes access from the street below.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Loft, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Office, Two Primaries","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Yoko","Mendelson","VMENDYOK","V7946","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","158