ing areas. The updated kitchen features a center island, enhancing both functionality and style, while the updated bathrooms complement the home?s modern feel. The primary suite includes ocean views with a walk-in closet and a sliding glass door providing direct access to the backyard. One of the secondary bedrooms includes a built-in desk with a Murphy bed, offering flexible use of space. The home also includes a finished two-car garage with recessed lighting and ample storage. The property is ideally positioned near the major San Pedro waterfront revitalization, bringing exciting new retail, dining, and continued transformation into a premier coastal destination. This is a rare opportunity to own in a tightly held coastal community, making it a truly special offering.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","Jennifer","Boyd","PWBOYDJEN","PB8089","","","Keller Williams Coastal Prop.","1600000","False","Full Service","Go Direct!! Supra is located at the water spigot on the westside of the home. Please lock all doors and sliding doors when done with your showing. Thank you!!","True","None","False","","1968","Seller","","CA","Closed","One","","","Marina","","2007","Place","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","20754","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","Catalina, Harbor, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","https://unbranded.visithome.ai/nRnfWeRrrqx3NLreTtVBJ9?mu=ft&t=1768536119","","","1959","90732","",""
