ppliances, waterfall island with loads of seating.  The master suite enjoys an entire wing to its own, including a beautiful, open-concept master bathroom with a floating vanity, jet tub within the shower and beautiful finishes. This home has been prewired for a surround system and features a video surveillance system with mobile phone control. Step into the outdoors through custom, pivoting glass doors and enjoy the courtyard, pool and deck, perfect for entertaining!","","Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Gary","Krill","SKRILGAR","SB1350760","2.5","%","Compass","1600000","False","Full Service","CALL AGENT TO SET UP A SHOWING","","","","","2098","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","W","","Paseo Del Mar","","2304","","","","Contract, Conventional","","22374","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1965","90732","4523","LAR1"
"","0.2289","Trust Sale. Owners did not pass away in property. Seller may elect to set a deadline for offers at anytime. Property is sold ""As Is"".  Washer and dryer excluded and will be removed prior to COE. Buyer to conduct appropriate due diligence. Seller will not make any repairs including termite.  All offers should include Trust Advisory. Seller will choose Services. Seller","","","179 - South Shores","Special Assessments, Unknown","True","7562024006","","0","","False","2","","","","2","4","","San Pedro","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Text Message","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Agent Email","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","6","1610000","#ERR","01/11/2024 12:35:33 PM","","","01/18/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/10/2024 10:46:17 AM","","","01/11/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/18/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/11/2024 11:08:44 AM","02/09/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/09/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","6","","False","","","","","","","Cash to New Loan","Den, Living Room, Gas","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.728462","Gas Dryer Hookup, See Remarks","True","False","","","1299000","","","1299000","#ERR","3107809071","","aperkov@capwestre.com","310-378-0167","Ante","3103780126","","Perkov","","SPERKANT","","","3107809071","","S1099","310-378-0167","Capwest Real Estate","310-378-0126","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.322464","","6","9969","0-1 Unit/Acre, Yard","Biking , Curbs, Dog Park, Fishing, Preserve/Public Land, Storm Drains, Street Lights, Suburban","","Assessor","","","SB24006391","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","67","","None","False","","700.91","Under Contract  Once you see it, you can't unsee it. There is no place else you'll want to call home. In its breathtaking 180 degree ocean view, Catalina Island floats on the horizon in vivid color, Santa Barbara Island waves from the distance, and the only thing you'll want to do is relax on the massive balcony and look for whale spouts. The Upper South Shores location is the premier San Pedro neighborhood and walkable to Bogdanovich Park and just over a mile to famed cliffside hiking trails. Locals will tell you, San Pedro is on the rise. The Downtown renaissance, the coming West Harbor Waterfront & Amphitheater and a growing music and brewery scene are just some of the reasons to ""explore more"". This incredible home was built in 1962 and updated in the 90s by the family who have owned it since 1967. There is so much here to work with, update and make it your own. You may choose to do an easy update, or let your imagination run wild and elevate this property to the next level. The primary bedroom and bath are on the street level along with spacious living and dining areas, updated kitchen and a sun room with a vaulted ceiling and the prefect morning light.  The massive balcony wraps the first level and frames the star of the show. After the sunset, you can come inside for the evening and light a fire in the living room Descending the stairs you'll find three additional bedrooms and a shared bathroom with laundry built-in. A second fireplace makes the den cozy on Winter nights. There are expansive ocean views from all rooms on the lower level and they open to a flat backyard ready for your BBQ and fire pit. Balcony, sunset, cold drink in your hand. Done. Nothing better. Schedule a tour today, but be careful - when you see this view, you'll want it for your own.","","Family Room, Galley Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Gary","Krill","SKRILGAR","SB1350760","2.5","%","Compass","1610000","False","Full Service","Text 310-780-9071 and Go Direct.","True","","","","2297","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Grandeur","","2161","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","23251","","Single Family Residence",""