lights and numerous casement windows throughout attract an abundance of natural lighting to this east facing home. Additional touches include recessed and track lighting, custom interior and exterior iron railings, A/C, artistic tile finishes, etc. This home is a must see to truly appreciate all that it has to offer!","Composition, Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","SHARON","MCHALE","SMCHASHE","SB1290910","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","1625000","False","Full Service","Please text or call listing agent to schedule a showing appt.","True","None","False","","2827","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Pescadores","","1711","Avenue","","Custom Built","Trust Conveyance","","20754","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bay, Bridge(s), Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Marina, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","https://youtu.be/JGI9BV5wxB8","","Casement Windows, Skylight(s), Wood Frames","1957","90732","4239","LAR1"
