h An Expansive Living Space Of 2,475 Sqft. A Beautiful Double Door Entry Opens To The Large Living Room Featuring Handsome Wood Beam Ceilings, Gas Fireplace, Wet Bar And Large Windows Offering An Abundance Of Natural Light And The Most Impressive Ocean Views!! A Private Balcony Offers A Perfect Space To Enjoy Your Morning Coffee And Evening Sunsets. The Kitchen And Large Eating Area Opens To the Living Room Creating An Open Concept Ideal For Family Gatherings And Entertaining. A Private Powder Room Sits Off the Entry And Is Perfect For Guests. The Laundry Room Offers Built-In Cabinetry For Storage And Completes The Main Level. The Second Level Welcomes You To The Primary Suite With Ocean Views, Walk-In Closet And A Private Balcony. Primary Bath Features Dual Sinks With Granite Countertops, Custom Tiled Walk-In Shower And Step Down Soaking Tub That Overlooks A Serene And Tranquil Waterfall. Two Additional Bedrooms Share A Secondary Bath With A Custom Tiled Tub/Shower Combo. A Nice Size Den Can Also Be Used As A Homework Space For the Kids And Features A Private Balcony With Gorgeous Ocean Views.  The Third Level Of this Home Features A Utility Room/Office Space With Sink, Counter Space, Door For Backyard Access And A Private Bathroom. The Large Backyard Is Meticulously Maintained With A Huge Grass Area And Mature Landscaping Offering Hours Of Outdoor Entertainment And Ocean Views.","Flat","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Entry, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","Thomas","Magiar","CLW-X60734","CLW-X74717","2.5","%","KW Advisors","1650000","False","Full Service","Please Text Agent With All Showing Appointments Then Go Direct. Text Dani With All Questions At 310.941.3529","True","None","False","","2475","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Spearing","","3512","Avenue","","","Cash to New Loan","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","Electr