temporary sophistication. Every element, from the expansive 180 degree ocean views to the meticulously selected finishes, has been thoughtfully curated to create a harmonious blend of style and functionality. The striking Santa Barbara smooth stucco exterior sets the tone, inviting you into a sanctuary where clean lines and refined details prevail. Step inside to discover an open-concept layout flooded with natural light and anchored by 30 x 30 porcelain tile floors that seamlessly connect each living area. Modern recessed baseboards add a subtle touch of sophistication throughout the home, while large windows and retractable glass doors frame the breathtaking panorama outside. Beyond the glass, a beautifully landscaped rear yard awaits, featuring a spacious deck area that offers sweeping ocean views?perfect for alfresco living and intimate gatherings. The gourmet kitchen is a masterpiece of design and innovation, featuring Jenn Air ?Noir Collection? appliances, a commanding 6-burner range, and a kitchen island crafted from Dekton?a carbon neutral, ultra-compact porcelain surface. Embracing sustainability without compromising on style, this home stands as an exceptional example of modern coastal living where luxury, comfort, and timeless design converge.","","Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Cari","Corbalis","Sclaycar","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1650000","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment but easy to coordinate. Agent to be present at all showings. Call or text 323-873-7685","","None","False","","1730","Estimated","","CA","Closed","One","W","","22nd","","1609","Street","","Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan","","19063","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=rGAvx13tKS8","","","1955","90732","",""
