athroom and views that any tenant would treasure.   Welcome home.","Shingle","Den, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Lena","Samigoullina","CLW-X61859","CLW-X7252101","","","Keller Williams Hollywood Hills","1754200","False","Full Service","Please call Kathy to schedule a showing.  Thank you so much.","True","Private, Above Ground","True","True","2634","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Grenadier","","2251","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27054","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","https://players.brightcove.net/5782667246001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6357634423112","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=dHp9H973u33","Blinds, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows","1991","90732","4118","LAR1"
