ustling yet serene Port of Los Angeles. By day, watch the endless blue waters meet the sky, and by night, experience a mesmerizing display as the harbor lights twinkle like a living masterpiece. If that is not enough to quench your thirst adding to its rarity, the adjacent lot is permanently protected, ensuring unmatched privacy and unobstructed vistas for a lifetime. Whether you're enjoying your morning  coffee with a coastal breeze or unwinding under a canopy of stars, this home is a true sanctuary where beauty and tranquility blend effortlessly.  Don't miss this opportunity to own a slice of paradise in one of San Pedro's finest Coastal Enclaves.","Slate","All Bedrooms Up, Bonus Room, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","Alyssa","Borrilez","PVBORRALY","v8459","","","Estate Properties","1774000","False","Full Service","Property is being occupied  by seller.  Will need a couple of hours notice. Agent must be present for all showings.","True","None","False","True","4175","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Mantis","","1700","Avenue","","Contemporary, Mid Century Modern","Contract, Conventional","","20754","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","http://sites.southbaypics.com/1700mantisave/?mls","","Double Pane Windows","1967","90732","4206","LAR1"
"None","0.1908","4th Bedroom is used as the dining room. Laundry room, office/bedroom, and master closet are additions that are not included in the square-footage. Listing broker and agent does not guarantee the accuracy of sqft, lot size, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools, description, or other information and features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records. Buyer is advised to independently verify all of the information through the appropriate inspections and professionals.","Dishwasher, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Refrigerator","True","179 - South Shores","None","False","7563026021","","0","","False","3","","","1","2","4","","San Pedro","#ERR","","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","VDYERSUZ","","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Cell Ph","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","38","1800000","#ERR","05/20/2023 10:28:47 PM","","","06/28/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/29/2023 10:55:22 PM","","","05/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","06/28/2023 12:00:00 AM","06/28/2023 4:38:16 PM","07/28/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/28/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","38","","False","","","","","","","Conventional","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","","True","Central","True","Balcony, Beamed Ceilings, Recessed Lighting, Wet Bar","True","True","None","None","False","","","","33.721365","Individual Room","True","False","","","1895000","","","1895000","#ERR","3109844608","","jakesullivanhomes@gmail.com","","Jake","310-514-8021","","Sullivan","","PVSULLJAK","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.321534","","183","8313","0-1 Unit/Acre, Yard","Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","PV23088307","","2","7","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway Level, Garage, Street","","Patio Open","True","59","","Private, Filtered, Heated, In Ground","True","","843.09","?A Spanish-style retreat in South Shores with panoramic ocean views and a pool? It can?t be!? Oh, yes it can! Welcome to one of the most special properties to hit the market in South Shores and immerse yourself in the timeless allure of this carefully designed home. Hand painted tiles from Mexico are mindfully placed throughout the property inside and out. These special tiles grace every corner, promoting the character that is unique to this home and this home only. Immediately upon entering the front door, you will take notice of the homes skillfully crafted beauty with arched doorways, handcrafted molding and trims, wall cutouts, refinished tile floors, and so much more. The entry level (top floor) hosts two bedrooms with handmade doors, two bathrooms, the kitchen and dining area, a separate dining room, and the family room. One of the bedrooms has an en-suite bathroom which is perfect for guests or an in-law suite. Exposed beams, elegant arches, and large windows in the family room create an enchanting ambiance, while the fireplace adds warmth and character. A beautiful tile lined archway welcomes you into the oceanfront dining room that was originally used as the 4th bedroom. Both the dining room and family room have French doors that lead to the expansive upper balcony overlooking the coastal horizon, Catalina, and Santa Barbara Island. A stylish iron railing surrounds the tiled staircase down to the second family room, office, laundry room, and master suite. The master suite has a fireplace with meticulous handcrafted woodwork, French glass doors with ocean views, a walk-in closet, and an in-room tub with a stained glass window. Someone light the candles! The second family room has the homes third fireplace, fascinating pillars, a wet bar, and French doors leading out to the entertainers yard. The backyard is equipped with a pool, thrilling waterslide, jacuzzi, fire pit with a pergola, and an enormous deck that can host dozens of people. On days when the ocean breeze is too cool, you can spend time in the spacious front courtyard with a pergola, peaceful fountain, and cacti to fit the warmer scenery. It also includes a cobble stone coy pond, 5 car driveway, private gate, and low maintenance landscaping. The current owners have been crafting this home and maintaining its character for more than 40 years. Now it is time for you to sit back, relax, and enjoy life in this Spanish sanctuary. Come on over, this rare coastal gem is an absolute MUST see!","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Los Angeles Unified","Los Angeles Unified","","","","Jacky","Tu","OCTUJACK","OC07859","2.5","%","Redfin","1800000","False","Full Service","Please give 24 hours notice. Dogs and family occupy the property. Jake will accommodate showings.","True","In Ground","True","","2135","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","W","","35th","","2025","Street","","Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Panoramic, Pool","True","","","","1960","90732","4703","LAR1"
