 bedroom with ensuite bathroom and shower perfect for multi-generational living.  The second floor holds an expansive bonus room / office with access to laundry and view deck.  You will also find the Primary Bedroom with a large ensuite bathroom and walk in closet.  The home features ample storage throughout which is ideal for families with an active lifestyle.  The private yard was designed to maximize the stunning ocean and island views along with a hot tub nestled away for relaxing after a long day on the water or in town.  Located minutes away from the vibrant San Pedro waterfront, local marinas, hiking trails, restaurants, shops and the beach but a world away in the peace and tranquility of Upper South Shores.  This home has provided a lifetime of memories for the current owners and is ready for someone new to create their own memories.","","Attic, Bonus Room, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Louis","DiGonzini","NP42222","XFILL","","","CRMLS","1915000","False","Full Service","Please call or text Linda 323-229-3098","","","False","True","2612","Public Records","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Vallecito","","1749","Drive","","","Cash, Conventional, VA Loan","","29741","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://tours.previewfirst.com/ml/155352","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/93b64f7b-2bfc-42d5-8f18-37e9b11aae2d?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&initialViewType=pano&utm_source=dashboard","","1959","90732","","LAR1"
