ency year-round. Privacy is paramount, thanks to the meticulously hedged backyard, creating an idyllic retreat for relaxation and gatherings. Feel secure with Ring cameras fully enveloping the property, offering peace of mind. Expand as needed on this large flat lot that can easily accommodate a pool and an ADU. Additional features include a stylish steel Dutch door, reflecting the blend of aesthetic charm and modern sensibility that defines this residence. All of this, nestled within the coveted Lower South Shores neighborhood, ensures you're not just buying a home, but embracing a lifestyle where luxury and comfort intertwine seamlessly. Don't miss the chance to call this masterpiece your own ? schedule your private tour today!","","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","White Point","San Pedro","","","Maria Jose","Lora","SR207070592","F4185001","2.5","%","Keller Williams Encino/Sherman Oaks","1915000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Call/text listing agent with day/time. 130 pound dog on the property - do not go direct.  Brokers open Wednesday August 16th from 11am-1pm. First open house is Saturday August 19th 1-4pm and August 20th 1-4pm. Reviewing offers as they come in after the open house.","True","None","False","True","2000","Estimated","","CA","Closed","One","W","","37th","","2317","Street","","See Remarks","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","22374","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","See Remarks","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=RHcLWtYnw68","","Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","1957","90732","4507","LAR1"
