s a Murphy bed installed. The 3/4 bathroom is marble with 1/2 "" glass shower doors The 1/2 bath has marble tile and a glass sink.  The office has a wall of chestnut cabinets and a large skylight. Total of 8 skylights throughout the home. The media room is the only room upstairs, its private, wired for sound, soundproofed and has a private balcony and staircase winding up to it. All rooms except Primary have recessed lighting. 8 skylights. Huge lot with grassy area, a cultivar with avocado trees and space for a pool. 3 car garage is super clean with pebble teck flooring, lots of storage cabinets, workbench, double solid steel garage doors, stairway leading to overhead storage of 1000 sq ft. and roof, Roof is coated with seamless thermoplastic and may easily accommodate a rooftop deck or and ADU.","Flat","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Walk-In Pantry","","Los Angeles Unified","Southshore","San Pedro","Dana","","Mereeka","Silva","SSILVMER","S4331","2.5","%","Century 21 Union Realty","2400000","False","Full Service","Please text or call Stefani Coughlin to show 310-877-0073.","False","None","False","","3613","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Vallecito","","1733","Drive","","Contemporary","Cash, Conventional","","20754","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Available, Sewer Connected, Water Available, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean","True","https://realestateconnectpro.com/1733-Vallecito-Dr/idx","https://realestateconnectpro.com/1733-Vallecito-Dr/idx","Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Insulated Windows, Screens, Skylight(s), Triple Pane Windows","1957","90732","4245","LAR1"
