stled in the prestigious Lunada Bay of Palos Verdes Estates. This luxurious 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home spans 2,146 square feet of elegantly designed living space on a meticulously maintained 5,794 square foot lot. As you step inside, you are greeted by elevated ceilings and an abundance of natural light that bathes into much of the home, creating a warm and sophisticated ambiance. The spacious living and family rooms, each graced with a refined fireplace, offer the perfect settings for both intimate gatherings and grand entertaining. The gourmet kitchen, adorned with stunning beautiful countertops and ample pantry space, is a culinary enthusiast?s dream. Whether you're hosting a lavish dinner party or enjoying a quiet meal, this space is as functional as it is beautiful. Retreat to the master suite, where luxury meets comfort with a generous walk-in closet and an ensuite bathroom designed for relaxation. Central air and heat provide year-round comfort, ensuring every season is enjoyed to the fullest. Step outside to the elegantly designed outdoor decks, where you can unwind or entertain while taking in select ocean views that enhance the serene coastal surroundings. The well-maintained patio area offers a tranquil escape, perfect for soaking in the beauty of Palos Verdes Estates. The home also features a spacious 2-car garage with a convenient in-garage laundry area, adding to the seamless blend of style and practicality. Experience the pinnacle of coastal luxury living in this extraordinary Lunada Bay home, where every detail has been thoughtfully crafted to impress.","","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","To schedule a showing appointment please TEXT Julio Martinez @ 562-965-6663 at least 24-48 hrs in advance.","","","","True","2146","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Landeta","","1232","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","6889","","Sin