"","2","4","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Concrete, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener, Off Street, Private, Workshop in Garage","True","","","42","","None","False","","1255.84","Welcome to your dream home in the wonderful Lunada Bay neighborhood! This charming single-level residence offers the perfect blend of elegance, comfort, and modern living. Located in close proximity to award-winning schools and the picturesque bluffs, this property presents a unique opportunity for you and your family. As you enter inside, you'll immediately be greeted by a beautifully remodeled open floorplan, featuring a bright and sunny living room and dining room with vaulted ceilings. The hardwood floors add warmth and character to the space, while a double-sided gas fireplace provides a cozy focal point. The French doors lead you to a serene patio with a firepit, creating the perfect setting for relaxing evenings or entertaining guests. The lushly landscaped yard is a private oasis, surrounded by tall green hedges and mature trees, offering both privacy and a wonderful place to unwind and play. The indoor-outdoor living experience in this home is truly magical, allowing you to enjoy the soothing California climate and coastal breezes. The kitchen is a chef's delight, complete with stainless steel appliances, granite countertops, generous storage, a pantry, and an oversized peninsula with a breakfast bar for casual dining and entertaining. The Primary Suite is a retreat within itself, featuring a walk-in closet and private access to a secluded patio where you can savor the evening breeze. The luxurious bathroom is a spa-like haven, with a jetted tub, travertine floors and counters, and a separate shower for your relaxation. Two additional bedrooms with vaulted ceilings share an elegant bathroom with a large walk-in shower, providing ample space for family or guests. The attached two-car garage also includes a convenient laundry area, epoxy flooring, and built-in cabinets that line the walls offering a well-organized storage solution. Come and experience the warm embrace of this wonderful home for yourself!","","All Bedrooms Down, Center Hall, Den, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Galley Kitchen, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Workshop","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Call or text LA for appt, or use Showingtime, 4 hours notice required.","","None","False","","1712","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Tyburn","","833","Road","","","Cash to New Loan","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Peek-A-Boo, Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=AwSjgAZNegY&mls=1","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G3JufRTd9sk","","1958","90274","2843","PVR1YY"
