ue","Concrete, Patio, Patio Open, Front Porch, Rear Porch","True","45","","Private, Heated, In Ground, Salt Water, See Remarks, Waterfall","True","","1063.86","Welcome home to 3024 Via Rivera, nestled in the prestigious Palos Verdes Estates community.This home offers unparalleled privacy and serenity.A long driveway made up of luxurious paver bricks provides for extra parking. This stunningly beautiful Lunada Bay two-level home, boasting 3 Bd | 3 Ba | 2,255 sq ft sits at the end of a cul de sac facing the ocean.The home has been meticulously maintained with immense pride of home ownership! Upon entering at the front of the home you are met with a large living room perfect for family gatherings around an attractive centrally located fireplace. The living room area of the home boasts lots of natural light streaming in through the windows, a great place to read or for quiet relaxation. French doors from the living and family rooms lead to the backyard and pool.The dining room, is charming and intimate, conveniently located next to the kitchen with beautiful serene views of the pool and fountains. In the kitchen the large comfortable space is a culinary chefs entertaining delight with abundant ample storage complete with stainless steel appliances. A charming sitting area /family room is perfect for socializing and has views of the activity both in the kitchen and the pool.Upstairs the primary suite boasts a large very private wing perfect for quiet relaxation and peek a boo views of the ocean. The master suite includes a walk in closet; sitting area, and a private beautifully finished full bathroom that perfectly completes the suite.Two additional large bedrooms are located at the other end of the home. Experience stunning sunset views of the horizon and peek a boo views of the ocean.Outside in the back is a generously sized pool for hours of fun. A perfect place for barbecues with friends and family. The 2 car garage has been upgraded with beautiful finished floors and ?220v car charging. Extra storage is available in the attic accessed by a pull down ladder. Ask for a full list of the many add ons and upgrades! Some notable items include: Salt water pool with LED waterfalls , New pool equipment and upgrades, double paned windows, new HVAC (including new ducting and humidity control, new 3 Stage water filter for the whole house, new garage floor tiles,new tankless water heater, new electrical panels, fully paid solar panels and much much MORE! This lovingly maintained home has amazing curb appeal. If you want a PVE home that offers an oasis of luxury and tranquility at a great price point, this beauty is for you!","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Vacant / Supra with CBS Code. PLEASE text listing agent Marie Morgenstern at 310-890-7808 the following: 1) Your business card, 2) Date and Time of showing request and agent will provide the CBS CODE. Thank you for showing.","True","None","False","True","2255","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Rivera","","3024","","","See Remarks","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, See Remarks, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Neighborhood, Peek-A-Boo, Pool, See Remarks","True","","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows, Screens","1965","90274","4428","PVR1*"
