e nation. Nestled on a peaceful and quiet street, this exceptional home combines elegance and comfort. The moment you step inside, you'll be captivated by the spacious, updated interior featuring high ceilings, gleaming wood floors, and abundant natural light. The remodeled kitchen, equipped with stainless steel appliances, flows seamlessly into a cozy dining area with large windows that invite the outdoors in. The inviting living room, complete with a charming fireplace, is perfect for gatherings. The spacious family room, also boasting a fireplace and a wet bar, opens directly to the backyard oasis through sliding doors. This backyard paradise includes a heated swimming pool, spa, and an enchanting garden with blooming flowers and fruit trees, ideal for relaxation and entertainment. The main level offers three generously sized bedrooms, two of which overlook the tranquil backyard and pool. Practical features such as an updated hallway bathroom and a large laundry room enhance daily living convenience. The primary suite is a private sanctuary on its own floor, featuring a high ceiling, a private balcony with ocean views, ample closet space, a walk-in closet, and an en-suite bathroom with a large tub, double sink vanity, and a shower. Located close to award-winning schools and a plethora of outdoor activities like hiking, swimming, surfing, golf, and tennis, this exquisite Lunada Bay home is your slice of paradise.","","Den","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please text your business card to listing agent Erik at 310-989-9166 before showing.  Supra located on left railing by front door - go direct. Showing Information: Call First,Text LA 1,Appointment Only ","True","Private, Bath, In Ground","True","","3068","","","CA","Expired","Multi/Split ","","","Via Buena","","3016","","","Traditional","Owner May Carry","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://www.themls.