 ambience. The home has soaring beamed ceilings, wood floors & ample French doors and windows throughout. It features everything one needs for personal enjoyment and entertaining. The floor plan is unique in that the entertaining areas are on the first floor including a bedroom, and living areas are on the bottom level connected through double staircases. A wet bar and a wine cellar are next to the huge open family room make entertaining guests easy. 2nd family room has its kitchenette, with a stove, dishwasher, and disposal. A formal living room with an ornate fireplace and a formal dining room offer tranquil seating areas while you enjoy ultimate privacy surrounded by views. Huge master suite with his and her walk-in closets & dual fireplaces. The remodeled kitchen is a chef?s delight with Viking appliances, center island granite-galore & a family eating area. For your family and your additional safety, an Emergency Generator.","","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Office, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes","Ridgecrest","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","Agents. Please text listing agent John Kang for showing. Home is Owner Occupied and will need 24 hours notice before showings. Text only 213-999-9044 for showing instructions.","False","","","","5370","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Coronel","","1547","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","30905","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=M2QjHa7Q1By","https://youtu.be/vPpeIPXpoFg","Drapes","1987","90274","1941","PVR1*"
"36 Inch Or More Wide Halls","0.4388","","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7541018010","Pickleball, Pool, Golf Course, Tennis Court(s)","0","","False","4","","","","4","5","1353","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Office Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","299","4295000","#ERR","11/03/2025 3:10:31 PM","","","11/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","11/17/2025 1:00:21 AM","","","11/02/2025 12:00:00 AM","","11/03/2025 3:11:40 PM","","11/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","","West","13","","False","Dining Room","","Stucco","Chain Link, Wrought Iron","True","","","Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Wood","False","Central, Natural Gas","True","Beamed Ceilings, High Ceilings, Unfurnished","True","True","Call or Text","Combo","False","","","","33.786583","Gas & Electric Dryer Hookup","True","False","","Homeowners Association","4295000","","","4295000","#ERR","310.374.2100","","kyle@kyledanielsrealestate.com","","Kyle","310-378-1444","","Daniels","","SDANIKYL","","","","","S5543","310-375-9616","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-375-0583","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.410721","","10","19115","Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Sprinkler System, Up Slope from Street","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Preserve/Public Land, Storm Drains, Suburban","Wired for Alarm System","Assessor","","","SB25253022","","2","12","2","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage, Garage - Two Door, On Site, RV Potential","True","Patio, Tile","True","28","","None","False","","1203.42","Prepare to be impressed by the natural beauty of Lunada Bay in this exceptional Ocean View Modern Spanish estate designed by Pritzkat Johnson Architects.  Set above the street behind a privacy hedge, this beautiful home offers ocean views throughout the property while backing up to open spaces with groves of Eucalyptus and miles of Palos Verdes' beloved trails.  Inside, a soaring 2-story foyer welcomes guests alongside a winding staircase, all set against rich, wide-plank oak floors. with views out to the yard and surrounding hills. The impressive gourmet kitchen is the focal point of the great room.  Centered around an island with finishes including Calacatta quartz counters, Subzero, Wolf, and Bosch appliances, this is the kitchen where your friends and family will want to be.  The light filled living room with the blue waters of the Pacific visible on the horizon is the perfect place to gather, and the gas fireplace is the perfect touch for cooler days.  The expansive family room opens to the trellised patio and yard, and the built-in work center keeps a busy household on task.  A versatile fifth bedroom or office downstairs with an adjacent full bath offers ideal guest accommodation or a space for work from home days.  Upstairs, the magnificent primary suite with panoramic Queen's Necklace and ocean vistas redefines luxury.  Enjoy sunsets over the Pacific from your private balcony or unwind by the cozy fireplace. The spa-inspired primary bath offers a luxurious shower, a deep soaking tub, and a generous walk-in closet. Three additional well-appointed bedrooms, one with an ocean view, and an upstairs laundry room provide both comfort and practicality. For the discerning enthusiast, a gated driveway ensures ample parking, and the finished garage, with its epoxy floor, is ready to transform into a home gym. An adjacent bonus room provides additional flexible space, perfect for a game room or dedicated workspace. The nearly half-acre lot is your own private playground, surrounded by Palos Verdes' natural beauty and offers endless possibilities to add a pool, sport court, ADU, or simply a huge space for play. Just across the street, a trail leads to miles of scenic pathways and is convenient to shops and restaurants.  As a resident of Palos Verdes Estates, you'll enjoy access to the prestigious PV Golf Club, PV Tennis Club, and PV Beach and Athletic Club, alongside hundreds of acres of pristine open space.","Spanish Tile","Exercise Room, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Easy to show.  Contact Kyle","True","None","False","True","3569","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","W","Palos Verdes","","1336","Drive","","Modern, Spanish","Cash to New Loan","","7536","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","","","Double Pane Windows","2017","90274","1806","PVR1*"
