g room, kitchen, family room, office, 3-car garage, and an exterior deck that spans the entire width of the home staring directly at the ocean. Downstairs there are 4 bedrooms including the luxurious primary suite and an additional family room. The large primary bedroom includes its own private bathroom with a jacuzzi tub, spacious shower, sauna, dual sinks, and a considerable walk-in closet. The home was remodeled just over 10 years ago has been upgraded significantly. The prototypical backyard has a pool, built-in barbeque area, lawn, and a fire pit all overlooking the ocean and Palos Verdes bluffs. This property has all the special qualities accounted for and has been dialed in from top to bottom.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Sauna, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please call Anand (310) 704-1395 or Neil (310) 902-7227 to schedule a showing.","","","","","4658","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Coronel","","1509","","","","Conventional","","30905","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bluff, Catalina, Courtyard, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1977","90274","1941","PVR1*"
"","0.4895","Seller financing is available.  Please inquire!","Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Gas Range, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Water Heater","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7543036013","","0","","False","5","1","","","4","5","2343","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","94","5250000","#ERR","05/22/2023 12:23:34 PM","","07/14/2023 1:02:36 PM","08/24/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/02/2023 1:01:16 AM","09/21/2023 12:00:00 AM","","05/22/2023 12:00:00 AM","","07/07/2023 9:17:18 AM","","09/01/2023 12:00:00 AM","","Northwest","94","","True","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room, In Kitchen","Rain Gutters","Plaster","Stucco Wall","True","","","Family Room, Living Room, Gas, Wood Burning, Fire Pit, Free Standing","True","Wood","True","Central","True","Balcony, Copper Plumbing Full, Crown Molding, Living Room Deck Attached, Pull Down Stairs to Attic, Recessed Lighting, Stone Counters, Wired for Sound","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.766208","Upper Level","True","False","","","5250000","Powder room mirror, two backyard turquoise pots.  Refrigerator in garage. (all exterior furniture and pots are open for discussion)","","5500000","#ERR","617-459-7544","","nicole@nicolrealestate.com","","Nicole","","","Reis","","SBREISNIC","","","","","SB1350760","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.409445","","3","21323","Back Yard, Front Yard, Garden, Lawn, Sprinklers In Front, Sprinklers In Rear, Sprinklers Timer","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Suburban","Security System, Smoke Detector(s), Wired for Alarm System","Assessor","","","SB23087211","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage - Three Door","True","","","46","","Private, Diving Board, Heated, In Ground","True","","1398.14","Paradise awaits! Welcome to your dream European manor with breathtaking ocean views and a generous half-acre lot.  This luxurious residence combines Lunada Bay charm with modern comforts, offering a truly enchanting living experience.   As you approach the property, a grand driveway and limestone walkway lined with immaculate landscaping leads you to the impressive entrance adorned with intricate stonework. Step inside, and be prepared to be captivated by the timeless elegance and custom craftsmanship that permeates every corner of the home. The main living area boasts a spacious and light-filled layout, designed to embrace an indoor/outdoor concept with ocean views from multiple large windows and multi slide patio doors. The living room, with its ornate fireplace, creates a cozy ambiance for relaxation and entertaining alike.  The gourmet kitchen is a chef's delight, featuring top-of-the-line appliances, natural quartzite countertops and marble backsplash, a built in Miele coffee maker and a center island perfect for gathering with family and friends. Enjoy casual meals in the breakfast nook, which overlooks the manicured gardens, lush lawn and the sparkling swimming pool and spa.  Step outside to discover an outdoor paradise that complements the beauty of the manor. The expansive half-acre lot offers endless possibilities for outdoor entertaining and relaxation. Lounge on the sprawling pool deck while enjoying the ocean breeze, dip in the pool, gather around the fire pit or embrace the beautiful lawn for a game of whiffle ball or soccer with the family. Upstairs, the palatial primary suite is a haven of luxury and tranquility. Wake up to panoramic ocean views from your private balcony and indulge in the spa-like en-suite bathroom, complete with a soaking tub, a spacious shower, and dual vanities. Four additional bedrooms, two with ocean views and one with its own en-suite bathroom, provide comfort and privacy for family members or guests. Experience the opulence and tranquility that this remarkable estate has to offer, where every day feels like a vacation in your own private paradise!","Slate, Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Loft, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Please contact Nicole Reis for all showing requests. Property is easy to show!","False","","","True","3755","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Victoria","","2878","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","http://sites.southbaypics.com/2878viavictoria/?mls","","Bay Window(s), Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows","1972","90274","4470","PVR1*"
"","0.2441","","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Freezer, Disposal, Gas Oven, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7541005011","Other","0","","False","4","","","","4","5","1271","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","Agent Text Message","Office Fax","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","206","5777000","#ERR","03/05/2024 9:35:24 AM","","07/11/2024 10:57:25 AM","10/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","10/06/2024 1:00:41 AM","","","03/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","","05/13/2024 3:53:44 PM","","10/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","206","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Separated","","","","","","","Living Room","True","Tile, Wood","False","Central","True","Balcony, High Ceilings, Living Room Deck Attached, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting","True","True","None","None","False","","","","33.782679","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","CC And R's, Homeowners Association","5777000","","","5989000","#ERR","","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","","VDYERSUZ","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.419984","","10","10635","Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lawn, Sprinkler System, Yard","Curbs","","See Remarks","","","PV24044042","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Circular Driveway, Driveway, Garage, Parking Space","True","Patio","True","75","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1324.09","New homes or extensively remodeled homes are almost impossible to find in Palos Verdes Estates due to the lengthy, difficult permit/building process.  Here is your chance to turn the key and move right in to a home where an over two million dollar remodel was just completed.  Nestled on one of the most prestigious and sought after street on the Peninsula ""Paseo Del Mar"", this stunning residence epitomizes collaborative excellence at its finest. Every detail of this magnificent estate reflects a level of craftsmanship and artistry that is unmatched. From the meticulously crafted cabinets to the lavish tile and stone finishes, the interior exudes a bespoke luxury that is both tasteful and opulent.  The seamless integration of indoor and outdoor spaces is achieved through expansive walls of glass, offering breathtaking ocean views and refreshing sea breezes from private patios. Upon arrival, guests are greeted by the grandeur of a sweeping circular driveway leading to a serene water feature and spacious patio, setting the stage for the elegance that awaits within.  At the heart of the home lies the culinary haven of an elegant kitchen, seamlessly connected to the family room and sprawling backyard with a tranquil waterfall feature. The formal dining room is adorned with a stunning Jamie Young chandelier, while the great room, boasting a wet bar and striking fireplace, extends gracefully to the patio, ideal for entertaining guests.  The primary suite is a luxurious sanctuary with ocean vistas, a private patio, and an expansive bath leading to a dream walk-in closet. Three additional bedrooms, each with patio access, grace the upper level, while a fifth bedroom or office is conveniently situated downstairs. A versatile 507-square-foot bonus room offers endless possibilities and can easily be converted into an exceptional ADU (Accessory Dwelling Unit). Additionally, a discreet 252-square-foot wine room area caters to the connoisseur's palate.  Practicality meets luxury with a three-car garage and an additional parking space accessible via a convenient alley behind the residence. Meticulously reimagined from its foundation upward, this home showcases the pinnacle of luxury living with the finest materials and craftsmanship, making it a true masterpiece.  Room for pool and spa by backyard or keep the spacious lawn and patio area.","","Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Game Room, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text agent for instructions 310-528-7480","","None","False","True","4363","Taped","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","1736","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7140","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=fywZWdcNyJY","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=fywZWdcNyJY","","2023","90274","1854","PVR1*"
"","0.44","Buyer to verify all MLS info, including, but not limited to, permits and uses, bed/bath counts, all square footage, parking, and schools. Buyer is advised to independently investigate all aspects of the property, verify the accuracy of all information provided through personal inspection & with appropriate professionals to Buyers satisfaction. Please see supplemental documents for a full property feature list.","Barbecue, Dishwasher, Disposal, Refrigerator, Built-In, Gas Cooktop, Double Oven, Microwave","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","","","7541018008","","","","","8","1","0","2","5","7","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","949-370-0711","","Alutz@TheAgencyRE.com","949-370-0711","Allison","","","Lutz","CLW-C120204","","","","","","CLW-X79013","424-230-3720","The Agency","424-230-3700","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","","","Los Angeles","228","6499000","#ERR","09/12/2022 4:50:58 PM","","05/18/2023 3:56:56 PM","08/01/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/02/2023 2:23:15 AM","","","09/12/2022 12:00:00 AM","","06/23/2023 10:27:02 PM","","08/01/2023 12:00:00 AM","12/14/2022 12:00:00 AM","West","228","","","","","Stucco, Wood Siding","Stucco Wall","True","","Cash, Conventional","Family Room, Living Room, Library, Patio","True","Carpet, Stone, Wood","True","Central","True","High Ceilings, Recessed Lighting, Two Story Ceilings","True","True","","","","","","","33.786956","Washer Included, Dryer Included, Individual Room","True","","","","6499000","","","7499000","#ERR","424-281-6848","","kevin@kevindees.com","","Kevin","","","Dees","","CLW-C109928","","","","","CLW-X79013","424-230-3720","The Agency","424-230-3700","","Seller Reserved","-118.410443","80x240","","19203","Back Yard, Yard","","Automatic Gate, Smoke Detector(s), Gated Community","Assessor","","","22198817","","4","4","","","Owner","","","","","Auto Driveway Gate, Carport, Circular Driveway, Controlled Entrance","True","Wood, Covered","True","40","","In Ground, Heated","False","","795.47","Set atop the bluffs overlooking the Pacific Ocean, this custom Palos Verdes Estate welcomes you with an expansive eco-friendly motor court featuring a permeable driveway with rain capture system, providing water to the lush yet drought tolerant landscape. The eight-foot high wooden front door pivots open to reveal soaring ceilings with light-filled formal living and dining rooms to either side. A curvilinear staircase provides the centerpiece, set below an extraordinary custom-commissioned mural by a world renowned artist. The living and dining rooms feature modern accents with patterned ceiling details, complimenting the modern design of the home. Off the living room, French doors reveal a wood-paneled library with a cozy fireplace inside. The powder room boasts exquisite Bisazza tiles that create a night sky effect. A modern kitchen complete with upscale Miele appliances includes two dishwashers, microwave, and a 48"" gas cooktop, perfect for family dinners and entertaining. The family room has its own fireplace and motorized lift & swivel 56"" television, while just off the kitchen is an entertainment room and bar. A full sliding door opens up to the exterior entertainment area, saltwater pool, outdoor shower, infrared sauna, and a soaking tub just off the detached guest house. There's also a built-in outdoor kitchen with BBQ grill, sink, and cooktop, along with an outdoor dining area and fireplace for al fresco days and nights. The guest house comes with a customized Murphy bed with attached closet space, flat screen tv, and a towel dryer in a luxurious spa bathroom with a mirrored shower, double sinks, and private water closet. Take the dramatic staircase upstairs where you'll find a spacious primary bedroom complete with its own fireplace and 4 additional bedrooms, each with uniquely designed accents and ensuite bathrooms. Additional amenities include a solar array, a 4-car garage, and high-end sustainable materials. The home has ocean views throughout, along with direct access to hiking trails behind, offering spectacular views of Santa Monica bay.","Tile","Media Room, Living Room, Library, Formal Entry, Family Room, Entry, Sauna, Walk-In Closet, Guest/Maid's Quarters","","","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please email all listing agents for showings requests. Very easy to show. Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Appointment Only ","True","Heated, In Ground","True","","8170","Plans","","CA","Expired","Multi/Split , Two","","","Palos Verdes Dr W","","1328","","","Modern","Conventional","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Bluff, Hills, Ocean","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","1981","90274","1806","PVR1*"
