ificent ocean views and a large balcony. The 3 additional upstairs bedrooms also have a balcony that overlook the large rear yard and pool area. The entry level has 4 sets of large accordion style doors that open up the house to the outside. It gives you a sense that you are sitting on the bluffs. The dining area is connected to the large kitchen. Additionally there is a game room with a pool table, a theater area and a large ocean view living room. All of these downstairs rooms have views of the ocean. There are 2 half bathrooms downstairs, one of which has direct access to the backyard which also services the pool and outdoor kitchen area. Large 3 car garage in the back alley with a large parking pad that can accommodate parking for an additional 5 cars. Elevator ready and ADU potential. Full renovation and addition in 2013. A legacy home with forever views.Seller requests 24 hour notice if possible","","All Bedrooms Up","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call L/A","","","","","4300","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","1640","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","7140","","Single Family Residence","","","Bluff, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, See Remarks","True","","","","1976","90274","1853","PVR1*"
