ctacular views of the Pacific Ocean and Catalina Island that grace this home, providing a stunning backdrop both day and night. The expansive, open floor plan features soaring ceilings and large picture windows, ensuring that natural light fills the home throughout the day. Built for relaxing and entertaining, the home's sliding glass doors seamlessly connect the indoor and outdoor living areas, including a beautifully landscaped courtyard with a large swimming pool and the backyard with its panoramic ocean views. Each generously proportioned room is thoughtfully designed, allowing for effortless flow and connection to the outdoor spaces. Lovingly preserved by the same family since 1977, this custom-designed estate is not just a home; it?s a sanctuary that offers an escape from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. Embrace the epitome of Southern California coastal living in this remarkable estate, where timeless design meets stunning natural beauty. Your dream home awaits!","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. Listing agent must be present for all showings. Please call or text for appointment and provide name, brokerage and DRE#. Please do NOT use Showingtime. Thanks!","","None","False","","3350","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Paseo Del Mar","","2733","","","Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan","","23201","","Single Family Residence","","","Bluff, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, White Water","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/474105","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=LjWDDVLWKTU&brand=0","","1965","90274","4364","PVR1*"
