nds as a sculptural element, embodying cool modern design and making a bold statement.  The floor plan is exceptional and offers a harmonious flow. The kitchen, adorned with a skylight and accentuated by a rock wall, seamlessly blends into the great room, feeling more like a curated piece of furniture than a traditional cooking space. Upstairs, the floating staircase leads to a formal living area and the primary suite, where walls of glass embrace the morning sunlight and reveal views of distant mountains and citylights.  The lower level features two secondary bedrooms, a sleek, remodeled bathroom, and a dedicated office space?perfect for modern living. Numerous recent upgrades include a new roof with paid solar panels, AC split units, aviation ceiling fans upstairs, a tankless gas water heater, remodeled bathrooms, plumbing upgrades, and new flooring. Plumbing has been meticulously maintained, and the property boasts a new clean-out, fresh interior and exterior paint, new gutters, epoxy floors and updated lighting in the garage, newly installed skylights, and a reinforced retaining wall on the north side.  The expansive yard is a private retreat, with lush lawns, several fruit trees and owner has plans to create the outdoor space of your dreams. Located across from a quiet and serene park and close to MonteMalaga Elementary School, this home offers an unparalleled lifestyle and a truly exceptional location.","","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text agent to show.  Seller would prefer showings on Tues, Thurs, Saturday is possible.  Thanks!","True","None","False","","2298","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Acalones","","2345","","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","8652","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/92c6f554-1fbb-4ef8-a4fa-f17df9dac966?wl