 yours. Whether you dream of transforming the existing footprint or developing a glamorous, multi-story estate, this property on Via Arco has all the potential you need. As it stands, this well-kept, single-story, original mid-century modern home is simply awaiting your vision and a bit of TLC to become truly captivating. The current home boasts large open spaces, oversized windows that flood the rooms with natural light, and formal living and family rooms, both featuring cozy fireplaces. The spacious kitchen, complete with a walk-in pantry and breakfast nook, has great potential for culinary enthusiasts, while the large formal dining room with backyard access provides an ideal setting for entertaining. With three bathrooms and an oversized laundry/mudroom, this home is designed for comfort and convenience. Multiple entertaining spaces both inside and out, impressive frontage, a curved horseshoe driveway, and a three-car garage offer endless opportunities to enhance the property?s curb appeal. The real showstopper, however, is the massive, private backyard?a blank canvas ready to be transformed into your own personal oasis. Whether you envision lush gardens, a sparkling pool, or an expansive outdoor living area, this space can accommodate it all. This property has everything in place; it just needs your love and vision to transform it into a stunning masterpiece. Don?t miss out on the chance to create the home of your dreams in one of Palos Verdes Estates' most sought-after neighborhoods.","Tile","Family Room, Foyer, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text 310-614-7650 so I can tell you how to get access. And then go direct, Thanks for showing!","","None","False","True","3000","Estimated","","CA","Expired","One","","","Via Arco","","