age with attached office, or converted back to the third bay!  A long driveway, fruit trees, and a peak of city lights and ocean views are just a few of the amenities.  This may be exactly what you?ve been waiting for!","","Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Please call or TEXT Valerie:  310.704.5164","","None","False","","3129","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Granvia Altamira","","1420","","","","Cash to New Loan","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1972","90274","2131","PVR1*"
