e garage, and a lovely powder room with a make-up counter.  The upper level offers 4 spacious bedrooms; two are primary and guest suites, with private view balconies, walk-in closets, and large baths. The other two share a huge bath.  The private backyard has a gated area for a pool, spa, patios, and grass area. The home is bright and airy with extra wide hallways. It is a great time to add your personal touches and call it your home. It is conveniently located near schools, shopping, and restaurants!  Do not miss this great opportunity!","","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text 310-902-7799. Please do not use showing time, will not be able to confirm, many tks! Most of the times, it will open one day over the weekends, pls. check the listing for open house to the public.","","","","True","4668","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Rincon","","989","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7142","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Pool, White Water","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/470516","","","1990","90274","1627","PVR1YY"
