ionally suited for multi generational living or home offices offering privacy and independence Two main level bedrooms offer convenience and flexibility while a private studio with its own entrance perfect for guests a young adult or creative space All the living spaces open onto the luxuriant  mature tropical landscaping  resort-style backyard is designed for ultimate relaxation and entertainment, abundant natural light, and thoughtful design throughout, just moments from top-rated schools, the private beach club, and world-class golf and tennis. Move-in ready","Tile","Family Room, Formal Entry, Office, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Call or Text LA Office line: LA to be present on all Showing Information: Call Listing Office,Call LA 1,Agent or Owner to be Present ","True","Private, In Ground","True","","5861","Other","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Gabriel","","1325","","","Contemporary","Contract, Conventional","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1976","90274","2022","PVR1YY"
