wood floors, and exquisite Enkeboll Design staircase banisters and molding that elevate the craftsmanship and design.  The formal living and dining rooms overlook beautifully landscaped grounds and panoramic ocean vistas. The chef?s dream kitchen features a Wolf professional range and top-of-the-line stainless steel appliances?ideal for entertaining in style.  The private master suite is a serene retreat, complete with a cozy sitting area, fireplace, and breathtaking views of the gardens and Pacific Ocean. Two spacious family rooms provide flexible living areas, perfect for gatherings and everyday comfort.  The lush backyard is an oasis of tranquility, featuring an expansive brick patio, wood-burning fireplace under a charming open-beam portico, a copper-roofed gazebo, peaceful walking paths, fountains, and meticulously manicured gardens. The resort-style pool and spa, along with built-in BBQ area (gas and wood-burning), make this estate ideal for entertaining year-round.   Offering exceptional design, absolute privacy, and estate-like grounds, this residence embodies the best of Palos Verdes Estates luxury living.  Seller Financing or Lease Option Considered.","Slate","Bonus Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Laundry, Retreat, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call to turn off alarm","True","None","False","","6258","Appraiser","","CA","Expired","Three Or More ","","","Via Arco","","1409","","","Colonial","Cash to New Loan","","8043","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=8Ro7RaXFa7p","https://youtu.be/QCF3dyfHyUU","","1970","90274","2054","PVR1YY"
"","0.3138","1. Please email all offers to the listing agent, Stephen Haw, at skh8828@gmail.com.  2. When the Seller bought the house more than 10 years ago, they were told the square feet of the house is 5,346 sq ft. Public record shows 4,986 sq ft. Buyer to verify.","6 Burner Stove, Built-In Range, Convection Oven, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Gas Range, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Self Cleaning Oven, Warming Drawer, Water Purifier","True","162 - Monte Malaga","Unknown","True","7578021006","","0","","False","6","1","","3","2","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","72","6500000","#ERR","06/20/2024 10:33:29 PM","","","08/31/2024 12:00:00 AM","09/01/2024 1:00:57 AM","","","06/20/2024 12:00:00 AM","","06/26/2024 10:45:20 PM","","08/31/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","72","Double Door Entry, Sliding Doors","False","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","","Glass","True","","","Family Room, Library, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Gas, Wood Burning, See Remarks","True","Stone, Tile, Wood","True","Central, Zoned","True","Balcony, Built-in Features, Chair Railings, Coffered Ceiling(s), Crown Molding, Elevator, Granite Counters, High Ceilings, Living Room Deck Attached, Recessed Lighting, Storage, Sunken Living Room, Wainscoting","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.789068","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","6500000","","","6500000","#ERR","310-544-6100","","skh8828@gmail.com","310-544-6166","Stephen","","","Haw","","VHAWSTE","","","","","V8040","310-544-6166","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","310-544-6100","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.383207","","6","13671","Cul-De-Sac, Garden, Landscaped, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft","Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV24123523","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Paved, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door","True","Deck, Rear Porch, See Remarks","True","63","","None","False","","1215.86","VIEW! VIEW!! VIEW!!! How can you resist the most striking Queen?s Necklace view and mesmerizing vistas that stretches from the Pacific Ocean and Santa Monica Bay, sweeps across the Los Angeles Basin, SoFi Stadium, Hollywood Sign, Downtown LA, all the way to the Long Beach coastline? Nestled on a quiet cul-de-sac street bordering Palos Verdes Estates, this is one of the sought-after homes with a rare street-to-street lot that ensures unobstructed world-class views. With great curb appeal, a private front court welcomes you with a landscaped garden and grassy yard. Once inside, you will be mesmerized by the great views from the walls of glass in all major rooms. This residence also exudes quality, boasting tall ceilings with ornamental coffered designs in the living spaces, view deck & balcony with glass railings, private elevator for easy access, 7 fireplaces to enjoy a cozy day, top quality slate/copper roof and ABS sewage drains. The home is designed with a family-friendly floor plan. Besides the grand living room, spacious formal dining room and the cozy family room, there is also a library/office with built-in cabinets and shelves. The remodeled kitchen is a chef's dream, featuring top-end appliances (Wolf, SubZero, Miele), opulent cabinets and granite counters. Four of the bedrooms are en-suites with fireplace, providing ample privacy and comfort. The primary bedroom is a luxurious retreat with a sitting area, view balcony, walk-in closet and a lavish bathroom adorned with Carrera marble and a steam shower. The 5th bedroom quarter on the main floor has its dedicated adjacent bathroom for convenience. Don?t miss your chance to experience the ultimate joy and luxury in coastal living. This is THE Palos Verdes Coastline view home to own!","","Formal Entry, Foyer, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please contact my team member, Cindy Carter, at 310-388-2533 for all showings.","","","","","5346","Seller","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Sonoma","","6039","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","24712","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, See Remarks","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/467183","https://vimeo.com/974737521/cfe067f08a","Double Pane Windows, Plantation Shutters, Roller Shields","1969","90275","2277","RPRS8000*"
"","1.4963","","Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Electric Oven, Electric Range, Disposal, Gas Water Heater, Water Heater","True","162 - Monte Malaga","Unknown","True","7545014009","","0","","False","3","","","2","1","3","1750","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","201","6529000","#ERR","08/13/2024 12:36:40 PM","","","11/30/2024 12:00:00 AM","12/01/2024 1:02:17 AM","","","08/13/2024 12:00:00 AM","","08/13/2024 12:36:40 PM","","11/30/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","109","","True","Area, Dining Room","","","Partial","True","","","Family Room, Patio","True","Carpet, Vinyl","False","Central, Fireplace(s), Natural Gas, See Remarks","True","Bar, Brick Walls, Built-in Features, High Ceilings, Pantry, Storage, Wet Bar","True","True","Garage Water Pipe","Supra","False","","","","33.790365","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Washer Hookup, Washer Included","True","False","","CC And R's","6529000","","","6529000","#ERR","","","kurt@steffien.com","562-372-3345","Kurt","","0","Steffien","","SSTEFKUR","","0","","0","J02117","","Realty Discount Corporation","800-277-6903","0","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.385336","","F","65179","Back Yard, Cul-De-Sac, Value In Land, Yard","Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s)","Assessor","","","OC24167158","","3","5","","1","Owner","","","","","","","Patio, Patio Open","True","65","","Private, Diving Board, Indoor","True","Close Of Escrow","1820.69","A sprawling custom-built home on an exceptional property with breathtaking views is being offered in the prestigious Montemalaga area of Palos Verdes Estates!  It features a large living room, a round brick castle tower room, three bedrooms (actually four? one is a walkthrough that could be used as an art studio or nursery etc..), three baths, a split-level office/den over a wet bar, two dining areas and a separate entertainment/bonus room.   This single-story ranch-style residence has remarkable brick and woodwork construction.  Outside, there is a pool, built-in grill, and patio that shares the view. All this sits at the end of a cul-de-sac, giving it great privacy. A large circular driveway brings you up to a three-car garage with a workspace and plenty of parking.  This lot is extremely rare and unique. It is over 65,000 square feet, almost 1.5 acres, allowing one to build a large footprint new construction home if desired. Another reason to purchase this property is simply the view! Amazing and unblocked, this view looks at the Queen?s Necklace, downtown Los Angeles and the So-fi center, and the coastline from Redondo up toward Malibu and further west and all the way back across to Long Beach and further to the east with mountains in the distance. This area is desirable for many reasons: schools, safety, areas like Malaga Cove and the beach nearby, access to the LA basin, and fine living. Come see this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!","Wood","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office, Sun, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call Text Kurt at 562-673-3873 for an appointment - Reasonable notice time required by owner. Owner living in the property.","False","None","False","","3586","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Novato","","2521","Place","","Ranch","1031 Exchange, Cash, Conventional, Fannie Mae, FHA, Freddie Mac, VA Loan","","8652","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Panoramic","True","","","","1955","90274","2007","PVR1*"
