,"Auto Driveway Gate, Built-In Storage, Circular Driveway, Direct Garage Access, Electric Vehicle Charging Station(s), Garage Faces Side, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener","True","Deck, Patio Open, Stone","True","75","","Private, Heated, In Ground, Salt Water","True","","1058.76","Privately situated in one of Montemalaga?s most exclusive enclaves. This elegant tennis estate with sweeping ocean views delivers a rare blend of luxury and privacy. Step through the private gates into a majestic foyer featuring a sweeping double staircase and a soaring domed ceiling. Creating an ambiance of elegance from the start, the main level includes a step-down formal living room with rich wood floors. Framing stunning ocean views, the oversized windows are paired with an elegant, carved wood fireplace. With refined stone floors, rich moldings, and tailored built-in cabinetry, this space is designed for effortless, elegant entertaining. At the heart of the home, the gourmet kitchen impresses with a substantial stone island and luxury appliances?including an oversized Sub-Zero fridge, Viking 6-burner range, 3 Thermador ovens, dual dishwashers, a warming drawer, and a spacious butler?s pantry. Blending style and function, the kitchen flows into a sunken family room with a charming fireplace and curved windows, and a bright breakfast room that leads to a lush backyard escape. The backyard is designed for entertaining and relaxation, complete with a pool, spa, cozy gathering spaces with fireplaces and fountains, a newly added bar and built-in barbecue. For tennis lovers, the estate features a court with a spectator area, perfectly positioned to take in both the action and sweeping ocean scenery. Upstairs, the expansive primary suite offers breathtaking views, an attached office or additional bedroom, and a private balcony for relaxing and enjoying the scenery. The primary bathroom serves as a luxurious sanctuary, boasting a generous spa tub, steam sauna shower, and a meticulously rebuilt closet 2 years ago ,cost $80K featuring a premium custom organization system. Host unforgettable gatherings in the game room, complete with a coffered ceiling, built-in bar, and a concealed drop-down screen?all set against a backdrop . On the lower level, a private guest suite with its own entrance offers exceptional comfort and privacy for visitors. Wine connoisseurs will be drawn to the impressive wine room, adorned with custom wood paneling, a pool table, and elegant display cabinetry. Located within a premier school district, with top-rated schools scoring 9-9-10, offering exceptional educational opportunities for all grade levels.","Tile","Formal Entry, Foyer, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","For showings, email or text listing agent Vanessa Zheng to set up an appointment.Owner Occupied. Buyer and Buyer's agent to satisfy themselves and due their own due diligence. Listing agent, seller, and broker do not guarantee permits and square footage.","False","Private","True","","7556","Seller","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Paseo La Cresta","","1502","","","","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","8043","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Panoramic, Park/Greenbelt","True","","","Casement Windows, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Drapes, Skylight(s)","2000","90274","",""
