,"","1215.56","Tucked away on a quiet street in prestigious upper Malaga Cove, this one level home features a sweeping view of Santa Monica Bay and the Queen's Necklace.  This is a complete turn-key remodel, light and open, with skylites, large rooms and an open island kitchen that has every amenity you could want.  The rear garden is exceptionally enchanting with a waterfall emerging from a rock wall, a dreamy path up to a private seating area, complete with fire pit, and a stupendous view from Malibu past downtown LA, queen's necklace, the whole bit.  This house even has (exceedingly rare for PVE) a 4-car garage.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Please call agent if you have a serious buyer or one who has seen the house and is now interested.  House is off the market but seller will still look at offers.","False","None","False","True","2468","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Via Conejo","","809","","","Traditional","Cash, Conventional","","6884","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, See Remarks, Water, White Water","True","","","Casement Windows, Skylight(s)","1951","90274","",""
