s 3 bedrooms and 2 and half bath round out the main level, Views are enjoyed throughout from large floor-to-ceiling windows in the living, dining, kitchen and all bedrooms, including a spacious master suite with walk-in closet and fireplace. Enjoy al fresco dining and entertaining with the coastline views from the wrap-around front deck or in the private rear yard with pool and patio. A unique feature of this special neighborhood. Ideally located with convenient off the hill access, it also offers proximity to charming Malaga Cove Plaza, Palos Verdes Beach and Athletic Club, and a spectacular viewing site for Fourth of July fireworks! Short walking distance to the cliff where the Queen's Necklace view awaits in the distance. Great area for outdoor sports such as hiking, surfing, beach volleyball on RAT beach. Walking distance from Malaga Cove Plaza where you can enjoy cup of coffee or breakfast at the Yellow Vase, shop and bank.","","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Tenant occupied, Showings by appt only, contact listing agent with at least 24 hour's notice, provide pre-approval letter or proof of funds for all showings.","False","None","False","True","2391","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Via Almar","","360","","","Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6886","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Pool, Water","True","","","","1960","90274","","PVR1*"
