that flow throughout the home and alder interior doors, lending an elegant and warm ambiance. The spacious layout is bathed in natural light, thanks to the abundance of skylights, charming French doors and high, beamed ceilings, creating a bright and airy atmosphere. Enjoy breathtaking ocean views from various vantage points, allowing you to savor the beauty of the coastline and ocean breezes right from your own living space. The house boasts multiple patios, perfect for entertaining and offering a seamless extension of the interior living areas. A highlight of this home is the luxurious primary suite, complete with a huge custom walk-in closet to accommodate even the most extensive wardrobe. The spa-like bathroom exudes sophistication with its designer fixtures, soaking tub, two vanities, stone accents and onyx inlaid floors, providing a private oasis for unwinding after a long day. The chef's kitchen features an oversized island that serves as a centerpiece for gathering and meal preparation and hand-crafted Keystone cabinetry. It is quipped with Viking stainless-steel appliances, Sub-zero refrigerator, onyx counters and a stone sink.  Additional features of this home include 3 cozy fireplaces, which create a warm and inviting atmosphere on cooler evenings, a triple car garage for convenient parking and storage, separate laundry room and a hidden loft area. This home offers the perfect blend of history, charm, and modern living. With its proximity to the Plaza, Riviera Village and the stunning coastline, you'll have an array of amenities and recreational opportunities at your fingertips. Don't miss this rare opportunity to own a beautifully remodeled home with ocean views, high-end finishes and an ideal location.","Tile","Bonus Room, Family Room, Loft, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Call agent Cari Corbalis for showing appointments 310-704-4014","True","None","False","","4464","Assessor",