"1591.43","One of the most magnificent views that you will ever see: from the nearby white water all the way to Malibu, including the ocean, beach, queen?s necklace, city, and mountain views. There are amazing outdoor spaces available that are not in the square footage, which include multiple balconies, sitting areas, and huge under-roof outdoor living areas for gatherings. This property offers so much more usable spaces than just the interior square foot! It is a total remodel by the talented Vargas International Properties, from the Apollo double entry iron doors, the Moderno black double frameless garage door, the Anderson full wall sliding doors, the fancy fireplace, the Bosch drip coffee maker with grinder, the beverage cooler, and all top of the line?s appliances and of course with central air, you notice the builder did not want to miss any details. This beautiful home offers a totally open and versatile floor plan with unforgettable, brilliant views. The main level has a one-bedroom suite and downstairs there are 3 bedrooms and two full baths. There is plenty of outdoor space for everyone with his or her own activities and another flat pad in the backyard to relax and enjoy. You will be happily surprised to see how much privacy this home has! Located in the exclusive section of Malaga Cove of PVE, with excellent schools and near shopping, restaurants, walking trails, banks, post-office, market, and golf courses. See to believe! Owner may carry with 50% down! Such an opportunity should not be missed!","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","please do not make appt thru showings time, will not be answered, please text at 310-902-7799 with agent's contact information and time of showing,  all appt need to have overnight notice. Listing office need to be present for all appt per seller's request. Many thanks!!!","","","","","2450","Builder","","CA","E