ke backyard located in the west end of Valmonte?s prestigious grove section.  Featuring an upscale kitchen, open floor plan with 2 living areas, large bedrooms, and an entertainer?s dream of a backyard, you won't ever want to leave home again.  The chef of the house will welcome the sleek new kitchen accentuated by a large central island with waterfall quartz counters, state-of-the-art appliances, and luxurious finishes.  Adjoining the kitchen you?ll find two spacious living areas and a dining room that overlooks the pool.  Upstairs features 4 bedrooms including a primary suite with vaulted ceilings and en-suite bath with dual vanities and both a walk-in shower and separate tub.  There?s even a peek of the blue waters of the Pacific Ocean from several of the rooms.  Outside, there?s a spacious front lawn and the surrounding yard is sprinkled with fruit trees, as well as an edible garden that melds perfectly with the manicured grounds.  There?s no better place to relax after a morning run along the Esplanade or a day at the beach than the perfectly designed backyard with a pool and spa as well as a poolside fire pit and top of the line grill.  What?s more, this location offers the best of both Valmonte and The Beach with its greenery and canopy of trees, while being just a short bike ride to the sand and surf as well as the shops and dining of Riviera village.  With top-rated schools and easy access on and off the hill, come see how a little space can change what coastal living means in Palos Verdes Estates.","Concrete, Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Call Kyle","True","Heated, In Ground","True","True","2460","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Anita","","2415","","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connec