e sparkling pool, relaxing spa, and sweeping canyon views are just the beginning. Step inside to discover soaring vaulted ceilings and a striking floor-to-ceiling fireplace creating an inviting and open space to call home. The thoughtful floor plan includes two spacious living areas and a formal dining room, perfect for both entertaining and everyday living. A bedroom and full bathroom on the lower level provide a comfortable space for guests or the ideal home office. The designer-inspired kitchen showcases premium finishes, luxurious countertops and island, ample cabinetry, and brand-new appliances sure to inspire your inner chef. Upstairs, the primary suite offers a true private retreat, complete with a walk-in closet, spa-like en-suite bathroom with soaking tub, and a private balcony overlooking the pool and canyon. Experience resort-style living in your own backyard ? featuring a sparkling pool and spa, expansive deck, and breathtaking canyon views that provide the perfect backdrop for relaxing or entertaining. Additional highlights include a three-car attached garage, indoor laundry, and thoughtful upgrades throughout that add a designer touch at every turn. Situated in one of the Peninsula?s most desirable enclaves, this exceptional home offers access to top-rated schools, scenic hiking trails, parks, equestrian facilities, and beautiful beaches. This is the Palos Verdes opportunity you?ve been waiting for!","Tile","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please schedule on Showingtime","True","Private, In Ground","True","","3104","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Academy","","26633","","","","1031 Exchange, Cash, Conventional, Submit","","26545","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon","True","","","","1972","90274","",""
