erator drawers, an ice machine, and a long buffet counter, is ideal for outdoor dining or entertainment. This outdoor oasis also includes a hot tub that flows into a sparkling saltwater pool with water features, a mini putting green, a fire pit and a large grassy yard. The property is surrounded by lush greenery, ensuring optimal privacy. The large primary bedroom boasts cathedral ceilings, a walk-in closet, carpeted floors, and an updated bathroom. There are two other generously sized bedrooms and a full bathroom with a jetted bathtub. While tax records indicate four bedrooms, one room has been opened up and converted into additional living space. Upstairs you?ll find a bonus bedroom and a three-quarter bathroom which gives you approximately an additional 625 sqft. Situated on a gated corner lot, this home also features forced air heating and A/C, recessed lighting, vaulted ceilings, skylights, a fireplace, dual water heaters, a heated pool, and ample storage throughout.","Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showings to begin after brokers open house. Easy to show just provide date/time with at least a hour notice. Property was measured through Matterport 3-D virtual tour. The upstairs one bed one bath is unpermitted. Agent is related to the seller.","False","Private, Heated","True","True","2083","See Remarks","","CA","Expired","One","","","Dapplegray","","11","Lane","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","14144","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=wZxAyz8agmA","","","1947","90274","4239","RERA2L"
