o, guest space, or hobby area. Inside, the split-level ranch layout features two bedrooms upstairs and two down, ideal for flexible living arrangements. The primary suite captures stunning, panoramic views of the canyon near Ernie Howlett Park and the snow-dusted San Gabriel Mountains ? a daily reminder of the natural beauty that surrounds you. Perfectly perched on a serene and beautifully landscaped lot, this exceptional residence offers privacy, space, and breathtaking views of city lights, canyons, and rolling hills. Step inside to find an expansive, light-filled floor plan designed for both relaxed everyday living and elegant entertaining. The heart of the home is a stunning kitchen that flows seamlessly into the family room and dining area. A wall of glass opens to the backyard oasis, where lush gardens, a sparkling pool, spa, and large patio offer the ultimate in outdoor living. Mature trees and thoughtful landscaping create a sense of peaceful seclusion, while the elevated position delivers stunning sunsets and twinkling nighttime vistas. Located minutes from award-winning schools, equestrian trails, golf courses, and the best of the Palos Verdes Peninsula, this is the lifestyle property you?ve been waiting to find.","","Jack & Jill","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Property has been taken off the market for sale and listed for lease. Please Call/Text Brett 310-678-7158 with questions.","","","","","2193","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Sugarhill","","4515","Drive","","","Contract, Conventional","","19156","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Mountain(s), Trees/Woods","True","","","","1961","90274","1508","RERA20000*"
