teel appliances and granite countertops with bar-top seating. The dining area blends the kitchen and the outdoor living space perfectly. The backyard is an entertainer's dream. A large pergola includes a TV, speakers, lighting and fans provides a cool shaded area for the summer and electric heaters for the cooler evenings. The wet bar, equipped with refrigerator drawers, an ice machine, and a long buffet counter, is ideal for outdoor dining or entertainment. This outdoor oasis also includes a hot tub that flows into a sparkling saltwater pool with water features, a mini putting green, a fire pit and a large grassy yard. The property is surrounded by lush greenery, ensuring optimal privacy. The large primary bedroom boasts cathedral ceilings, a walk-in closet, carpeted floors, and an updated bathroom. There are two other generously sized bedrooms and a full bathroom with a jetted bathtub. While tax records indicate four bedrooms, one room has been opened up and converted into a den/living space. Upstairs you?ll find a bonus bedroom and a three-quarter bathroom which gives you approximately an additional 800 sqft of unpermitted space. This versatile space can be used for guests, an office, a play area, or storage. Situated on a gated corner lot, this home also features forced air heating and A/C, recessed lighting, vaulted ceilings, skylights, a fireplace, dual water heaters, a heated pool, and ample storage throughout.","Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Owner occupied. DO NOT disturb the owners!! Shown by appt only. DO NOT use showing time!!!","False","Private, Heated","True","True","2002","Taped","","CA","Expired","One","","","Dapplegray","","11","Lane","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","14144","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1947","90274","4239","RE