 for outdoor entertaining or serene solitude. With new drought-tolerant landscaping, ample patio space, and the potential to add a pool, the expansive lot offers endless possibilities for customizing your California dream lifestyle. A standout feature of the property is the fully functional horse facility: two stalls, a tack room, and a large turnout?perfect for horses or even other farm animals. Whether you choose to use it yourself or lease it out, the setup is move-in ready for equestrian enthusiasts and is located just moments from scenic horse trails and community riding amenities. Additional highlights include a two-car garage, an oversized driveway, and charming local wildlife, including resident peacocks. Westfield residents also enjoy access to tennis courts, riding rings, and miles of hiking and riding trails?all just minutes from award-winning schools, coastal attractions, and the best of Palos Verdes living.","","Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Listing Agreement still in place. Please do not contact seller.","True","","","","2445","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Sunnyridge","","27317","Road","","","Cash to New Loan","","17208","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Hills, Neighborhood","True","","","","1956","90274","4036","LCRA2L"
