ping, Lawn, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Irregular Lot, Secluded, Sprinkler System, Sprinklers In Front, Sprinklers In Rear, Sprinklers Timer, Yard","Biking , Horse Trails, Rural","","Assessor","","","PV24008009","0","3","3","2","1","Owner","310-831-6764","","310-977-5848","Gazebo, Shed(s)","Direct Garage Access, Asphalt, Paved, Driveway Down Slope From Street, Garage Faces Front, Workshop in Garage","True","","","32","","Private, Gas Heat, In Ground, Pebble","True","","1263.84","This beautiful one level property on a cul-de-sac has a breathtaking view of various cities, including L.A. from the primary bedroom, living room, kitchen, den and guest room.  The view spans from the ocean, from Santa Monica across the mountain ranges to Saddleback mountain. It is a secluded lot, overlooking the sparkling pool, lawn and gazebo. Lots of deck areas, with interlocking pavers, providing room for large gatherings, which have included parties of a 100 people! There is a firepit, which you can sit around and watch the fireworks on July 4th. From the other windows in the living room and office (or 4th bedroom) is a serene view of the fully landscaped yard. The primary bedroom, ensuite, is at one end of the house. The office or bedroom (also ensuite) is in the middle section of the home, the two other bedrooms are at the opposite end of the house.  The third bathroom has a door to the outside, with access to the backyard and pool, as does the den, dining room, living room and primary bedroom. There is a small private courtyard off the breezeway, which is next to the laundry room, making it easy access for your wet swimsuits! There is a three-car garage and a large motor court with plenty of parking. Custom built cabinets in both garages providing lots of storage. Overhead shelving in the large garage which also has fully equipped workshop with counter space and shelving. The house is equipped with fully paid 32 panels of solar installed this year.","Rolled/Hot Mop, Tar/Gravel","All Bedroo