n is a chef's delight with Viking appliances, beverage center, farmhouse style stainless steel sink, an oversized island, Quartz countertops, along with marble backsplash and a pot filler. In addition to an oversized drive through 2 car garage, an additional detached 4 car garage in the back can be converted into a guest house, game room, workshop, horse barn or storage. The humongous field in the back is ready for, whether be horse sheds, stalls, riding arena, aviary, bee hives, greenhouse, veggie beds, fruit orchard, mini golf or even a 300 feet long zipline. Horses, goats, cows, chicken, bees! The bridle trail in the back, provides access to Ernie Howlett Park, Peter Weber Equestrian Center, South Coast Botanical Gardens, and the main PV Landfill preserve.","","Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Foyer, Game Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","contact listing agents","True","","","True","3403","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Moccasin","","35","Lane","","English, Tudor","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","31170","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Park/Greenbelt, Pasture","True","https://vimeo.com/861415091?share=copy","","","1974","90274","2506","RERA20000*"
