"","0.6768","PLEASE DO NOT CALL SELLERS DIRECTLY.  They will NOT be selling or leasing the property at this time.  Please be respectful of their request.","Dishwasher, Disposal","True","165 - PV Dr North","Unknown","True","7551019015","Horse Trails","260","","False","6","1","","4","1","5","","Rolling Hills Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","159","3499950","#ERR","08/07/2024 4:49:05 PM","","10/22/2024 12:12:26 PM","01/13/2025 12:00:00 AM","02/28/2026 1:00:55 AM","","","08/06/2024 12:00:00 AM","","08/07/2024 4:49:05 PM","","02/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","01/13/2025 12:00:00 AM","","159","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","","","","","","Living Room","True","Carpet, Tile, Wood","True","","","","True","True","Front Door","Combo","False","","","","33.776834","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","3499950","All Staging furniture and accessories","","4195000","#ERR","310-548-2881","","lbacelic@yahoo.com","310-807-9204","Lidija","310-831-2449","","Bacelic","","SBACELID","","","","","S4926","310-832-8621","Golden West Realty","310-548-2881","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.33354","","36","29483","0-1 Unit/Acre","Horse Trails, Stable(s), Rural","","Assessor","","","SB24162279","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","75","","None","False","","1065.11","PER SELLERS REQUEST, PLEASE DO NOT CALL THEM DIRECTLY REGARDING THIS PROPERTY.  Any questions to be directed to the listing agent. This stunning property is a true gem in Rolling Hills Estates, offering a blend of rustic luxury and modern amenities.  Fully remodeled it features a striking vaulted entryway that sets the tone for the rest of the home.  Inside, the modern Spanish ranch style is highlighted by high beam ceilings in the great room and exquisite details like rich cabinetry and a copper farmhouse sink in the beautifully appointed gourmet kitchen.  The home boasts 5 spacious bedrooms, each with ample closet space, including a primary suite with a large walk-in closet and a dual vanity bathroom.  The back patio is a highlight, complete with full outdoor kitchen and sweeping canyon views-ideal for entertaining and family gatherings.  The backyard is a true oasis, featuring multiple seating areas, garden spaces and a firepit for cozy nights.  For those with equestrian interests, the property includes a 2 stall barn (expandable to 3 stalls) and a large feed and tack room.  The lush professionally landscaped grounds include grassy terraces that lead to the barn which is conveniently located near the riding ring.  Additionally, a detached casita provides options for a home gym or ???.  This unique property combines luxury, functionality, and a connection to nature, making it a rare find in this most desirable area.  Don't miss out on this opportunity to own a piece of rural paradise.","","Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please contact listing agent for combo code","","","","","3286","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Buckskin","","73","Lane","","","Cash to New Loan","","14144","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","","","","1948","90274","",""
"","1.2898","*****PLEASE READ ALL OF THE REMARKS***** For FASTEST RESPONSE, TEXT questions to 310.622.4819******Property Website http://www.9ponderosalane.com/****** Offers to be submitted to Offers@RussellRealtyGrp.com - include pre-approval, proof of funds, and RPA. Please do not send a client letter. EMD must be 3% of the purchase price. The buyer must cross-qualify by contacting the lender, Diego Arias at We Fund LA, 562.371.7339 Broker/Agent does not guarantee the accuracy of square footage, lot size, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools, and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. The buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals.","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Gas Oven, Gas Range, Refrigerator, Tankless Water Heater","True","165 - PV Dr North","Unknown","True","7548001037","","0","","False","5","","","2","3","5","","Rolling Hills Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","70","3599000","#ERR","04/03/2023 10:11:01 AM","","","04/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/24/2023 1:00:32 AM","","","04/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","","07/22/2023 6:18:45 AM","","07/23/2023 12:00:00 AM","04/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","","17","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Family Kitchen, Dining Room","","","","","","","Living Room","True","Stone","True","Central","True","Balcony, Bar, Beamed Ceilings, Crown Molding, Granite Counters, High Ceilings, Open Floorplan, Pantry, Wet Bar","True","True","See Showing Confirmation","See Remarks, Supra","False","","","","33.794325","Individual Room","True","False","","","3599000","","","3599000","#ERR","3106224819","","Offers@RussellRealtyGrp.com","","Jeff","","","Russell","","OCRUSSJEF","","","","","OC03224","000-000-0000","eXp Realty of California Inc","888-584-9427","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.365454","","5","56185","Back Yard, Cul-De-Sac, Sloped Down, Front Yard, Garden, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Sprinkler System","Horse Trails","","Assessor","","","OC23051175","","3","6","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Three Door","True","Concrete, Deck","True","1","","Private, In Ground","True","","783.07","Nestled on one of the most coveted streets in Rolling Hills Estates, this beautiful property graces a peaceful, friendly cul-de-sac close to the beach, where homes are seldom available. Boasting five bedrooms, including dual master suites on separate floors, five bathrooms, a three-car garage, and a recently replaced roof, this home is truly exceptional. The lower-level features three bedrooms, one being a master suite with a jacuzzi tub and vaulted ceilings that open to the newly installed pool and jacuzzi, complete with waterfall elements and customizable lighting (2022). A sizable deck, perfect for entertaining, adds to the allure. The home has undergone tasteful upgrades, showcasing a large kitchen with an island, a commercial-grade gas range, and a brand-new sub-zero refrigerator. A formal dining room, a grand room with slate flooring and an attached wet bar, and an inviting living room with a fireplace that provides direct access to the pool area complete the downstairs. Ascend the staircase to find two more bedrooms, including a generous master suite with dual sinks and closets. Both bedrooms feature a walk-out covered patio where you can enjoy morning coffee while enjoying the serene views of trees and a horse trail. The upper level also includes a versatile space suitable for an office or gym, conveniently located next to the laundry room. Set on an oversized, nearly half an acre of land, this home offers a distinctive and expansive backyard. The lower yard is especially noteworthy, as it provides ample space for constructing a sizable ADU with maximum privacy, its own yard, and frontage along a tranquil horse trail ? perfect for in-law quarters or additional living space. Currently, an enchanting 8' x 12' playhouse with a basement resides in the lower yard, accompanied by various fruit trees and a spacious area for a large chess game or a basketball court. Option for private access to the bridal trail and equestrian trails. Elegant estate property on such a unique street is few and far between, making this well-maintained home, cherished by its current owner for over 40 years, a rare gem. Seize the opportunity to create lasting memories in this exquisite residence for years to come.","Composition","Attic, Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","PLEASE READ ALL OF THE INSTRUCTIONS***** TEXT Questions to 310.622.4819***** ***PUBLIC OPEN HOUSE FROM 1-4 PM ON SATURDAY APRIL 8TH*** SHOWINGS and REQUESTS BEGIN ON SUNDAY, APRIL 9TH ***Before a showing is requested client registration is required and preapproval/proof of funds must be sent to Offers@RussellRealtyGrp.com. Your showing will be canceled if this is not followed********** To schedule a showing, schedule with ShowingTime 800-SHOWING, (800-746-9464) OR USE THE SHOWINGTIME APP, ONLY. TheMLS users do not use SHOWINGPLUS, CALL SHOWINGTIME.","","Private","True","True","4596","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Ponderosa","","9","Lane","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","22919","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=GgpF8URpqF1","","Double Pane Windows, Wood Frames","1970","90274","1522","RERA20000*"
