"1086.53","Nestled within the private gated community of Rolling Hills, this beautifully remodeled single-level home offers breathtaking panoramic valley views and an unparalleled sense of tranquility. From the moment you arrive, a circular driveway welcomes you to this exceptional retreat, where soaring ceilings with hand-hewn beams and elegant French oak wood floors create a warm and inviting ambiance. Designed for both comfort and entertaining, the living and family rooms each feature a fireplace and seamlessly flow into the stunning, light-filled kitchen. A true chef?s dream, the fully updated kitchen boasts marble countertops, a spacious center island, high-end Sub-Zero appliances, and custom cabinetry?perfect for preparing meals while taking in the scenic backdrop. Expansive sliding glass doors open to a sun-drenched back patio, where you'll be captivated by sweeping valley views. Whether enjoying your morning coffee as hawks glide overhead or unwinding in the in-ground spa as the sun sets, this private outdoor oasis is designed to embrace the beauty of its surroundings. The luxurious primary suite offers a tranquil escape, complete with its own fireplace and a thoughtfully designed private bath with double sinks and a walk-in shower. Additional highlights include a dedicated laundry room, air conditioning, and a two-car garage equipped with a Tesla charger. Offering a serene country lifestyle with the convenience of nearby city access, this exceptional home is a rare opportunity to experience luxury living in one of Rolling Hills? most coveted locations.","","Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text or email Cat Clendenning 310-498-9042 or c.clendenning@compass.com.","False","Private","True","","3028","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Chuckwagon Road","","34