"","1.1616","HOA dues are calculated based on assessed value.","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Tankless Water Heater, Vented Exhaust Fan, Water Line to Refrigerator, Water Purifier","True","166 - Rolling Hills","None","False","7567014002","Pickleball, Tennis Court(s), Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Guard, Controlled Access","4995","","False","4","0","0","2","2","5","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","133","4795000","#ERR","02/26/2025 12:54:41 PM","","05/01/2025 2:06:24 PM","08/08/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/15/2025 5:22:16 AM","","","02/26/2025 12:00:00 AM","","04/03/2025 8:16:23 AM","","08/08/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/08/2025 12:00:00 AM","","133","","False","","","","None","False","","","Living Room","True","Tile, Wood","True","Central","True","Beamed Ceilings, Built-in Features, High Ceilings, Recessed Lighting","True","True","","None, See Remarks","False","","","","33.75888","Gas & Electric Dryer Hookup, Individual Room, Washer Hookup","True","False","","","4795000","","","4995000","#ERR","(626) 378-8850","","winniechiuhome@gmail.com","","Winnie","","","Chiu","","p20322","","","","","PF069","(626) 440-0455","Coldwell Banker Realty","(626) 584-0050","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.346528","","n/a","50598","","Hiking , Horse Trails, Suburban","",""," ","","P1-21007","","3","3","","","Owner","","","","","Circular Driveway, Direct Garage Access, Driveway - Brick, Garage, Garage Door Opener","True","Concrete, Deck, Patio, Patio Open, Stone, Terrace, Tile, Wrap Around","True","39","","Private, Gunite, Heated, In Ground, Infinity, Waterfall","True","Close Of Escrow, Negotiable","1394.3","Welcome to this stunning contemporary ranch-style estate nestled within the exclusive gated community of Rolling Hills.  This single level home offers unparalleled luxury, with a focus on beauty, ambiance, and expansive views. From the nearby canyon to the Pacific Ocean to the Malibu coastline, majestic mountains, and sparkling city lights of downtown Los Angeles, and the iconic Hollywood sign--this home provides a private seat to some of Los Angeles' most picturesque landscapes.  Originally built in 1964 and fully reimagined down to the studs in 2020, updates including dual-zone HVAC, plumbing, electrical systems, roof, energy efficient dual-pane windows and sliding doors.  Inside Cathedral ceilings adorned with skylights, custom cabinetry, millwork, tile, and hardwood flooring throughout.  With an open and inviting layout designed for effortless living and entertaining.  The expansive great room, encompassing the living and dining areas, is anchored by a striking library wall with a rolling ladder and a massive wall of glass, framing the unparalleled views that surround the home.  The chef's kitchen is a culinary masterpiece, featuring vaulted ceilings, quartz countertops, state-of-the-art appliances, a generous central island, and custom cabinetry. Adjacent to the kitchen, a walk-in pantry and a wine fridge/bar counter make entertaining a breeze.  The spacious primary suite is a true sanctuary, with relaxing views, two walk-in closets, and a spa-like bathroom, one additional en-suite bedroom, and a bedroom with direct access to a hallway bath, plus two additional bedrooms that share another hallway bathroom.  Outside, the meticulously designed grounds provide the perfect setting for relaxation and entertainment.  Terraced patios with dining, sunning, and seating areas surround the home, with lush rose gardens enhancing the tranquil ambiance.  The crown jewel is the 30-foot infinity-edge pool and spa, finished with white marble and blue glass pebble tiles, complemented by four cascading waterfalls.  A circular paver driveway and three-car garage offers ample storage and parking space, Direct access to hundreds of acres of horse trails and equestrian zoning, this is a once in a lifetime opportunity to own a piece of paradise.  Don't miss your chance to make this dream home yours.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Laundry, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","No open houses, appointment only.  Agent to be present please text/call Winnie with time/date to schedule showing, ID required to enter the city's security gate.","","","True","True","3439","Other","","CA","Expired","One","","","El Concho Lane","","2","Lane","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Trees/Woods","True","","","","2020","90274","",""
