"","2.0737","SHOWING BY APPOINTMENT ONLY. For questions/showings, please contact Sam McColgan 213-705-4694 or Trey Alligood 310.876.9699. Seller has renderings for an incredible infinity pool. Seller, broker, and broker's agents do not represent or guarantee the accuracy of the square footage, bedroom/bathroom count, lot size or lot lines/dimensions, permitted or unpermitted spaces, school boundary lines or eligibility, or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information. AGENT MUST HAVE A GATE PASS, NO EXCEPTIONS. HOA dues are based on $.20 per $100 of assessed value.","Barbecue, Dishwasher, Disposal, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Water Purifier","True","166 - Rolling Hills","","False","7567015016","Tennis Court(s), Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Trash, Security","924","","","6","2","0","0","4","5","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","213-705-4694","","Sam.McColgan@elliman.com","","Sam","","","McColgan","CLW-C138186","","","","","","CLW-X80715","310-595-3888","Douglas Elliman","310-595-3888","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","230","6988000","#ERR","10/21/2023 2:04:58 PM","","","12/31/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/01/2025 5:42:25 AM","","","10/21/2023 12:00:00 AM","","04/30/2024 5:27:41 PM","","12/31/2024 12:00:00 AM","06/07/2024 12:00:00 AM","","230","Sliding Doors","","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Breakfast Nook, Dining Room, In Kitchen, In Living Room","","","","","","","Den, Dining Room, Living Room, Patio, Gas, Fire Pit, Great Room","True","Wood","","Central","True","High Ceilings, Home Automation System, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting, Wet Bar","True","True","","","","","","","33.756994","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Included","True","False","","","6988000","","","6988000","#ERR","310-876-9699","","Trey@TheAlligoodGroup.com","310-482-2201","Trey","","","Alligood","","CLW-C133085","","","","","CLW-X80715","310-595-3888","Douglas Elliman","310-595-3888","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.345201","232x400","","90332","Back Yard, Front Yard, Horse Property, Landscaped, Lawn, Secluded, Yard","","24 Hour Security, Automatic Gate, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Gated Community, Gated with Guard, Guarded","Assessor","","","23323903","","3","9","","","Owner","","","","Guest House","Driveway, Garage - Three Door, Private, Uncovered","True","","","49","","Heated, In Ground, Waterfall","","Close Of Escrow","1373.16","Step inside this captivating 5 bedroom 6 bathroom retreat, nestled in the exclusive guard-gated community of Rolling Hills, California. This stunning property offers a perfect blend of luxurious living and natural beauty spanning 2+ acres. Recently renovated by Architect Miles Pritzkat, this serene oasis offers breathtaking coastline and city views while providing an unparalleled opportunity to experience the ultimate Southern California lifestyle. This meticulously crafted residence boasts impressive architecture that seamlessly blends classic charm with modern sophistication. Every aspect of this home exudes timeless and thoughtfully designed interiors perfect for entertaining guests and enjoying moments of relaxation with family. The open floor plan creates a seamless indoor/outdoor flow between the living, dining, and kitchen areas, making it perfect for hosting gatherings. Embrace the picturesque beauty of the lush landscape, take a refreshing dip in the sparkling swimming pool, or unwind in the soothing spa while enjoying the stunning views that stretch to the horizon. Whether you're practicing your putting game on the green, playing tennis, basketball, or hockey in your own private sports court, or working out in your private gym, this home has it all! The gourmet kitchen is a chef's dream come true, featuring top-of-the-line Thermadore appliances, sleek marble countertops, and an abundance of storage space. The kitchen's design emphasizes functionality and style, making it a focal point for culinary enthusiasts. Keep all of your favorite wines in your temperature-controlled wine room, and use the outdoor kitchen for all of your summer BBQ's. The spacious primary suite offers a private sanctuary with a luxurious ensuite bathroom, a massive walk-in closet/loft, and private outdoor space. The main house has 3 more spacious guest bedrooms with large closets and recessed lighting. The guest house off the pool area is perfect for an in-law suite or live-in Nanny. This home operates on a paid-off TeslaSolar system with backup batteries that will keep your monthly energy cost extremely low. As a resident of Rolling Hills, you'll enjoy an exclusive and secure environment with access to one of the best school systems in California, various community amenities, including equestrian trails, tennis courts, and hiking paths, providing an opportunity to embrace an active and healthy lifestyle. Experience the luxury, tranquility, and natural beauty that await in this remarkable oasis, and don't miss the chance to make this enchanting property your dream home. Schedule a private tour today and witness firsthand the allure of living at 4 Buckboard Ln, Rolling Hills, CA.","Shingle","Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Living Room, Loft, Office, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Agent or Owner to be Present,Appointment Only,Text LA 1,Text LA 2 ","False","Private, Bath, Heated, In Ground","True","","5089","","","CA","Expired","One","","","Buckboard","","4","Lane","","Mid Century Modern","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Valley","True","https://youtu.be/ZJDFhcau7JI?feature=shared","","Skylight(s)","1964","90274","5235","RHRAS2"
