"","5.0312","Co-Listed with The Altman Brothers / Douglas Elliman.  323-791-9398","","","166 - Rolling Hills","Unknown","True","7569007011","Pickleball, Tennis Court(s), Horse Trails, Controlled Access","22000","","False","6","1","","","5","5","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","Josh@TheAltmanBrothers.com","","Joshua","310-819-3250","","Altman","OCALTJOSH","","","","","","OC08142","310-595-3887","Douglas Elliman of California","310-595-3888","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Co-Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","311","11000000","#ERR","11/27/2023 5:00:35 PM","","","05/04/2024 12:00:00 AM","05/05/2024 1:00:29 AM","","","11/27/2023 12:00:00 AM","","11/30/2023 11:13:36 AM","","05/04/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","159","","False","","","","","","","","Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","","True","Central","True","Living Room Deck Attached","True","True","NA","None","False","","","","33.76324","Individual Room","True","False","","","11000000","","","11000000","#ERR","310-493-7216","","chris@chrisadlam.com","","Chris","","","Adlam","","VADLACHR","","","","","V8107","310-265-8889","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","310-541-8271","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.348693","","104","219158","Horse Property, Lot Over 40000 Sqft","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Stable(s), Suburban","Gated with Attendant, Gated Community","Assessor","","","PV23217047","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","","","Patio, Front Porch","True","22","","Private","True","","1774.19","Situated on 5 sprawling acres in the heart of Rolling Hills, this expansive, private estate was built for renowned developer, Ernest Hahn as his personal residence.  Featuring spectacular coastline and city lights views, the current owners planted approximately 2,500 Chardonnay and Pinot Noir vines, 85 olive trees as well as a formal herb garden and citrus orchard on the property.  The grounds also include a swimming pool, spa, outdoor kitchen with pizza oven and fire pit.  The main house includes 4 bedrooms plus an office, large living areas and a gourmet kitchen; walls of glass optimize the views.  A spacious guest house, an oversized garage, a wine cellar and a private sports court are just a few of the other amenities.  Continuously recognized as one of the safest cities in the US, the gated city of Rolling Hills has three entrances, miles of hiking and riding trails, as well as community tennis and pickleball courts.  Located just minutes from South Bay beaches, downtown and Beverly Hills, Rolling Hills is located on the Palos Verdes Peninsula, which is known for its award winning schools, wonderful views and extensive horse trails.  Some of the room are ""virtually staged"".","","Family Room, Kitchen, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","Please contact Valerie for all showings.  310.704.5164","","Private","True","","6200","Estimated","","CA","Expired","One","","","Portuguese Bend","","30","Road","","Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan","","6705","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://brokerageengine.s3.amazonaws.com/listing-media/vistasir/1705607379898_30-PORTUGUESE-BEND---NO-GRAPHICS.mp4","","","1970","90274","5053","RHRAS2*"
"","5.03","DO NOT CONTACT OWNERS. The listing Broker/Agent doesn't guarantee the accuracy of square footage, bed/bath count, lot size, permit info, descriptions herein, or other info re: the conditions/features of property provided by the seller or obtained from Public Records/other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all info through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals. Per the assessor office, square footage of the house is 4581. HOA DUES are based on purchase price: $0.21 per thousand.","Barbecue","True","166 - Rolling Hills","","","7569007011","","0","","","6","1","0","0","5","5","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","310-990-8892","","freddy.thomas@theagencyre.com","","Fred","","","Thomas","CLW-C135545","","","","","","CLW-X7901306","","The Agency","818-379-7700","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","152","13500000","#ERR","05/09/2023 4:46:20 PM","","08/11/2023 6:22:20 PM","10/08/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/09/2023 2:11:16 AM","","","05/09/2023 12:00:00 AM","","10/09/2023 2:11:16 AM","","10/08/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","152","","","","","","","","","","Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Wood, Tile","","Central","True","","True","True","","","","","","","33.763302","Washer Included, Dryer Included, Inside","True","","","","13500000","","","14750000","#ERR","424-230-3712","","Farrah@TheAgencyRE.com","","Farrah","","","Brittany","","CLW-C112210","","","","","CLW-X79013","424-230-3720","The Agency","424-230-3700","","Seller Reserved","-118.348993","566x320","","219107","Horse Property, Front Yard, Lawn, Ranch, Secluded, Landscaped","","24 Hour Security, Gated with Guard","","","","23267723","","","10","","","","","","","","Driveway, Covered","True","Covered","True","40","","In Ground, Private","True","","2177.42","A reverie come true, 30 Portuguese Bend Rd enjoys a double-gated, private setting on more than 5 acres in the Rancho Palos Verdes gated equestrian community of Rolling Hills. This enchanting property boasts unprecedented ocean views of the Queen's Necklace and city views from every room. The updated 5-bed, 5.5-bath, ~6,200-SF 1-level home was designed by the world-renowned mid-century architect Ernest Hahn. Brimming with inspired amenities and above-and-beyond conveniences, this retreat is made to exceed every expectation. A host-ready chef's kitchen is equipped with a Wolf range, dual Sub-Zero refrigerators and a wine fridge. Outside, find a covered dining porch, a pool, barbeque, firepit and pizza oven. Unlike anything else, the ranch also encompasses a guest house, stables, tennis court, chapel, fruit orchards, olive trees and active vineyards that have produced award-winning wines. While 30 Portuguese Bend is steeped in dreamy privacy, it's a short distance from the best offerings of Hermosa, Redondo and Manhattan Beach.","","Family Room, Primary Bathroom, Office","","","","","","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please email LA2 AND LA3 with all showing requests, including buyer name and date/time of showing request. Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call LA 2,Call LA 3 ","","In Ground, Private","True","","6200","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Portuguese Bend","","30","Road","","Ranch","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Ocean, Coastline, Panoramic, Pasture, Vineyard, Water","True","","","","1970","90274","5053","RHRAS2*"
