e Of Escrow","574.35","Welcome to an entertainer's dream with unobstructed ocean views spanning from Orange County to Los Angeles. Nestled in the desirable community of La Vista Verde in the City of Rancho Palos Verdes, this stunning property offers the perfect blend of comfort and luxury. With 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, this home provides ample space for relaxation and entertainment. The North Wing boasts two primary bedrooms, each offering breathtaking views and their own private bathrooms. The South Wing features two additional bedrooms and a bathroom, ensuring plenty of space for family and guests. The living room, serving as the focal point of the home, elegantly separates the sleeping quarters, creating a harmonious balance. Every room in this home is equipped with its own mini-split for AC/Heat, allowing for personalized climate control and comfort. The spacious front yard and backyard provide the perfect backdrop for outdoor gatherings, offering endless opportunities for relaxation and entertainment.While the property currently operates on a septic system, you also have the option to tie into the sewer. This flexibility ensures convenience and ease of maintenance for the future owner. With its remarkable ocean views, spacious layout, and exceptional value per square foot, this property represents the best opportunity in the city. Don't miss out on the chance to make this exceptional home your own. Schedule a showing today and experience the epitome of coastal living in Rancho Palos Verdes.","","Kitchen, Living Room, Two Primaries","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please schedule via Showingtime and go direct.","True","","","","2784","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Avenida Corona","","40","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, FHA","","000","","Single Family Residence","","","Marina, Ocean, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","","","","1960","90275","6328","RPRS20000*"
