e home welcomes you with marble tile floors and a bright, inviting layout. The living room features a cozy fireplace and flows seamlessly into the formal dining area, both filled with natural light from large windows and sliding glass doors that open to a balcony overlooking the lush backyard with spectacular canyon views. The kitchen has been the setting for countless homemade meals and includes a charming breakfast nook, perfect for casual dining or morning coffee with a view of the front courtyard. Upstairs, the bedrooms offer peekaboo views of the harbor, mountains, and city lights, providing a serene retreat. On the lower level, you?ll find a spacious family room with a second fireplace and a built-in bar, adding an additional 126 sq ft of living space. A large sliding glass door leads directly to the beautiful backyard, making indoor-outdoor living effortless. The backyard is an entertainer?s dream, with open space for gatherings, a basketball hoop, and mature tangerine and grapefruit trees. This level also includes a fourth bedroom and full bathroom, ideal for guests, in-laws, or multi-generational living. Lovingly owned by the same family for 53 years, this home has been the setting for countless cherished memories. Located in the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District and just minutes from hiking trails, shopping, and dining, this is a rare opportunity you don?t want to miss. Make 6604 Via Siena your next home and start creating your own memories today.","Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Supra located on front gate. Use Showingtime to schedule appointment, then go direct. Seller is motivated. Inquire about a 2-1 buy down option","True","None","False","True","2539","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Siena","","6604","","","Traditi