d by the inviting atmosphere and a refreshing pool. As you make your way through the thoughtfully designed interior, you'll find a well-appointed kitchen and a spacious living area. The home comes complete with not one, but two solar power systems, one of which is exclusively dedicated to the electric car charging station, making it a sustainable and eco-friendly choice. Venture outdoors to discover your own private oasis, featuring a pool and gorgeous view perfect for relaxation and entertaining. Enjoy the convenience of having a washer and dryer in-unit and revel in the comfort provided by the air conditioning. With ample private outdoor space and included parking, this home offers the ideal setting for a laid-back California lifestyle. Located in the sought-after Rancho Palos Verdes, this residence is a rare find. This home has character, the view, great yard, nice size lot, two car garage that can be used as an office space,  fabulous pool and more! Experience the tranquility and convenience of this location while being just a short distance from local amenities. Don't miss the opportunity to call this delightful property home.","Spanish Tile","Den, Entry, Family Room, Galley Kitchen, Jack & Jill, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office, Sun","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please call Paula to schedule a showing. The property is in the process of being rented at the moment. TY!","True","","","True","1534","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Stirrup","","16","Road","","Mid Century Modern, Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Fannie Mae, FHA, FHA 203(b), FHA 203(k), Freddie Mac, USDA Loan, VA Loan","","18220","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Cable Connected, Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Phone Available, Phone Connected, Sewer Available, Water Available, Water Connected","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic