, Curbs, Hiking , Horse Trails, Preserve/Public Land","Security Lights, Security System, Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SB23085166","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","Workshop","Driveway, Driveway Up Slope From Street, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door, Garage Door Opener, Electric Vehicle Charging Station(s)","True","Front Porch, See Remarks","True","47","","None","False","Negotiable","842.46","Set well above the sweeping Miraleste Trail & Drive, with long & wide views of the Los Angeles Harbor, and a taste of the open waters to Catalina, lives 4121 Miraleste Drive. This Spanish 4 Bed, 3 Full Bathroom Encanto provides your family with a private sanctuary with which to retreat to. Laid out in its 2,374? is a wonderfully accommodating floorplan, with formal dining & living rooms, an open concept kitchen & family room, and an in-law wing with its own French door access, side door entry, and glass-enclosed shower bathroom.  Across the home diagonally sits the relaxation of the Primary Suite, with a fully built-out walk-in closet, and a double vanity bathroom with an individual soaking tub and glass standing shower, separate from the water closet as nature intended. This suite sits at the end of a long hallway which also contains two bedrooms which have the benefit of a shared hollywood bathroom with double vanities, and a water closet with tub & shower separated by a door for proper efficiency of sibling use. At its heart, the family room opens to the vine-covered and cafe-light sparkling wrought-iron arbor that extends the length between the bedroom wing, and the dining wing. All three of these rooms provide beautiful glass French Door access to this enchanting space, which in its current use accommodates a romantic conversation set and the warmth of a fire table perfect for bringing together friends and family alike. For those who WFH, your commute now becomes a walk through the chirping birds and open vines of the rear courtyard, along the flagstone stepped path through the fruit-bearing trees of the back yard, to your very own detached office ADU, and for those of you that still take to the road, you?ll find the steps down to your tiled garage an easy place to charge your electric vehicle with its built-in dedicated EV outlet, in the wide two car garage, all at arm's length access to the 110 highway and downtown Los Angeles. End your days at the bar with built-in wine storage, after coming home to the peace of an acoustically-sealed home, and the sounds of your favorite musicians playing throughout the entire house with its built-in sound system, available in practically every room. Finally, tuck in safe and sound with the included smart home system, with access to alarms, lights, locks, and cameras inside & out via a touchscreen wall panel and iPhone app. Make your dream of tranquility in Rancho Palos Verdes a reality, with 4121 Miraleste Drive.","Spanish Tile","Attic, Basement, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Retreat, See Remarks, Separate Family Room, Sun, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Easy to show! Call Stephen to show, need a 1 hour advance notice to show.","True","None","False","True","2374","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","S","","Miraleste","","4121","Drive","","Spanish","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","7145","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Water Connected","City Lights, Harbor, Marina, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Park/Greenbelt, Peek-A-Boo, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","https://app.cloudpano.com/tours/0Re7VGQdl?mls=1","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows, Insulated Windows, 