itional bedrooms share an expansive south facing deck that boast sweeping ocean views and provide versatility for guests, a home office, or a personal gym, ensuring ample space for every need. Additional upgraded features include Tesla charger, luxury vinyl flooring throughout, newer light fixtures and recessed lighting, recently painted interior and exterior and more. Located in the quiet neighborhood of Miraleste Hills, this home is not far from prestigious schools, shopping, dining, and recreational amenities and offers the ultimate coastal lifestyle. Don't miss your chance to own this remarkable residence and experience the unparalleled beauty of Southern California living.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Must contact L/A or Co-L/A to schedule an appointment to show. L/A or Co-L/A must accompany. Please text or call L/A Sloane: 310-874-4106 or CoL/A Kathleen: 310-874-4005.","True","None","False","True","2711","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Three Or More ","","","Knoll View","","30047","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27625","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Plantation Shutters, Screens, Tinted Windows","1968","90275","6441","RPRS20000*"
