r hosting movie nights, this home has all the space you need for any activity.  Every inch of the home has been thoughtfully reimagined with premium finishes and exceptional attention to detail. The chef's kitchen has been fully remodeled with sleek countertops, high-end appliances, and ample storage, and an incredible amount of counter space seamlessly flowing into open living spaces designed for both entertaining and relaxation. Each of the bathrooms reflects spa-like elegance, while the bedrooms provide tranquil retreats for family members or guests. Upstairs in the spacious living area, breathtaking views of the port add a serene and picturesque touch to the home's luxurious ambiance.The attached guest house, with its own private entry, features two fully remodeled bedrooms and bathroom, laundry room, and modern kitchen. This self-contained living area is perfect for extended family, guests, or rental opportunities, offering independence while staying connected to the main home.Located in a peaceful and highly sought-after neighborhood within a highly ranked school district, this home offers both convenience and serenity. You will not find another home in this neighborhood like this, with its remarkable design, extensive remodel, and unparalleled versatility.","","Den, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Private showings to be scheduled with Seller's Agent 1.  Call or Text Jenny Park 213-275-9321 Showing Information: Call LA 1 ","True","None","False","","5105","Estimated","","CA","Expired","Two, Multi/Split ","","","Cayuse","","5","Lane","","Contemporary","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Harbor","True","","","","2014","90275","5155","RPRS20000&E*"
