el set the tone for every meal. Porcelanosa imported tile as well as designer elements can be found throughout the home. The pleasantly perceived floor plan encourages enjoyment from gatherings by creating social venues around interior and exterior lounging. Blazing fires crack wood embers in the living room fireplace as food cooks in the open aired chef's choice kitchen. The family room opens to a stone tiled patio surrounded by lush landscaping. Each of the bedrooms enjoy a newly remodeled bathroom. The master suite is anchored by an in-wall fireplace and a wall of glass positioned to take in the amazing views of harbor and ocean. The den/office also has a modern wall of stone fireplace and Fleetwood folding doors opening to the stone infused patio. The spa infused master bath has a separate soaking tub and walk-in shower. Additional features include circular motor court, new roof and stucco, epoxy garage flooring, Toto toilets, new doors and windows, The grounds are complimented by a modern pool with numerous cool features including a swim jet feature allowing you to swim against the current, waterfalls and lighting. The pool area is surrounded by glass which has special led lighting allowing you to set the mood. A stone and wood inlaid wood ceiling is perfectly designed to create an outdoor kitchen area ready for family gatherings. A must see home!","","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","go direct. after 10/3/23","","","","","3072","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Colt","","2720","Road","","","Contract","","000","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Harbor","True","","","","1963","90275","6570","RPRS20000&E*"
