t one of the most spacious in this neighborhood with many fruit trees, offering approximately 4,000+ sq. ft. of living space and approximately 28,000+ sq. ft. lot.                                                                                                                                     This Palatial Property offers resort style living, near award-winning schools, biking & walking trails along the coastline, beaches, entertainment, freeway access, golf courses, house of worship, parks, restaurants, schools, shopping, theaters, and exhilarating sunrises and sunsets to enjoy, embrace & relax in this oasis of paradise!","","Walk-In Closet, Two Primaries, Family Room, Primary Bathroom, Office","","","","","","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please contact Listing Broker For Further Details  *PLEASE DO NOT DISTURB OWNERS OR OCCUPANTS, THEY ARE DAY SLEEPERS! Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Day Sleeper,Do Not Contact Occupant,Drive By,Text LA 1,Call LA 1,Call First,Appointment Only,Agent or Owner to be Present ","False","In Ground","True","","4012","","","CA","Expired","Two","E","","Toprail","","6","Lane","","","Contract, Submit","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Water, Trees/Woods, Rocks, Pool, Bluff, Hills, Landmark","True","","","Bay Window(s), Skylight(s), Double Pane Windows","1953","90275","6513","RPRS20000&E*"
