am.  Big views? Check. Bold style? Absolutely. A layout that actually works for real life? Finally! Welcome to your Mediterranean villa in the sky?perched in the prestigious Miraleste Estates of Rancho Palos Verdes, where sweeping views stretch from the Pacific Ocean to the harbor and all the way to snow-dusted mountains (yes, all three, and yes, it?s as magical as it sounds). But the real magic? You enter on the main level?and that?s where the entire heart of the home is. Living room, kitchen, dining, and a primary suite that feels more like a five-star getaway?it's all right there. No stairs required. Downstairs is where the rest of the party lives, with all secondary bedrooms (each with their own ensuite!) perfectly tucked away for privacy, guests, or growing room. It?s a layout that lives like a single-story, but flexes like a forever home. Step inside and let the wow begin?marble floors, a custom mosaic entry, and floor-to-ceiling glass that captures a postcard-worthy 180? panorama. Soaring ceilings, skylights, and rich cherry red oak floors create warmth and grandeur in equal measure. The formal living room is pure drama, with a cozy fireplace and 3 sets of French doors that spill out to the view-soaked patio. And the European-style kitchen? A culinary showstopper, with rare marble countertops, custom cabinetry, pro-grade Wolf and Miele appliances, and a walk-in pantry ready to feed a crowd. Need more? You?ve got 5 ensuite bedrooms (yes, every single one), a bonus half bath, a wine cellar, possible screening room, and large laundry room for effortless everyday living. The primary suite is your private sanctuary?think fireplace, secluded terrace, dedicated office/library, spa bath with jetted tub and 7-head shower, and a closet that basically is a boutique. Outside, the .35-acre lot offers lush gardens, roses, and fruit trees galore. Dreaming of a pool? There?s room. Dreaming of doing nothing? The space has that covered, too. With a private circular driveway, two two-car garages, and instant access to Trump National, Terranea Resort, and Point Vicente Lighthouse, this isn?t just a home?it?s a coastal lifestyle with a capital L. Bottom line? This Mediterranean villa lives smart, looks stunning, and feels like vacation every day. Make your move before someone else makes it theirs.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Projection, Retreat, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showings are by appt only. Lockbox on right side gate. For more information and SUPRA CBS Code, please contact Denise Feneht 424-206-6441.","True","None","False","","5467","Public Records","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Via Colinita","","6337","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional, Submit","","7145","","Single Family Residence","","","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Ocean, Trees/Woods","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/22b9cd92-8564-4d52-b95f-4698dd384fc7?wl=true&setAttribution=mls&initialViewType=pano","https://media.showingtimeplus.com/sites/opeqzpe/unbranded","Drapes, Skylight(s)","2005","90275","6455","RPRS13000*"
