4","21383","Back Yard, Cul-De-Sac, Landscaped, Lawn, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Sprinkler System, Yard","Street Lights","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s), Wired for Alarm System","Assessor","","","SB25086641","","2","9","","1","Owner","Maria","","213-725-1165","Storage","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage Door Opener, Gated, RV Hook-Ups, Workshop in Garage","True","Brick, Concrete, Patio, Front Porch, Stone","True","67","","Private, Heated, Gas Heat, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","800","Welcome to 16 Saddle Road, a private, resort-style escape on a rare 21,383 sq ft lot, where timeless craftsmanship meets modern luxury in one of Rancho Palos Verdes? most coveted enclaves. The moment you enter the expansive motor court, the warm cedar siding, classic slate roof, and manicured coastal landscaping make one thing clear: this is no ordinary home. Inside, artisan details abound?from Spanish cedar ceilings to smooth Venetian plaster walls, every inch is curated to impress. With 5 bedrooms and 4 full baths, the layout is as functional as it is fabulous. One of the bedrooms is currently used as a dedicated office, complete with its own full bath and private balcony, but can easily flex into a spacious fifth bedroom or luxe guest suite. The gourmet kitchen is a culinary dream with Thermador, Miele, Wolf, and Sub-Zero appliances, custom cabinetry, and a generous island perfect for prepping, gathering, or just showing off. Love music? So does this house. Every room is wired with high-end ceiling speakers and individual volume controls?ideal for setting the mood for dinner parties, movie nights, or Sundays. Speaking of movie nights: your private, soundproof home theater delivers the full cinematic experience, with eight oversized leather power-reclining seats, a 120-inch screen, and a McIntosh AV Control System. The serene primary suite is a retreat all its own, with a cozy electric fireplace, spa-like steam shower, and custom cedar walk-in closet. Step outside and it?s pure vacation vibes: an island-style pool with spa, waterslide, and indoor control system for heat and jets; a full Lynx outdoor kitchen with six-burner grill, Lynx warmer, and wood-fired pizza oven; and plenty of room to gather under the sun, stars, or shade of the palapa. All French doors, windows, and screens are premium Andersen, and a Generac 22 kW whole house generator offers peace of mind year-round. Smart home perks? You bet: Lutron lighting, Nest HVAC (3 zones), interior/exterior cameras, Door Bird guest management with in-wall iPad, central vacuum, and 11-zone sprinklers. Whether you?re hosting a party, unwinding under the stars, or catching a sunset over the Pacific?16 Saddle Road isn?t just a home, it?s an everyday escape. While the photos are stunning, this is one you truly have to experience in person.","Slate","All Bedrooms Down, Dressing Area, Family Room, Foyer, Great Room, Home Theatre, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Entry Only","Showings are by appointment only. Text Jelena at 323-675-8371 or Maria at 213-725-1165","True","Heated, In Ground","True","True","4500","Owner","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Saddle","","16","Road","","Custom Built","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional","","18220","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Harbor, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Panoramic, Pool","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/c7691644-068b-4c02-a374-0d6a3248370e?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&initialViewType=pano&utm_source=dashboard","https://media.showingtimeplus.com/sites/beqpgop/unbranded","Bay Window(s), Blinds, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Drapes","2007","90275","6510","RPRS20000&E*"
