"","0.6854","Broker/agent does not guarantee accuracy of square footage, lot usage, schools, rent control, permits or zoning. Buyer is advised to independently verify accuracy of all information through personal inspections with appropriate professionals. Please email offers to: offers@itzsold.com","Dishwasher, Freezer, Gas & Electric Range, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","168 - Mira Catalina","Unknown","True","7558002032","","0","","False","3","1","","1","1","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Other","Office Ph","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","195","1899000","#ERR","06/13/2025 1:09:21 PM","","08/13/2025 12:20:31 PM","09/26/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/27/2025 1:00:51 AM","","","06/03/2025 12:00:00 AM","","09/09/2025 9:06:44 AM","","09/26/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","105","Mirror Closet Door(s), Sliding Doors","False","Dining Room, Separated","Balcony","","Wood","True","","","Den, Living Room, Gas","True","Bamboo, Carpet, Tile, Wood","True","Central","True","Balcony, Built-in Features, Ceiling Fan(s), Copper Plumbing Partial, Living Room Deck Attached, Quartz Counters, Recessed Lighting, Track Lighting, Wet Bar","True","True","N/A","None","False","","","","33.742822","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Included","True","False","","","1899000","","","1975000","#ERR","","","EK@ITZSOLD.COM","310-878-0442","Edward","","","Kaminsky","","SKAMIEDW","","","","","SB1327500","","eXp Realty of California, Inc","310-798-1277","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.338997","","32","29855","0-1 Unit/Acre","Biking , Hiking , Sidewalks","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Security System, Smoke Detector(s), Wired for Alarm System","Assessor","","","SB25124148","","2","2","","1","Owner","Rosie","","310-872-6772","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage Faces Front","True","Deck, Wood, Wrap Around","True","59","","None","False","","742.38","Coastal Vibes, Canyon Calm, and Views for Days: Feel like you?re floating above it all? That?s not just the elevation talking?it?s the kind of magical place where endless views meet zero compromises. This Palos Verdes stunner serves up panoramic coastal views so dreamy, you?ll wonder if you accidentally booked a luxury vacation. Tucked in a quiet, prestigious enclave and perched above a private canyon for ultimate tranquility, this 3-bed, 2.5-bath retreat boasts over 2,500 sq ft of view-drenched living, three distinct living spaces, and a layout that?s practically made for entertaining or unwinding. Did we mention it's on over half an acre of hillside heaven? Let?s talk wow-factor: The gated, artisanal tile courtyard welcomes you with warmth, while custom stained glass double doors open to a foyer and a view-filled living room with a marble gas fireplace, bamboo floors, and sliding doors out to your wraparound deck. Cue the sunsets?and the envy. The white and bright kitchen is all about function meets fresh coastal style, with quartz counters, floating shelves, new stainless appliances, canyon and backyard views, and even a cutout window to keep the conversations (and cocktails) flowing. Dining room? Sunkissed and sunken, with rich wooden built-ins, track lighting, and double doors spilling into the front courtyard, ideal for star-lit dinners or kid-friendly afternoons. For those who love a little versatility- the family room brings bonus entertaining power with a wet bar, window bench, and yet another view deck. The lower-level den is your choose-your-own-adventure zone: office, guest room, yoga retreat?it even has a mid-century fireplace, wine storage, and outdoor access. Upstairs? All three bedrooms have ocean views, including the beautiful Primary bedroom with mirrored closets and a stone-draped ensuite with lux glass walk-in shower. The hallway stone-drenched bath features a jetted tub combo for those soak-the-day-away moments. Outside, it?s a full lifestyle: Glass-paneled wraparound decking, multiple outdoor entertaining zones, low-maintenance landscaping, and those incredible postcard sunsets. Bonus points for: central A/C & heat, direct-entry garage, laundry room, and an energy-efficient setup that keeps costs down and comfort up. Close to hiking trails and award-winning Palos Verdes schools, this one checks all the boxes?with a view from every single one of them. Homes like this don?t just show up?they elevate. Ready to rise above it all?","Composition","All Bedrooms Up, Den, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Property shown by appointment only. Text Rosie at 310-872-6772 to schedule","True","None","False","","2558","Estimated","","CA","Expired","Three Or More ","","","Ganado","","30427","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional, Submit","","27611","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Catalina, Coastline, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.wellcomemat.com/mls/593a41252bcb1m742","","","1964","90275","6276","RPRS13000*"
