 , Park, Sidewalks","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Fire and Smoke Detection System","Assessor","","","PV25179619","","2","2","2","1","Vacant","","","","","Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener","True","Concrete","True","51","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1033.94","Luxury coastal living in Rancho Palos Verdes reaches a new level in this fully reimagined 5-bedroom, 3.5-bath ocean-view home located in the prestigious Palos Verdes Estates. Grom the ground up, this modern coastal residence delivers clean architectural lines, high-end designer finishes, and the feel of a custom home built for today?s lifestyle. The interior features soaring vaulted ceilings, expansive open-concept living spaces, and abundant natural light throughout. The chef?s kitchen is the centerpiece, showcasing a massive center island, custom cabinetry, oyster-shell ceramic backsplash, premium stainless steel appliances, and seamless flow into the dining and living areas?ideal for entertaining and everyday living. This flexible floor plan includes two primary suites, multiple living areas, and private rooms well-suited for a home office, media room, fitness studio, or multi-generational living. Designer details are found throughout, including white oak engineered flooring, porcelain tile accents, and a statement marble feature wall in the spa-inspired primary bathroom. Each bathroom is finished with floating vanities, walk-in showers, contemporary lighting, and thoughtfully selected designer tile. Situated on a large corner lot, this property offers rare outdoor potential in Rancho Palos Verdes, with room for a future pool, outdoor kitchen, sport court, or private entertaining space, all enhanced by cool coastal breezes. The home?s southwest-facing orientation is ideal for maximizing ocean views, natural light, and sunsets. An oversized two-car garage with EV charging adds modern convenience. The location is exceptional?just minutes from Dean Dana Friendship Park, scenic coastal hiking trails, nature preserves, and the Pacific Ocean. Close to top-rated Palos Verdes schools, upscale dining, local markets, and boutique shopping, yet tucked into a quiet, private neighborhood. A rare opportunity to own a turnkey, ocean-view home in Rancho Palos Verdes where luxury, lifestyle, and location align.","Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Great Room, Kitchen, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Vacant Go direct. Agent lives across the street at 2690 Calle Aventura if you have questions","True","None","False","True","2210","Estimated","","CA","Expired","One","","","Vista Mesa","","2704","Drive","","Modern","Submit","","23335","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Park/Greenbelt","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=2NFsns9PerA","","Double Pane Windows, Screens","1960","90275","6324","RPRS20000*"
