chance to claim this extraordinary home. Step through elegant glass double doors into a world of sophistication. Soaring vaulted ceilings, expansive picture windows, and a striking marble fireplace create a welcoming yet luxurious atmosphere. Designed for both intimate gatherings and grand celebrations, the open-concept layout flows seamlessly from the living room to a formal dining area and a state-of-the-art designer kitchen that elevates every culinary moment. Chef?s Dream Kitchen Custom cabinetry and sleek quartz countertops Sub-Zero refrigerator, three ovens, dual dishwashers Main-Level Primary Suite: Your Personal Oasis Wake up to mesmerizing ocean views Cozy up by your private fireplace or enjoy morning coffee on your terrace Spa-inspired bathroom with steam shower, jetted tub, dual vanities, and three walk-in closets Downstairs, three generously sized ensuite bedrooms offer comfort and privacy for guests, plus a versatile bonus room ideal for a home theater, gym, or creative studio. Outdoor Bliss Low-maintenance luxury awaits outside with new stone pavers, lush artificial turf, and a prepped pad ready for your dream outdoor kitchen or plunge pool. Host unforgettable sunset dinners or relax under starlit skies. Why This Home Stands Out Only 67 homeowners enjoy the privilege of living in this exclusive enclave, with wide, private streets and meticulously landscaped grounds. Just minutes from Terranea Resort, world-class golf, pristine beaches, and top-rated schools, this is coastal living at its finest.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text Agent for appointment to show. Ante Perkov 310-780-9071 Provide your card to gate guard. Make the first right turn inside the gate.","False","","","","4001","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Multi/Split ","","","Paseo De Castana","","20","","","",