s, and sweeping views of the ocean, harbor, and shimmering city lights from its perch atop the peninsula in the private community of Rancho Palos Verdes Estates. Inside, natural light fills expansive living spaces with travertine floors, a contemporary chef?s kitchen, and both a spacious living room and a separate family room?each with its own fireplace and majestic views. Oversized living and dining areas open to a full-length balcony. A guest suite with en-suite bath and a three-car garage with epoxy floors complete the main level.   Upstairs, the primary suite features its own fireplace along with vaulted ceilings, dual walk-in closets, and a spa-like bath with jacuzzi tub and steam shower.   Outside, an entertainer?s backyard features an outdoor kitchen, built-in BBQ, grassy areas, and multiple seating zones to take in the views. With 24/7 security, lush community trails, and proximity to top Palos Verdes schools, this rare residence blends luxury, privacy, and breathtaking vistas in a truly special gated community.","","Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","DO NOT GO DIRECT-  Please allow 24 hour notice for sowing appointments. Contact Mike Naylor at 310-686-9361 text/call for more information or scheduling - thank you!","","None","False","","3948","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Paseo De Castana","","57","","","","Cash to New Loan","","33206","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Ocean","True","","","","1990","90275","6385","RPRS1-RS20000-"
