 is equipped with high-end stainless steel appliances, a built-in Sub-Zero refrigerator, and a charming breakfast nook. A guest bedroom with an en-suite bath and downtown views is conveniently located on the main floor, along with a laundry area. And a car enthusiasts' 3 car garage complete with epoxy floors loads of counter space/cabinetry. Upstairs, the secondary floor offers sweeping views from downtown Los Angeles, to the harbor, and the gorgeous coastline. The luxurious primary suite boasts a fireplace, vaulted ceilings, while the en-suite bath includes a jacuzzi tub, steam shower, double vanity, and dual walk-in closets. Additional bedrooms are generously sized, with mirrored closet doors and plantation shutters, and the secondary bath also features a jacuzzi tub and double vanity. The backyard is an entertainer?s dream, with its stunning ocean views, large grassy area, outdoor kitchen with built-in BBQ, and surround sound speakers. Multiple seating areas create the perfect setting to relax and take in the beauty of the surroundings. Additional Features: Gated Community with 24/7 security with friendly gate guard. Prime Location: Close to top-rated Palos Verdes schools, including Mira Catalina, Miraleste, Palos Verdes High, and UCLA Southern California Marine Institute (SCMI). High-End Finishes: Two-zone AC, granite countertops, plantation shutters, and meticulous maintenance. Community Amenities: Walking trails, lush gardens, and a protected green belt. This exquisite home offers the rare opportunity to live in luxury with unparalleled views in one of Southern California?s most desirable communities.","","Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Currently in HOLD status however the property is still available. Please call Tony Accardo for more info (310) 855-3557.","True","","","","3948","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Paseo De Castana","","57","","","","Cash to New Loan","","3320