"","","","Driveway Up Slope From Street, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener, Oversized, Tandem Garage, Workshop in Garage","True","Deck, Patio Open, Front Porch","True","43","","None","False","Negotiable","332.59","NOTE: THIS PROPERTY IS IN THE BUYOUT PROCESS FROM THE FEMA GRANT MONEY FOR LANDSLIDE AFFECTED HOMES. IT HAS BEEN ""RED TAGGED"". PLEASE DON'T CONTACT OWNER.  Fresh air and ocean breezes are a staple in the beautiful Seaview Neighborhood. Catalina Island is just across the channel and the drive to get here is simply, beautiful. This stunning home was built in 2004 and offers a perfect blend of luxury and comfort. The kitchen boasts elegant granite counters, a massive pantry, built-in stainless refrigeration and high-end appliances- making it a dream for any chef. The oversize garage with a showroom epoxy floor provides ample space for multiple vehicles and storage. Enjoy the great weather in  the massive outdoor spaces, complete with large lawns and a dozen fruit trees, creating a serene atmosphere with Catalina as the backdrop. . The wood casement windows and French doors not only enhance the aesthetic appeal but also allow natural light to flood the interior. Inside, the flexible floor plan boasts a wide open multi-level concept perfect for entertaining large or small groups. There are four spacious en-suite bedrooms and four bathrooms, providing plenty of space for family and guests. The eat-in kitchen is supplemented by a large formal dining room. Whether you're looking to relax in the tranquil surroundings or entertain in style, this house offers the perfect setting for a luxurious lifestyle by the coast. Note- DO NOT visit without an appointment. This still beautiful home has been adversely affected by the recently activated land movement in the Seaview area of Rancho Palos Verdes. Nearly half the home shows no adverse effects of the land movement. It is not turn-key but there are methods available to retrofit the foundation and isolate the affected portion of the home from the movement. An engineering report is being produced to detail what needs to be done.","Slate, Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","NOTE: THIS HOME HAS BEEN ""RED TAGGED"". PROPERTY IS IN THE BUYOUT PROCESS FROM THE FEMA GRANT MONEY FOR LANDSLIDE AFFECTED HOMES.  PLEASE DON'T CONTACT OWNER.  Please contact me for all showings. Be certain your buyer is aware of all that is going on in the Seaview tract in regards to land movement BEFORE requesting a showing.  The foundation repair of this home will take significant resources.","False","None","False","True","4059","Assessor","","CA","Expired","Multi/Split ","","","Exultant","","4362","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Owner May Carry","","22835","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Water","True","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hMAQ3QM3V9k&feature=youtu.be","www.youtube.com/watch?v=hMAQ3QM3V9k&feature=youtu.be","","2004","90275","6045","RPRS10000*"
