path to a secluded beach, this panoramic ocean and Catalina view home, captures the true essence and inspiration of California coastal living! This one-of-a-kind, totally renovated modern farmhouse, single-level home, offers 4 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms, with a direct access guest studio, situated on its own private wing. The entry, invites you into the open, flowing floorplan, seamlessly connecting the great room/living room, and large open California dining room, into the gourmet cook's kitchen, featuring a large quartz island, with plentiful seating and top-of-the-line stainless steel appliances, intermingling the kitchen with the family room and picturesque ocean views, from wall-to-wall glass doors and windows, that lead out to the expansive wrap around deck. The master bedroom, is a true retreat, with the peaceful solitude of panoramic ocean, whitewater and tip-to-tip Catalina views, a spa-inspired master bathroom with soaking tub, separate glass-enclosed rain shower and double vanity. All bedrooms have exterior access to the wraparound deck and sprawling, lush grounds. The entry, master bedroom, master bath, and all entertainment areas of this home, have magnificent, scenic views, embodying the coastal California experience, and otherworldly charm of Portuguese Bend and the Palos Verdes Peninsula. This home, is also just minutes away from all lifestyle conveniences, support facilities, blue ribbon schools, world renowned Terranea Resort, Nature Preserves, and the best beach/beach side destinations the South Bay has to offer, all the while, nestled within a sublimely secluded, spectacularly beautiful coastal ranch community that beckons you home!","Composition","Den, Art Studio, Bonus Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Family Room, Dressing Area, Two Primaries, Primary Bathroom, Office, Library","","","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: E-Mail properties@reronline.com / text 310-594-6866: Agent/Broker Co., DRE #; reque