 entertainer's dream come true. Every bathroom in the home has been tastefully remodeled, reflecting the same level of sophistication found throughout. Hosting is effortless in the beautifully-appointed living spaces, which include formal entry, family and living rooms adorned with cozy fireplaces, gorgeous wood beamed vaulted ceilings, and a dining room that sets the stage for memorable gatherings. Step outside to discover a true oasis, complete with lush landscaping, an expansive lawn large enough for a future pool, and an inviting brick patio. Enjoy resort-style amenities including pickleball court, built-in jacuzzi and mature fruit trees, all while savoring awe-inspiring views of the ocean and Catalina Island. Upgrades include new engineered hardwood floors, quartzite countertops, cordless roman shades, new smooth stucco exterior finish, and new interior paint throughout. With direct access to the 3-car garage and ample storage space, this property offers the ultimate in comfort and convenience. This home exudes a sense of tranquility reminiscent of resort living at the nearby Terranea Resort. Don't miss your chance to experience this beautiful home.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","To schedule showings, please contact Jennifer Meter at 424-237-8196.","True","In Ground","True","","3018","Estimated","","CA","Expired","One","","","Barkentine","","3212","Road","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","23434","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=DtF7QNLVBDd&brand=0","","","1973","90275","5939","RPRS20000*"
