here's a built-in BBQ with a full outdoor kitchen, fireplace, evening lighting, refrigerator, stove, oven, hot and cold water (with its own tankless water heater), and a hookup for TV ? all open to fantastic ocean views! In the backyard, a separate building serves as a WINE CAVE with a vacuum seal door,  water drain in the 6-inch-thick slab floor. The walls are 18 inches thick ,cooling system for climate control . A  commercial sink set up and wrapped in preparation for vineyard. In front  of the Wine Cave  is another large sitting area for hosting large parties. There's an additional BBQ nearby, another sitting area with a fire pit. On the other side is a custom built-in chicken coop with outdoor run. Behind everything is another gated area and another storage shed.Property has wireless  SONOS surround sound operated from cellphone?. The house boasts air conditioning (5-ton unit), a fireplace, recessed lighting, a wet bar, a 14 KW  backup generator, custom water filtration and has been remodeled with professional pride and expertise. This is a truly exceptional property where every detail is designed to elevate your living experience. It's a private paradise with unbelievable views in a prime location!","Composition, Fire Retardant","Art Studio, Entry, Formal Entry, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text or call listing agent Lida 310-721-3196. This is a gated community and you will need a code to access the Peppertree gate. All showings are ?BY APPOINTMENT ONLY"".","","None","False","True","2000","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Thyme","","1","Place","","Custom Built, Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","14500","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Propane, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water, White Water","True","