"","0.59","Please contact Rachel at 310-872-6358 for showing instructions. Easy to show.","Dishwasher, Disposal, Refrigerator","True","169 - PV Dr South","","","7572011021","Other","1150","","False","5","0","0","0","5","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","3108726358","","rmartiens@gmail.com","310-373-3427","Rachel","","","Martiens","VTYNDRAC","","","","","","V7186","310-373-3427","RE/MAX Estate Properties","310-378-9494","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","","","","","","","Los Angeles","121","2999999","#ERR","06/01/2023 2:19:19 PM","","08/02/2023 11:12:12 AM","09/30/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/01/2023 2:16:18 AM","","","06/01/2023 12:00:00 AM","","10/01/2023 2:16:18 AM","","09/30/2023 12:00:00 AM","","South","121","","False","Dining Room","","","","","","","Living Room","True","Wood","","","","","True","True","See Remarks","See Remarks","False","0","False","","33.747686","Inside","True","False","","Homeowners Association","2999999","","","3499950","#ERR","(805) 338-5288","","Sellsimi@aol.com","","Rosemarie","","","Garvin","","VCR-C48887","","","","","VCR-CB3239001","","RE/MAX ONE","(805) 206-3776","","","-118.370089","","","25822","Lawn, Sprinkler System","","","Public Records","","","223002122","","2","2","","","","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Concrete, Garage - Single Door","True","","","73","","Private, Gunite","True","","892.33","Welcome to the private gated equestrian community of Portuguese Bend!  Once inside the gates of this idyllic setting tucked away in this beautiful Palos Verdes Peninsula community, you will find this gorgeous remodeled sprawled-out single-story home. The location behind the gates is quiet and serene yet easy to commute to the fun Los Angeles lifestyle. Offering beautiful hiking trails with views of the ocean and Catalina right outside your front door. Just minutes from some of the most beautiful beaches Southern California has to offer. As you drive the private road to the residence you are greeted by the ranch lifestyle. This home sits on over half an acre with Canyon views as well as an ocean breeze on a hot day. So much has been done to bring this home to an open, modern, vacation home feel. Highly extensive remodel includes just about everything including all new interiors and exterior enhancements. The minute you enter you can feel the open concept design. The entry of the home greets you with many doors and new windows allowing natural light and views. The formal dining room area is a beautiful spot to enjoy your day. The living room has large picturesque windows with a stunning stone fireplace.  New wide plank flooring throughout, new kitchen with all new cabinetry, new appliances, and stunning quartz countertops, enhanced with decorative touches. Each one of the bathrooms has been remodeled which includes decorative tiles used for showers. 5 bedrooms include 3 on one side of the home and 2 on the other side which is en suite with exterior entrance, great for pool parties! The laundry room is a great size with all-new cabinetry. A unique setting yard for the community is the place to be here during summer after a day at the beach. Large entertaining courtyard, a large grassy area, and a great size pool to relax and float around in. The new long driveway allows so much room for parking if needed. A newly installed roof, newer exterior siding and paint, and some fresh landscape kept some gorgeous charming trees throughout the property. This lifestyle You will fall in love with!","","","","","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Call First","False","","","True","3362","Public Records","","CA","Expired","One","","","Sweetbay","","21","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Mountain(s), Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1951","90275","5914","RPRS20000&E*"
