e bluff-top land. Inside, exquisite finishes and impeccable craftsmanship define the home?from soaring ceilings and wide-plank hardwood floors to and designer lighting. The expansive living spaces are flooded with natural light and open effortlessly to outdoor terraces, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor lifestyle. The gourmet kitchen is a chef?s dream, outfitted with high-end appliances, custom cabinetry, and a large center island perfect for entertaining. The primary suite is a private retreat, featuring panoramic ocean views, a spa-inspired bath, and large walk-in closets. Each of the additional bedrooms is generously sized and en-suite, providing comfort and privacy for family or guests. The home also has a large 4 car garage.  Set apart from the main home is a dedicated gym room situated right at the edge of the bluffs?an inspiring space to work out with the sound of waves crashing below. The expansive grounds offer multiple patios, manicured landscaping and a pool and spa where you have panoramic views of the magnificent Palos Verdes coastline. This property ideal for both quiet reflection and grand-scale entertaining. This is a rare opportunity to own an iconic piece of California coastline?where every sunset feels like a private show, and the ocean is your closest neighbor. The home is sold completely furnished.","","Primary Bathroom, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call Gerard 310-990-4727 or Tiana 310-503-2377 for showings.","","","","","4509","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Sea Cove","","44","Drive","","","Conventional","","14649","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available","Bluff, Catalina, Coastline, Panoramic","True","","","","1951","90275","5830","RPRS10000SP-OH"
