presence. Nestled on a tranquil cul-de-sac, the refreshed exterior boasts new paint, updated gates, a striking stone fa?ade, and new planter walls. Step through grand double doors into an inviting courtyard entry and experience refined elegance. Spanning 3,904 square feet on a single level, plus a 512-square-foot loft, this home blends style and comfort. The living room showcases polished limestone flooring, a dual-sided marble fireplace, art alcoves, and recessed lighting. New plantation shutters add privacy and charm, while Anderson sliding doors create seamless indoor-outdoor flow. The resort-like backyard is perfect for entertaining, featuring a saltwater pool, firepit, built-in BBQ, covered patio, and ocean breezes. Inside, fresh paint and new quartz countertops elevate the aesthetic. The family room, with hardwood flooring and built-ins?including a desk and wine bar?flows into the chef?s kitchen, complete with a large island, breakfast nook, dramatic pendant lighting, and top-tier appliances. Dual pantries and a butler?s pantry provide ample storage. A center hall leads to four spacious bedrooms with walk-in closets and two shared bathrooms. The primary suite opens to the backyard and features a massive walk-in closet and a spa-like bathroom with a soaking tub, marble shower, dual sinks, and a skylight. Upstairs, the 512-square-foot loft is perfect for a home office, game room, movie room or it can function as a 6th bedroom. Located in a coveted coastal community with award-winning schools, scenic trails, golf courses, fine dining, and upscale shopping, this extensively remodeled estate is ready for you to enjoy the good life.  Seller will consider offers with Buyer concessions.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Property is occupied, but easy 