enhance daily living and accommodate various lifestyles. This exquisite residence offers versatility for hosting gatherings, accommodating multi-generational living, or making it your own pied-a-terre. Gourmet Kitchen with Premium Appliances: This expansive chef's kitchen is equipped with top-tier KitchenAid appliances, including a 48"" commercial-style gas range featuring six burners, dual ovens, and a griddle. The range offers precise control with two dual-flame burners, ideal for searing, simmering, and sauteing.  Smart connectivity allowing you control the oven remotely via the KitchenAid app or voice assistants like Google Assistant and Alexa. A Zephyr wine refrigerator with a 53-bottle capacity and dual-zone temperature control, perfect for wine enthusiasts. The kitchen also features a farmhouse-style sink and a massive quartz-top waterfall island, providing ample space for meal preparation and entertaining. An open-concept layout ensures effortless flow from the kitchen to the massive dining space, ideal for both intimate meals and larger gatherings. Offering eight generously sized bedrooms, thoughtfully divided into two wings for optimal privacy and convenience. Six of these bedrooms feature their own en-suite bathrooms with modern finishes such as elegantly appointed pristine quartz countertops, complemented by exquisite marble and stone tiles, creating a sophisticated and timeless aesthetic. The primary suite stands out with its own fireplace, providing a cozy retreat. At the heart of the home lies a grand living room, serving as a place for all to come together and enjoy a nightcap or tea. This room is anchored by a magnificent fireplace, creating an inviting ambiance for both entertaining guests and enjoying serene moments. Large windows frame views of the meticulously landscaped outdoor pool area, blending indoor and outdoor living. Why venture to the Cameo Resort & Spa in Beverly Hills when you have your own luxurious sanctuary right at home? Step into your private oasis featuring a heated lap pool and spa, adorned with laurel hedges and vibrant California succulents. The outdoor kitchen and barbecue station, complete with a pergola and stone fireplace, offer the perfect setting for alfresco dining and evening gatherings. Schedule an appointment today","","Home Theatre, Library, Living Room, Media Room, Retreat","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: By appt only, contact LA1 for private showings. Alarm on property. Showing Information: Call First,Call LA 1,Supra Lock Box,Combo Lock Box,Appointment Only,Alarm on Property,Call Listing Office,24-hr Notice ","True","Heated, In Ground, Permits","True","True","7084","","","CA","Expired","One","","","Alta Vista","","6888","Drive","","","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Panoramic, Peek-A-Boo, Pool","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=3UJWm98WFNW&mls=1","","","2025","90275","5604","RPRS20000SP*"
