 on warm summer days. This thoughtfully designed home reflects the hallmark craftsmanship and carefully considered opulence for which Rutter homebuilders are known. With its prime location, spacious layout, and proximity to an abundance of area amenities, 10 Santa Cruz is the perfect place to call home.","Tile","Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Must have confirmed appointment. Listing agent to be present. Call LA1 for scheduling. 24 hour notice required.","False","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","3334","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Santa Cruz","","10","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","52016","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","Custom Covering","2000","90274","5402","RESRD*"
