a, ideal for entertaining. The recently remodeled kitchen is the heart of the home, showcasing an expansive waterfall-edge quartz island, custom cabinetry, double Sub-Zero refrigerator, dual ovens, and a professional-grade stainless cooktop. Designed for both function and style, this space flows easily into the family room, complete with fireplace and large windows overlooking the sparkling pool and ocean beyond. Walls of glass provide seamless access to the backyard where a new pool and spa with Malibu step set the tone for relaxed luxury. An outdoor grilling station, spacious grassy lawn, and covered stone patio designed for lounge seating make this home an entertainer?s dream. The private primary suite is a retreat in itself with soaring ceilings, fireplace, two massive walk-in closets, and a spa-like bathroom featuring a soaking tub, dual vanities, and a separate shower. A dedicated office with custom built-ins offers the perfect work-from-home environment, while separate guest or in-law quarters provide privacy and flexibility. The well-appointed laundry room with marble counters, sink, and generous storage leads to a direct-access two-car garage. Blending thoughtful updates with timeless design, this rare single-level ocean-view residence offers an unmatched lifestyle in one of Rolling Hills Estates? most sought-after neighborhoods.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing appointments 310-704-4014","","","","True","4873","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Santa Cruz","","51","","","Contemporary","Conventional","","7100","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","Ocean","True","","","","2002","90274","",""
