s, fine wood cabinetry, and stainless appliances. Directly off the open kitchen is the large dinning room with plantation style shutters allowing more natural light to enter the home. There are 4 bedrooms and 2 baths, all in a highly sought after single level floor plan, with a huge master suite, large walk-in closet and on suite bathroom. And lets not forget the manicured backyard and outdoor living spaces. Enjoy your time on the covered patio with family and friends while taking in views of the pacific ocean and Catalina Island. This home really feels like home. It's excellent condition provides a great opportunity for its next owner to move right in and continue the legacy of good clean living. This home is the perfect example of a true Rancho Palos Verdes gem!","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. Please text/call listing agent for available day and time. Please do not go direct. Easy to show, Supra or Combo Box (9243), both located on hose bib to the right of garage door. Simply text or call first please. DO NOT use ""Showing Time"" for appointments. Owner passed away peacefully in the home of natural causes.","","","","True","1856","Assessor","","CA","Expired","One","","","Abbottswood","","6528","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27134","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, See Remarks","True","","","","1963","90275","3106","RPRS10000*"
