ving and entertaining. The spacious living room features a cozy fireplace and French doors that open to the back patio, seamlessly blending indoor and outdoor living spaces. Whether hosting friends or enjoying a quiet evening, this home is perfect for relaxed, comfortable gatherings. The dining area is flooded with natural light from large windows, offering picturesque views of the surrounding greenery. The oversized chef's kitchen is a true highlight, equipped with stainless steel appliances, ample counter space, and an eat-in breakfast area that makes mornings a breeze. Upstairs, you'll find the expansive primary suite, a peaceful retreat with plenty of room for relaxation, along with four additional well-sized bedrooms. These versatile rooms can accommodate family, guests, or would make the ideal home office or study space. The large backyard with a spacious patio area is perfect for outdoor dining, gardening, or simply unwinding. It's your own sanctuary just waiting to be enjoyed. Additional features include direct access to the 2-car garage, offering convenience and ample storage space. Located just minutes from stunning beaches and a wealth of shopping, dining, and entertainment options, this home is the epitome of the California lifestyle. For outdoor enthusiasts, you'll also have easy access to hiking trails and golf courses, making this the perfect place to call home. Don't miss out on this rare opportunity to own a move-in-ready home in one of the most desirable neighborhoods in Rancho Palos Verdes! To help visualize this home's floor plan and to highlight its potential, virtual furnishings and front/rear grass may have been added to photos found in this listing.","","Living Room","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: On Supra, go direct. Showing Information: Go Direct,Supra Lock Box ","True","None","False","","2440","","","CA","Expired","Two","","","Lomo","","28436","Drive","","Traditional","","","","","Si