side living in one of the South Bay?s most desirable neighborhoods. Featuring 3 spacious bedrooms and 2 remodeled bathrooms across 1,790 sq ft, this light-filled residence sits on a 6,401 sq ft lot with views of rolling hills and lush landscaping. Step inside to discover terrazzo tile floors, maple hardwood throughout, and a thoughtfully renovated kitchen with modern appliances, breakfast bar, in-kitchen dining area and wine fridge. The adjacent living room and dining area feature glass doors opening up to the backyard for seamless indoor/outdoor flow. Utilize the adjoining glass partitioned flex space as a home office, reading nook or playroom. The primary suite is a private retreat with cathedral ceilings, a spa-like bath with dual vanities, a walk-in closet, and French doors that open to the beautifully turfed yard. Additional highlights include newer tankless water heater, upgraded dual-pane windows, water softener, fiber internet, upgraded breaker box, and sleek exterior storage. Smart home upgrades include motorized drapes, a WiFi-enabled thermostat and sprinkler system, security cameras with Ring service. Enjoy the finished garage?complete with an EV Charger outlet, a stainless steel utility sink and ample storage. Located within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this is a rare opportunity to own a well maintained move-in ready home with modern amenities and classic California charm.","","Bonus Room, Family Room, Kitchen, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please do not contact owner. Home is now for lease with a property management company.. Contact Tony Accardo at 310-855-3557 text/call for more information.","","","","","1790","Public Records","","CA","Expired","One","","","Avenida Del Mesa","","27642","","","","Cash to New Loan","","24436","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Neighborhood","True","","","","1961","90275","","