"True","48","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","821.24","Seller will contribute to Buyer's rate buy-down. BRING ALL OFFERS!!! Relax with the whole family in this authentic mid-century modern home, nestled in the beautiful South Shores neighborhood of San Pedro. This charming and colorful coastal retreat offers a serene and peaceful setting, enhanced by its quiet, family-friendly location and ocean views. The home?s design reflects its rich history with original mid-century architectural features, including a classic brick fireplace and beautiful hardwood floors, thoughtfully complemented by vintage furniture and accessories. Inside, you?ll find a harmonious blend of original charm and modern updates. The recently renovated kitchen and bathrooms feature contemporary amenities, while new copper piping, upgraded electrical systems, and a retrofitted foundation ensure comfort and stability. The home can come fully furnished. The heating and air conditioning systems have been discreetly moved to the attic, and the ceiling and walls have been replastered, enhancing the home?s fresh and polished look. The kitchen boasts sleek Cortez countertops and a pantry room. Step outside to enjoy the sunny enclosed backyard, perfect for entertaining. The space features a propane fire pit, an outdoor dining area, comfortable lounge seating, and umbrellas, making it an ideal spot for relaxing and dining al fresco. Located near retail shops, grocery stores, and a variety of dining options, this home offers easy access to local amenities and attractions. You can take a leisurely walk to the White Point Nature Education Center and Preserve, which leads you to the scenic White Point and Royal Palms Beach. This meticulously maintained property blends mid-century elegance with modern comforts, providing a perfect haven for relaxation and enjoyment in San Pedro?s South Shores.","","Kitchen, Living Room, Office","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service