e a grand double-sided fireplace adds ambiance to both the dining and living rooms. The brand-new kitchen, equipped with stainless steel appliances, is bright and airy, with a bay window and several sliding glass doors that showcase views of the lush backyard. Step outside to a charming garden with red brick hardscape and a wood trellis, adding a nostalgic vibe. The spacious sports court is perfect for pickleball and basketball gatherings, and the oversized jacuzzi invites you to relax after exercising. The backyard offers great privacy, surrounded by mature trees that keep the home and yard cool during the summer months. Designed for maximum enjoyment and fun, the outdoor space is a true highlight. Just a few minutes' walk away are the bluffs of Palos Verdes and flat streets ideal for hiking, where you can take in the sights and sounds of the ocean. The property is within walking distance of Lunada Bay Elementary School and in close proximity to PV High and PVIS Middle School. This is a must-see property to truly appreciate!","","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Supra","","Private, Above Ground","True","","1721","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Via Pacheco","","2610","","","","Cash, Contract, Conventional, Submit","","6888","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=MEFV2AKDv7C","","1958","90274","4350","PVR1YY"
