ights. This creates the quintessential small-town feel that warms and comforts us. Golden Cove, the Peninsula Shopping area and the Promenade On The Peninsula offer upscale shops and restaurants. Trader Joe's in the area provides residents with easy access to high-quality groceries. Within a 10-minute drive, Terranea Resort, a stunning coastal retreat, offers a luxurious spa, executive golf, and multiple dining options with breathtaking ocean views. Don?t forget about the Palos Verdes Beach and Athletic Club with its fitness facilities and swimming pool while the Palos Verdes Golf Club boasts championship golf and tennis.  If that isn?t enough Trump National Golf Club is a few short minutes away. In conclusion, owning an English cottage-style home in Palos Verdes Estates is an investment not only in architectural charm but also in a superior quality of life. From top-tier schools to convenient shopping, fine dining, and a wealth of recreational opportunities, this coastal paradise offers a harmonious blend of education, convenience, and leisure that enriches the lives of its residents in truly invaluable ways. So, if you're seeking a place where style meets substance, Palos Verdes Estates is the perfect canvas on which to paint the story of your dream life.","Synthetic","Attic, Center Hall, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","We're taking property off the market for Christmas, New Years etc.  But likely won't be bringing back on until Spring.  If you have a buyer that you develop, properly qualified to buy without anything to sell first in order to buy, just contact me so I can arrange a showing.   If you're one of those agents that prospects expired and cancelled listings, good for you.  I admire your work ethic.  Any contact to the Seller will be recorded, marketing materials saved so that I can 