 door and an awe-inspiring floor-to-ceiling walnut accent wall in the living room?untouched by time and unparalleled in beauty. Designed to maximize its breathtaking, unobstructed ocean views, this home boasts soaring vaulted ceilings and expansive windows that flood the space with natural light. The layout includes a spacious first-floor primary suite with double closets, a total of four bedrooms and four baths, and a three-car garage. A large patio and lawn grace the entryway, offering the perfect setting for relaxation. This is the first time this home has ever been on the market, having been lovingly owned by the Barzilay family since its inception. While the interior remains a showcase of timeless craftsmanship, the exterior has weathered the elements and requires restoration. The price reflects this, and the seller has comprehensive inspection reports in hand. But make no mistake?this is an irreplaceable gem. The design, the views, the heritage, and the unmatched craftsmanship of Barzilay walnut throughout will never be duplicated. If you appreciate impeccable design and mid-century modern excellence, this is your moment. Don?t miss your chance to own the only Barzilay home in existence. Schedule a private showing today before this rare piece of architectural history is gone forever!","","Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","NEW SHOWING INSTRUCTIONS: Please text me your name, license# and with 48 hour notice, showing appointments can be made.","","","","","3876","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Coronel","","1364","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","30905","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1977","90274","1938","PVR1*"
