"","0.1931","Tax records show 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.  Family room converted to ADU with private bathroom and can be separated as individual unit. There are 5 bathrooms (no idea why tax records show 2). House may be purchased furnished. Most furniture will be sold in an estate sale - may be purchased during listing period. There is an additional single unit washer/dryer in the garage. Lunada Bay has a voluntary $35/yr (maybe $40) HOA.  NHD Resource and Peninsula Escrow, Adam Winge. Seller wants to close by Nov. 9.  If not in escrow by Oct 6 will take property off the market and come back on in 2026.","Dishwasher, Gas Range, Microwave, Refrigerator, Water Line to Refrigerator, Water Purifier","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7543004012","","","","False","5","1","0","2","2","5","2329","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","66","2850000","#ERR","08/02/2025 9:41:32 AM","","09/08/2025 3:51:34 PM","10/07/2025 12:00:00 AM","10/09/2025 8:44:58 AM","","","08/02/2025 12:00:00 AM","","09/08/2025 4:00:22 PM","","10/07/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","66","Sliding Doors","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room, In Kitchen","Balcony, Rain Gutters","","Average Condition","True","","","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Laminate, Tile","True","Central","True","Cathedral Ceiling(s), Living Room Balcony, Living Room Deck Attached, Recessed Lighting","True","True","None","None, See Remarks","False","","","","33.774517","Dryer Included, In Closet, Washer Included","True","False","","Home Warranty","2850000","","","2990000","#ERR","310-872-9098","","c.rau@cox.net","","Cheryl","","","Rau","","VRAUCHER","","","","","V7946","310-703-1999","Estate Properties","310-544-9999","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.409138","","9","8412","Back Yard, Landscaped","Curbs, Gutters, Storm Drains, Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s)