 stunning, shingled Cape Cod style home is located in the highly desired lower Lunada Bay area of Palos Verdes Estates. On the market for the first time in decades, this gorgeous home offers breathtaking ocean views from every west facing window and a brief walk to the cliffs to take in the ocean breeze. With exquisite detail inside and out, this property is a masterpiece of craftsmanship and elegance. The house, features the Cape Cod style steep roofline, wood siding, multi-pane windows, and hardwood floors. It also has four gas fireplaces and a pool with a jacuzzi in the upper backyard which is perfect for exercise and entertaining. A spacious, bright main bedroom with an ensuite dressing area and bathroom, enjoys one of the four cozy fireplaces. The main bedroom, and the two additional bedrooms w/a full bathroom, are found upstairs at the end of the sweeping staircase accessed from the classic foyer. There is a sizable upstairs bonus room which provides ample space for you and your family. It could possibly be converted into another main bedroom for use by family, or guests. The attention to detail is apparent throughout the property, with top quality materials and finishes used at every turn. The builder was meticulous in creating a home that is on point and perfectly suited to its nautical surroundings as an authentic Cape Cod Colonial styled home.  The traditional living and dining areas are perfect for entertaining, with plenty of natural light and stunning views of the ocean and cliffs above Christmas Tree Cove. The galley kitchen next to the morning dining area is a chef's dream with custom cabinetry and tile counter tops - perfect for meal preparations. A small bar is conveniently placed near the kitchen and cozy den. There is a large attic w/high ceilings accessed from the upstairs hallway which could possibly be built out. The expansive brick patio areas in the lower backyard and pool deck area above, offer the perfect spaces for outdoor dining and entertaining. A three-car garage with work bench tops it off! The location of this property is unbeatable with steps to the cliffs, Bay Plaza for dining and shopping, minutes from award winning schools, Terrenea Resort and Spa, Trump National Golf Course, hiking trails, and much more. Come experience the ultimate luxury lifestyle in Lower Lunada Bay in Palos Verdes Estates, California. Note: Some photos have been digitally staged.","","All Bedrooms Up, Bonus Room, Dressing Area, Family Room, Foyer, Galley Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Home is Vacant. CALL TXT AGENT FIRST 310.431.8826 w/your biz card and/or name and brokerage, then go DIRECT. Be sure to lock ALL doors and windows, and turn off all lights upon exiting the home please.  NOTE: Please close back gate well. Tends to open on it's own. Please do not show without texting/calling me first.","True","","","True","3356","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Alvarado","","2976","","","","Cash, Conventional","","7144","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","https://tours.dansolomonphoto.com/tours/w5M0gqhvy?mls=1","","","1965","90274","4331","PVR1*"
