chen, beautiful formal Dining Room, family room and a separate area, could be enjoyed as a music room, den, reading room are from this level. The house is flooded with natural light everywhere! The Second primary Bedroom opens to a lovely, landscaped backyard with a pool and spa. The spacious 3rd and 4th bedrooms share a well-lit bathroom, and a large laundry room is conveniently located near the bedrooms. This home features oak floors and two air conditioners. Foundation extends to bedrock, 1 1/8 inch subfloor used, not 3/4. The current owner has made numerous improvements, including the construction of a new saltwater pool. Please see the details in the supplement.  It is within walking distance of the middle school and close to both elementary and high schools.  Located in the acclaimed Palos Verdes Peninsula School District. PV Estates maintains its own Police and Fire Departments. PVE Beach Club and PV Golf & Tennis Club are nearby. This home is one of the few in this area with a contemporary architectural design, and meticulous attention to detail is evident in this beautifully maintained property. Pride of ownership is apparent.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Two Primaries, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Appt. only, please text 310-902-7799 with 24 hours notice. please do not use showing time, will not be confirmed.","True","","","","4030","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Olivera","","2637","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6890","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Trees/Woods, Water","True","","","","1995","90274","2809","PVR1YY"
