our enormous flat backyard. Yes, you read that right! Picture yourself sipping your morning coffee or enjoying a glass of wine in the evening while gazing at your private park, where your kids can frolic and play to their heart's content. And let's not forget the softened views of the Pacific Ocean! But that's not all this magnificent home has to offer. The master area beckons you with its brand of luxury, offering you a retreat within your abode. And if you follow the path of exploration in the other direction, you'll find another cozy bedroom waiting to embrace you. Now, let's talk about one of the most delightful perks of living in Palos Verdes Estates. In the charming community of Lunada Bay, you'll discover a unique advantage that sets it apart from the rest of the Palos Verdes Peninsula ? the only area where all three elementary, intermediate, and high schools ? are conveniently located. That means you can bid farewell to the morning chaos of school runs, saving precious time and energy as a parent. Sidenote: Request the listing ""supplement"" detailing the quality components of this home So, in addition to the captivating Mediterranean-style beauty of this home, living in Palos Verdes Estates offers you the priceless gift of more time with your loved ones and less time in traffic. It's a lifestyle that blends elegance, convenience, and community in the most enchanting way possible. Don't miss your chance to make this home; it's a haven of dreams come true.  Request your agent to download the supplement.","Clay, Spanish Tile","Atrium, Attic, Basement, Bonus Room, Center Hall, Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palo Verde Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Pretty easy ...  1) showings are with 24 hour notice please 2) text me at (424) 226-2147; include your name, DRE#, and email along with of course date and time of your showing 3) I will then contact seller and get right back to you.   Seller will very, very likely accommodate your showing time provided we have 24 hour notice. Two more things please. 1) do NOT under any circumstances, contact the Seller directly.  These are THEIR instructions.   2) there is a large parrot in a cage.  Do NOT poke your fingers in the cage, do not disturb the parrot.","False","None","False","True","3527","Taped","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Victoria","","2836","Place","","","Cash, Conventional","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Catalina, Mountain(s), Ocean, Trees/Woods, Water","True","https://unbranded.youriguide.com/2836_victoria_pl_palos_verdes_estates_ca/","https://vimeo.com/861916255","Blinds, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, ENERGY STAR Qualified Windows, Skylight(s), Stained Glass","1972","90274","4468","PVR1*"
