 an elegant white oak-wrapped beam converge above the living space. Anchored by a gas fireplace adorned with a hand-hewn rustic mantel, the ambiance is both warm and sophisticated. Six dramatic bifold doors invite the outdoors in, seamlessly extending the living area into the exquisite backyard, perfect for entertaining. Thoughtfully landscaped, the outdoor oasis features a generous lawn, a custom fire pit, and a hot tub framed by an expansive deck for ultimate relaxation. The chef?s kitchen, a culinary masterpiece, is equipped with top-tier appliances including a 48-inch range centered on a grand island, and a 60-inch fridge/freezer combination with integrated water feature. The striking backsplash stretches from countertop to ceiling, creating a sleek, modern aesthetic, while the oversized white oak island anchors the space, effortlessly merging with the adjoining living and dining areas. A custom-built, temperature-controlled wine cellar, encased in floor-to-ceiling glass and illuminated by ambient backlighting, stands as a stunning focal point. The master suite is a serene retreat, complete with custom built-ins, a cozy reading nook, and a spa-inspired bathroom adorned in opulent marble-style tile and herringbone floors. A custom white oak double vanity, an expansive L-shaped shower bench, and a spacious dual closet system elevate this space into a true sanctuary. This 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom residence is further enhanced by white oak floors throughout, integrated ceiling speakers in the living areas (Bluetooth and Sonos-ready), and a statement white oak garage door. The sprawling backyard opens directly to a scenic trail, offering quick access to Lunada Bay Canyon and the cliffs. Located in one of Palos Verdes Estates? most coveted neighborhoods, this luxurious home is steps from top-rated schools and the charming Lunada Bay Plaza, offering an unrivaled blend of elegance and lifestyle.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Pal