 unobstructed views of the Pacific Ocean and Malibu Mountains from sunrise to sunset Bathed in natural light through expansive windows, this luxurious mansion offers an abundance of space and an unmatched living experience. An inviting corner lot with enchanting curb appeal welcomes you to the grand open floor plan featuring high ceilings, custom drapery, and lavish use of granite and marble countertops throughout, making this gem a highlight of the PV Christmas Home Tour and a finalist in the National Competition for ""Design of Bath & Kitchen"". Enter through a formal foyer to a living room with a fireplace and French doors leading to both front and back patios. The dining room captures the captivating ocean vistas, setting the stage for elegant gatherings. The designer gourmet kitchen, complete with stainless steel appliances, serves as the heart of the home, where cooking is a delight against a backdrop of mesmerizing ocean views. The family room invites relaxation with its cozy fireplace and seamless connection to the serene backyard with a pool and garden. The park-like backyard creates a picturesque setting for entertainment or quiet relaxation, with a BBQ grill hookup and fire pit. A 3-car garage with built-in storage adds to the practicality of this dream home. Main-level bedrooms offer comfort and convenience, with some sharing a Jack & Jill bath and others having private ensuites. Ascend to the upper level to find a master suite fit for royalty ? panoramic ocean views, a private balcony, two walk-in closets, and a master bath with indulgent amenities. Nestled in the nationally acclaimed Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this residence embodies luxurious Southern California living at its finest. Experience the allure of coastal elegance and make this spectacular house your own.","","Entry, Foyer, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separa