zon of the ocean. These commanding views not only enhance the aesthetic appeal of the property but also offer a sense of tranquility and exclusivity, making it an ideal retreat for those seeking a resort lifestyle. In addition to the spacious 6,000+ sq ft home, current amenities include a pool, spa, tennis (or pickleball) court, and a grassy yard which further elevate the allure of the property. These features cater to relaxation and recreation, offering a comprehensive lifestyle package that is perfect for entertaining guests and enjoying family time.","","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","The property is gated - please Call/text David before going to the property. 310.707.8706 May be subject to cancellation of current escrow.","True","","","","6076","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Coronel","","1501","","","","Submit","","30905","","Single Family Residence","","","Bay, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, See Remarks, Water","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=mmpfQRdDWLs&brand=0","","","1979","90274","1941","PVR1*"
"","0.2415","","","","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7542034016","","0","","False","5","2","","","3","4","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","310-920-8812","","billdavishomes@me.com","","Bill","","","Davis","vdavibil","","","","","","V8496","310-565-2491","Palm Realty Boutique","310-545-2490","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","14","4950000","#ERR","07/20/2023 12:57:49 PM","","","08/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/03/2023 1:24:34 PM","","","07/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","","07/25/2023 10:03:55 AM","","08/03/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","14","","True","","","","","","","","Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","No Lockbox at property","None","False","","","","33.774094","Inside","True","False","","","4950000","","","4950000","#ERR","310 545-2490","","Tony@TonyPuma.com","310 545-2491","Tony","310-800-7862","","Puma","","SPUMAANT","","","","","S9298","310-545-2491","Palm Realty Boutique, Inc.","310-545-2490","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.424525","","46","10521","Back Yard","Suburban","","Assessor","","","SB23133972","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","66","","Private","True","","1387.72","Custom home built in 2007 and completely remodeled and reimagined for current owners in 2017 by Horist Construction and interior design by famed designer Melanie Giolitti. Well thought-out floor plan benefits from a tuck-under garage which not only adds charm and peek-a-boo ocean views from the media room but allows for more space in the backyard and convenient access to a large, finished basement (laundry, utility, storage rooms). No expense was spared in the remodel of this timeless home with high-end finishes, custom built-ins, wainscot paneling, oak hardwood floors and marble countertops throughout. Other upgrades include: Control4 centralized A/V, Sub-Zero refrigeration, Wolf range, whole house water filtration, crawl space encapsulation, EV charging station, iAquaLink pool automation, and dual-unit energy efficient HVAC with all new ducting. The home is highlighted by an over-sized great room with soaring, exposed-beam ceilings, ?real-wood? burning fireplace and bright kitchen that is ideal for entertaining. The greatroom opens up to a perfectly oriented, 85? wide backyard that is an entertainers dream and provides the ultimate in privacy; includes a large pool, jacuzzi, outdoor shower, Synlawn, landscape speakers and soapstone BBQ island with Kalamazoo hybrid fire grill and Perlick refrigerated drawers. All four bedrooms are well-positioned on the North side of the ranch-style home providing privacy and comfort for all; includes Master suite that opens up to backyard, two bedrooms with jack and jill bathroom, and en-suite bedroom with built-in desk and loft. The home also includes an inviting media/game room above the garage and an elegant office/den at the entry that overlook one of the most charming streets in Palos Verdes Estates. Located on a peninsula in lower Lunada Bay, the quiet, family friendly neighborhood of Rocky Point is a crown jewel of PVE. A short walk to Lunada Bay bluff, market, elementary school and PV high school.","","Basement, Great Room, Kitchen, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Entry Only","Shown by appointment only. Call or text Tony Puma at (310) 800-7862 for appointment to show.  Listing Agent must be present.","","","","","3567","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Rocky Point","","129","Road","","","Cash, Conventional, Submit","","17606","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","2007","90274","2661","PVR1YY"
