after street on the Peninsula ""Paseo Del Mar"", this stunning residence epitomizes collaborative excellence at its finest. Every detail of this magnificent estate reflects a level of craftsmanship and artistry that is unmatched. From the meticulously crafted cabinets to the lavish tile and stone finishes, the interior exudes a bespoke luxury that is both tasteful and opulent.  The seamless integration of indoor and outdoor spaces is achieved through expansive walls of glass, offering breathtaking ocean views and refreshing sea breezes from private patios. Upon arrival, guests are greeted by the grandeur of a sweeping circular driveway leading to a serene water feature and spacious patio, setting the stage for the elegance that awaits within.  At the heart of the home lies the culinary haven of an elegant kitchen, seamlessly connected to the family room and sprawling backyard with a tranquil waterfall feature. The formal dining room is adorned with a stunning Jamie Young chandelier, while the great room, boasting a wet bar and striking fireplace, extends gracefully to the patio, ideal for entertaining guests.  The primary suite is a luxurious sanctuary with ocean vistas, a private patio, and an expansive bath leading to a dream walk-in closet. Three additional bedrooms, each with patio access, grace the upper level, while a fifth bedroom or office is conveniently situated downstairs. A versatile 507-square-foot bonus room offers endless possibilities and can easily be converted into an exceptional ADU (Accessory Dwelling Unit). Additionally, a discreet 252-square-foot wine room area caters to the connoisseur's palate.  Practicality meets luxury with three-car garage and an additional parking space accessible via a convenient alley behind the residence. Meticulously reimagined from its foundation upward, this home showcases the pinnacle of luxury living with the finest materials and craftsmanship, making it a true masterpiece.  Room for pool/spa by backyard or keep the spacious lawn and patio area.  The City of PVE offers the Palos Verdes Golf & Tennis Club and Palos Verdes Beach & Athletic Club with pool for residents to join and enjoy!","","Bonus Room, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Game Room, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","DO NOT CONTACT SELLER- I STILL HAVE AN ACTIVE LISTING AGREEMENT","","None","False","True","4363","Taped","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","1736","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7140","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=fywZWdcNyJY","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=fywZWdcNyJY","","2023","90274","1854","PVR1*"
"","0.2441","We are taking the property off the market for the holidays and it will be offered for sale again in the Spring.  DO NOT HARRASS THE SELLER with phone calls.  We already have an agreement that I will be listing the house in the Spring.","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Freezer, Disposal, Gas Oven, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7541005011","Other","0","","False","4","","","","4","5","1271","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","Agent Text Message","Office Fax","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","56","5989000","#ERR","09/22/2023 10:21:55 AM","","11/13/2023 2:30:14 PM","11/17/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/17/2023 10:23:36 AM","","","09/22/2023 12:00:00 AM","","11/13/2023 2:27:53 PM","","11/17/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","56","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Separated","","","","","","","Living Room","True","Tile, Wood","False","Central","True","Balcony, High Ceilings, Living Room Deck Attached, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting","False","False","None","None","False","","","","33.782679","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","CC And R's, Homeowners Association","5989000","","","6250000","#ERR","","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","","VDYERSUZ","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.419984","","10","10635","Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lawn, Sprinkler System, Yard","Curbs","","See Remarks","","","PV23177601","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Circular Driveway, Driveway, Garage, Parking Space","True","Patio","True","75","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1372.68","Located with one of the most desirable addresses on the Palos Verdes Peninsula..""Paseo Del Mar"", this exquisite residence represents the pinnacle of collaborative excellence. Conceived by the visionary talents of Pritzkat & Johnson Architects, meticulously crafted by Powers Construction, and graced with the distinctive touch of Norman Design Group, this property stands as a testament to their unparalleled artistry. This esteemed team, responsible for the design and construction of a recent over $12,000,000 sale on Paseo La Cresta, has once again orchestrated perfection.  Every aspect of this opulent estate exudes a sense of bespoke luxury. From the artisanal, handcrafted cabinets to the opulent tile and stone finishes, the interiors are a symphony of tasteful opulence. Expansive walls of glass seamlessly merge indoor and outdoor spaces, where private patios beckon with ocean vistas and sea breezes.  Upon arrival, the grandeur of the estate is palpable. A sweeping circular driveway leads to a tranquil water feature and a spacious patio, setting the tone for what lies within. The culinary epicenter of the home, an elegant kitchen, redefines functionality and aesthetics. It gracefully opens to the family room, offering a seamless connection to the sprawling backyard, complete with a soothing waterfall.  The residence's formal dining room is adorned with a dramatic Jamie Young chandelier, while the great room, boasting a wet bar and a striking fireplace, extends gracefully to the patio, perfect for entertaining.  The primary suite is a sanctuary unto itself, akin to a luxurious hotel experience. With ocean vistas, a private patio, and an expansive bath leading to a dream walk-in closet, it exemplifies the epitome of indulgence. Three additional bedrooms grace the upper level all with patio access, while a fifth bedroom or office is situated downstairs. A spacious bonus room, totaling 507 square feet, is a versatile space ideal for an office, exercise room, or flex area, and it can also be converted into an exceptional ADU (Accessory Dwelling Unit). Additionally, a 252-square-foot wine room is a connoisseur's delight, discreetly tucked away.  The property's thoughtful design extends to its practicality, boasting a three-car garage and an additional parking space with convenient alley access behind the residence. This home, meticulously reimagined from its foundation upward, showcases the epitome of luxury living with the finest of materials and craftsmanship.","","Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Game Room, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Text agent to show 310-528-7480","","None","False","True","4363","Taped","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","1736","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7140","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","<iframe src=""https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=fywZWdcNyJY"" frameborder=""0"" width=""853"" height=""480"" allowfullscreen allow=""xr-spatial-tracking""></iframe>","","2023","90274","1854","PVR1*"
