ilion includes a bar, kitchenette, sauna, ? bathroom, and outdoor fireplace, creating a resort-like ambiance. A secret, grotto-inspired spa is tucked amid natural stone and greenery.  The impressive pool is privately situated and surrounded by mature, lush landscaping that provides peace and tranquility. Upstairs are five bedrooms, each with its own private bathroom. The spectacular primary suite includes a sitting area, fireplace, a luxurious bathroom and a one of a kind walk-in closet.  The  private balcony enjoys beautiful ocean and sunset views.   Downstairs includes an authentic wine cellar, guest quarters and direct access to the three-car garage.  The gated driveway leads to a secluded motor court and provides access to two additional spaces within the tandem garage.  A total of 5 car enclosed parking.   Set on an oversized lot with ocean views, this exceptional property rests on one of Lunada Bay?s most desirable streets.","Tile","Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment:  310.704.5164","True","Private, Heated","True","","8613","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Three Or More ","","","Paseo Del Mar","","2816","","","Custom Built","Cash to New Loan","","7144","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://players.brightcove.net/5782667246001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6388454510112","","","1993","90274","",""
