oors line the home, opening to a private backyard ideal for barbecues, entertaining, or unwinding on the serene ?Queen?s Necklace Viewing Deck.? One of the most captivating highlights is the expansive rose garden, complete with a charming gazebo?perfect for morning coffee or evening relaxation. This versatile area also offers the potential for a future pickleball court or resort-style pool. Interior spaces include two spacious living rooms with ocean and garden views, a formal dining room, and a primary suite with dual vanities, soaking tub, and separate shower. Two additional guest suites feature en-suite baths, and a dedicated office provides flexibility. Additional features include hardwood floors throughout, central air conditioning, a large circular driveway, and an attached two-car garage. The home has been substantially refreshed and restored by the current owner, offering a true move-in-ready opportunity. Located within the award-winning Palos Verdes School District and minutes from the beach, this estate offers endless opportunities to embrace the coveted Palos Verdes lifestyle.","","Entry, Family Room, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text or Call Listing Agent office line: (424)-241-3311. Please give at least 24 hours notice for showings.","True","None","False","","3119","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Granvia Altamira","","1300","","","See Remarks","Conventional","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","","","French/Mullioned, Wood Frames","1955","90274","2006","PVR1*"
