atural light while capturing dramatic views from the main living areas and primary suite. The impressive living room with fireplace opens to the dining area and a chef?s kitchen highlighted by a 10-foot marble island and premium stainless steel appliances. All bedrooms include en-suite baths, with private upstairs and downstairs suites well suited for guests or multi-generational living. The primary suite serves as a tranquil retreat with ocean views, a custom walk-in closet, and a spa-inspired bath with marble finishes and a freestanding soaking tub. The outdoor space is designed for relaxation and entertaining, featuring a resort-style pool and spa positioned to enjoy the views, along with fig and citrus trees and generous garden areas. This exceptional home blends privacy, comfort, and elevated coastal living in one of Southern California?s premier communities.","","Living Room, Multi-Level Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","First showing is at the Open House on 1/10. The Property is owner occupied and equipped with security cameras. Do not visit the property without an appointment.","False","","","True","3995","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Via Nogales","","900","","","Contemporary, Custom Built","Cash to New Loan","","7330","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Pool","True","https://vimeo.com/1151675560/0a4852a20c?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci","https://unbranded.visithome.ai/iuJBzswpypo8dQa4fGZgzq?mu=ft","Double Pane Windows","2018","90274","",""
