u'll find three secondary bedrooms, balconies with ocean views, and the expansive primary suite. The primary suite is a personal haven, featuring a luxurious sauna, jetted tub, large walk-in custom closet, sitting area, and a balcony with ocean views for ultimate relaxation and rejuvenation. The outdoor space is equally impressive, with a sparkling pool, jacuzzi, and a pickleball/paddle tennis court catering to both relaxation and recreational needs. The property also includes a spacious three-car garage and a large dual-entry driveway surrounded by a gorgeous hardscape. This extraordinary home combines contemporary amenities with timeless design and is located in one of California's most sought-after communities. 1536 Via Zurita offers a lifestyle of unparalleled luxury and convenience. Don't miss the opportunity to make this exceptional property your own.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Sauna, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text Callum for showing requests 310-844-2845","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","6143","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Zurita","","1536","","","Mediterranean","Cash to New Loan","","7334","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Available, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Available, Water Connected","Canyon, Neighborhood, Ocean, Pool","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/0f51ff03-efe3-47f2-8e75-0e8090be04e3?wl=true&setAttribution=mls&initialViewType=pano","https://media.showingtimeplus.com/videos/01910e24-93d3-710b-9050-75211bf13673","Double Pane Windows","1989","90274","1932","PVR1*"
