s. Downstairs is the perfect space for entertaining or could serve as a second living quarters featuring a kitchenette, game room/gym, wine room, and two additional bedroom suites. Out back is a nice covered patio, grassy yard and a regulation sized half-court basketball court all completely private with mature trees and hedges. This home has all of the convenient systems that you would want: 2 tankless water heaters, 3 HVAC zones, 5 fireplaces, security system, smart home, electric car charger, etc. This is your opportunity to own a very luxurious, functional, flexible estate home in the prestigious Monte Malaga neighborhood of Palos Verdes Estates.","Spanish Tile","Basement, Bonus Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Game Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Office, Recreation, Retreat, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Appointment only. Listing agent must accompany Buyer and Buyer's agent. Seller prefers 24 hours notice. Call Cameron and Janet at (424) 241-3311 or Josie at (310) 714-8125.","True","Bath","True","True","5552","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Granvia Altamira","","1217","","","Custom Built, Mediterranean","Submit","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Courtyard, Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=qToZmxFi782&mls=1","https://youtu.be/1w0T1BV0w6o","Casement Windows, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, ENERGY STAR Qualified Windows, French/Mullioned, Garden Window(s), Insulated Windows, Screens, Wood Frames","2016","90274","2003","PVR1YY"
