202.02","Nestled in lush landscaping, a hidden driveway winds to an architectural masterpiece. This mid-century modern estate, tucked in serene seclusion in one of the most exclusive neighborhoods of Palos Verdes Estates, unveils a captivating oasis on expansive grounds that redefine luxury living. Approach a resort-style entrance that welcomes with grandeur. Ascend a sweeping staircase, embraced by trees and graceful lighting. A striking floor-to-ceiling glass encircles, offering tantalizing glimpses into innovative architecture beyond. Open beam ceilings draw gaze skyward upon entering the formal living room, where awe-inspiring city and mountain views unfold. Seamlessly merging indoor and outdoor realms, most rooms feature extensive glass windows on both sides, forging an unbroken link to serene surroundings. The gourmet kitchen showcases custom Bulthaup cabinets, Caesarstone countertops, Wolf appliances, and Dornbracht fixtures. Maple hardwood floors flow, extending through the kitchen and upper living area. Suffused with natural light, the family room offers tranquil views of a lush forest. Outside, an expansive redwood deck envelops. The backyard is cocooned in greenery, exuding a serene ambiance, with a 15-person smart spa, built-in firepit, putting green, and outdoor kitchen beneath a striking steel and wood patio cover. Set on a sprawling 30,000+ sq. ft. lot, this architectural marvel is embraced by professionally landscaped yards, luxuriant trees, and bordered by parkland, fashioning an estate-like sanctuary. This residence seamlessly combines open living space, hardwood floors, open-beamed ceilings, a sumptuous primary suite, office, gourmet kitchen, and the allure of three fireplaces. Natural light streams through walls of glass, connecting with the outdoors. This redwood contemporary retreat stands as an unparalleled discovery in Palos Verdes Estates, a tribute to modern living in a natural haven.","","Center Hall, Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, 