aga in the heart of Palos Verdes Estates. Crafted in 2005 by Architect Edward Carson Beall, this ?transitional? home boasts premium construction and an elevated level of architectural detailing that spared no expense. Nestled at the top of a grand, gated driveway and surrounded by lush landscaping for added privacy, this house exudes luxury. Enjoy the resort-worthy features throughout the property, encompassing a full sized tennis court, attached 3-car garage, temperature-controlled 2,000+ bottle wine cellar, pool and spa. The home?s most recent upgrades offer a timeless and modernized feel, while preserving its original craftsmanship, including a newly painted interior, refinished hardwood flooring, and updated light fixtures throughout.The main entrance welcomes you in with abundant natural light, high ceilings, custom moldings, limestone, and hardwood floors. Sophistication meets relaxation with its formal living room, office, gourmet kitchen equipped with high-end appliances, and separate formal dining room that leads out to a cozy outdoor living area with picturesque views. The family room is ideal for entertaining, with a hidden projector screen, full wet bar, and elegant French doors that open out to the pool, spa, tennis court, outdoor dining area, barbecue, fireplace, and Queen?s Necklace view. In addition, several charming fountains adorn the property creating an atmosphere of tranquility and serenity. Wake up to exquisite views of Malibu and the South Bay in the primary suite which includes a huge walk-in closet, dual-vanity sinks, and spa-like bathtub. With 3 more bedrooms plus an additional guest en-suite independently located on the bottom floor, this home truly has it all. This private estate is just a few short minutes from top-rated schools, shopping, restaurants, and all other amenities that embody a Palos Verdes lifestyle. Come discover the perfect balance of luxury and convenience today!","","Primary Suite, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showings begin Thursday 3/23/23.  Contact Tony Accardo at 310.855.3557 or Carly Potter at 310.427.2155 text/call for the gate code before showing - Thank you for showing!  Home is also for lease asking $17,000 a month. Bathroom Mirrors provided by staging company and NOT included.  There is a locked storage room in the garage which is approximately 150sf in size, access will be provided for inspections.  Agents permitted to use photos for promotion - tag @accardo_realestate or include agent credit on such reuse.","True","In Ground","True","","6280","Taped","","CA","Canceled","Three Or More ","","","Via Visalia","","2008","","","","Cash to New Loan","","8043","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=VExZnxHRRJu&mls=1","","","2005","90274","","PVR1"
