isioned as a private gym?easily convertible into an additional bedroom. The layout also includes four and a half beautifully appointed bathrooms, and seamless indoor-outdoor living spaces designed to embrace the best of Southern California?s coastal lifestyle. A new circular driveway leads to an attached two-car garage, with ample off-street parking for added convenience and ease of entertaining. Currently on the property is a comfortable and well-maintained 4-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom home spanning approximately 3,300 sq ft, including two primary suites. The existing residence enjoys downtown and peekaboo ocean views, along with central A/C, a sparkling pool, and a two-car garage?making it perfectly livable while you plan your dream build. Just minutes from the iconic Malaga Cove Plaza, this property offers the rare combination of immediate comfort with the unmatched potential to create a future architectural landmark in one of the South Bay?s most prestigious enclaves.","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Must Call Gary Kooba For showing","True","In Ground","True","","3340","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Via Del Monte","","760","","","Mediterranean","Cash to New Loan","","6884","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Ocean, Peek-A-Boo, Pool","True","","","","1956","90274","1668","PVR1YY"
