r entertaining areas and a sparkling pool that creates a lively atmosphere for any gathering. Recent upgrades, including painting, new roof, flooring and a new garage door to add to the allure of this property. The flexible floor plan includes master bedrooms on both levels, while a unique rotunda living room allows for personalization and captures the spectacular views of the Los Angeles lights, Santa Monica Bay, mountains and the Queen's necklace. Situated in a peaceful location within Malaga Cove in Palos Verdes Estates, this home is conveniently close to shopping, restaurants and best beaches. Although the current house is beautiful, plans designed by the renowned architect Moises Villegas are available with approved permits for a 2800 sqft Mediterranean Tuscan style villa with a third master bedroom. The spacious kitchen and living areas inside are complemented by the magnificent exterior views. Don't miss the opportunity to explore this hidden gem in Palos Verdes Estates through a virtual tour video to appreciate the breathtaking views it offers. https://tours.threedmedia.com/e/qfNbLgH","","Bonus Room, Dressing Area, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Two Primaries","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call or text to set an Appointment (310) 819-2016 or use showing time. PLEASE WAIT FOR CONFIRMATION. PROPERTY HAS ACTIVE RECORDING VIDEO AND AUDIO.","True","","","","2106","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Somonte","","781","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","6884","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Ocean, Panoramic, Park/Greenbelt, Pool, Trees/Woods","True","https://tours.threedmedia.com/e/qfNbLgH","https://tours.threedmedia.com/e/qfNbLgH","Double Pane Windows","1975","90274","1629","PVR1*"
