son. Upgraded finishes include, jade granite, terracotta sandstone, beautiful hardwood floors, 2 laundry rooms, expansive master bedroom suite with huge walk-in closet, en-suite laundry, and massive spa-like bathroom with heated floors and clawfoot tub, oversized gourmet kitchen perfect for entertaining, walk-in pantry, dual fireplaces, cathedral ceilings throughout with skylights, expansive windows and sliding glass doors, wired for automated blinds, 2 zone AC and heat, CCTV, salt water hot tub, and more. Extra square footage was added in the remodel enclosing a previous atrium and adding an oversized 2 car garage with Tesla hookup. This is a split-level home, but lives like a one story ranch with an elevator to all floors and an accessible-friendly interior staircase. Finally, don't miss the secret room inside the back bedroom that provides a lot of utility, currently a private playroom for kids.","","Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Call Listing Agent for an Appointment","","","","","3867","Plans","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Via Elevado","","2704","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7540","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=vGyPWrdoanJ&brand=0","","","1959","90274","1436","PVR1YY"
