p elevator to find an expansive open concept living space that seamlessly flows out to the stunning Queen?s Necklace views. These views can be admired from the balcony all the way back to the kitchen.? With multiple areas to entertain, family and guests have plenty of space to spread out on this level. A private backyard right off the kitchen is the perfect spot to BBQ and lounge. The top level also has one bedroom with attached bath and a separate powder bath. The middle level has 4 bedrooms, including the primary bedroom and laundry room. The primary bedroom is spacious with a massive walkthrough closet, luxurious bath and private ocean view balcony. All secondary bedrooms have attached baths and large walk-in closets. The lower level is where you?ll find the three car garage and room for plenty more parking in the gated motor court. Conveniently located walking distance to the PV Beach Club, cliffs, surf, Malaga Cove Plaza and a short drive to Torrance and the rest of the South Bay.?Also available for lease - $19,000/month.","Tile","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","**PLEASE DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME** Private showings only. No open houses. Please call/text Justin @ 310-722-0517 or Vidya @310-704-7873 to schedule.","False","None","False","","5038","Appraiser","","CA","Canceled","Three Or More ","","","Via Almar","","372","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6886","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","Bay, Bluff, City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water, White Water","True","","","","2012","90274","1261","PVR1YY"
