"","0.7564","Direct all showing requests & inquiries to LA4 Brandon Meneses 561-674-1733 or LA1 Dennis DeWalt 323-774-3315. It is important for buyers to conduct their due diligence in determining the rental capacities of the property, as this information is not guaranteed by the broker/agent. It is worth noting that the broker/agent cannot guarantee the accuracy of various details, such as square footage, lot size, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools, and other information pertaining to the property. Such information may have been provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Consequently, it is highly recommended that the buyer independently verifies the accuracy of all information.  https://www.themls.com/showi","Dishwasher, Disposal, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","163 - Malaga Cove","","False","7540003019","","","","","8","2","0","0","6","7","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","brandenwilliams@mac.com","","Branden","","","Williams","CLW-X86294","","","","","","CLW-X82859","","The Beverly Hills Estates","310-626-4248","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","136","14499000","#ERR","12/16/2024 4:24:05 PM","","","03/18/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/06/2025 6:03:47 AM","","","12/16/2024 12:00:00 AM","","05/05/2025 2:20:57 PM","","03/18/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","136","","","","","","","","","","Bonus Room, Den, Game Room, Library, Living Room","True","Stone, Tile, Wood","","Central, Fireplace(s)","True","","True","True","","","","","","","33.798678","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Washer Included","True","","","","14499000","","","14499000","#ERR","323-774-3315","","dewalt@thebeverlyhillsestates.com","","Dennis","","","Dewalt","","CLW-C138776","","","","","CLW-X82859","","The Beverly Hills Estates","310-626-4248","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.405685","","","32950","","","Automatic Gate, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Gated Community","Assessor","","","24472531","","","15","","","","","","","","Driveway, Driveway - Brick, Concrete, Garage - Three Door, Gated, Guest, Private, Street, Workshop in Garage","True","","","1","","Private, Heated, In Ground, Lap","True","","2109.87","Introducing Chateau Del Mar: The Only Gerard Colcord Oceanfront Masterpiece To Ever Be Built. Located on the prestigious West side of Paseo Del Mar in Palos Verdes Estates, this exceptional estate occupies one of the most coveted locations on the Peninsula. Spanning nearly 7,000 square feet of living space on a nearly 33.000-square-foot lot, the home offers sweeping panoramic ocean views, including the iconic Queen's Necklace. With seven bedrooms and eight bathrooms, the design blends classical European charm with modern coastal living. Crafted by renowned architect Gerald Colcord, the estate showcases French 18th-century architectural influences, featuring steeply pitched gable roofs, casement windows with small panes, and elliptical window heads. A grand French Rococo entrance framed by a neo-Classical aedicule and intricate double doors invites guests into a refined atmosphere that continues throughout the home. Inside, the spacious floor plan accommodates both large gatherings and intimate family moments. A cantilevered staircase with a wrought-iron railing makes a dramatic statement in the entry foyer, while the living room, with coved ceilings, intricate crown molding throughout and expansive windows, opens onto ocean-view terraces. French doors throughout create a seamless connection to the outdoors, bringing in natural light and stunning vistas. The formal dining room, located off the living room, features large windows that frame the surrounding landscape. Wood parquet floors and intricate detailing add sophistication, while a marble fireplace with an ornate over-mantel provides refinement. The family room, designed for relaxed living, opens to a private terrace, while the billiards room offers a cozy retreat with rustic log paneling contrast to the home's more formal areas. These rooms balance traditional elegance with a family-friendly atmosphere. The gourmet kitchen boasts top-of-the-line appliances, custom cabinetry, and a large center island ideal for cooking and entertaining. A separate breakfast nook provides casual dining, while a butler's pantry offers additional storage and prep space. The kitchen flows effortlessly into the family room and outdoor dining area, perfect for both everyday meals and gatherings. Across all main living areas, sweeping vistas of the iconic Queen's Necklace are crystal clear. The master suite is a luxurious retreat, offering breathtaking ocean views and access to a spacious terrace. The suite includes a sitting area, ideal for relaxation, and a spa-like en-suite bathroom with a freestanding soaking tub, dual vanities, a large walk-in shower, and marble finishes. Generous walk-in closets and custom cabinetry add convenience and style. The six additional bedroom suites are equally well-appointed, with spacious layouts, and tranquil views of the gardens or ocean. The thoughtful layout ensures privacy while maintaining easy access to communal spaces and outdoor areas. Outdoor living is equally impressive, with multiple terraces and landscaped gardens surrounding the estate. The backyard features a large pool and spa set against ocean views, creating an ideal space for relaxation and entertaining. A built-in barbecue and dining area allow for effortless outdoor gatherings, while mature trees and landscaping ensure privacy. The expansive lot offers room for additional amenities and direct access to the natural beauty of Palos Verdes. The estate is ideally located with access to Palos Verdes' renowned beaches, parks, and walking trails. Its prime coastal location provides sweeping ocean vistas, combining privacy, natural beauty, and the highest level of craftsmanship from Gerard Colcord. The property is also conveniently close to top-rated schools, shopping, and dining. Gerard Colcord's meticulous craftsmanship is evident in every detail, from the architectural features to the seamless integration with the landscape. This is a rare opportunity to own a piece of Palos Verdes history.","","Basement, Bonus Room, Den, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Jack & Jill, Library, Living Room, Loft, Office, Sauna, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call LA 1,Text LA 1,Text LA 3,Call LA 3,Appointment Only,Listing Agent Accompanies ","","None","False","","6872","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","605","","","French","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Rocks, Water, White Water","True","","","","1970","90274","1220","PVR1YY"
"","0.7564","The property is also available for lease; please check the lease section.  Broker/Agent does not guarantee the accuracy of square footage, lot size, ordinances, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools, and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Freezer, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","163 - Malaga Cove","Unknown","True","7540003019","","0","","False","9","2","","","7","7","1414","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Text Message","","","Central Air, Zoned","True","Los Angeles","48","16888000","#ERR","07/21/2024 9:40:19 PM","","","09/07/2024 12:00:00 AM","09/07/2024 9:28:42 AM","","","07/21/2024 12:00:00 AM","","07/21/2024 9:40:19 PM","","09/07/2024 12:00:00 AM","","South","48","Double Door Entry","False","","Balcony","Stucco","Stucco Wall","True","","","Family Room, Library, Living Room","True","Stone, Wood","True","Central","True","2 Staircases, Living Room Balcony, Pantry, Partially Furnished","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.798609","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Washer Included","True","True","","Coastal Commission Restrictions","16888000","","","16888000","#ERR","310-373-3333","","lilyliangpv@gmail.com","310-375-5899","Lily","310-375-6358","","Liang","","VLIANLIL","","","310-373-3333","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.405664","","2","32950","2-5 Units/Acre, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Sprinklers In Front, Sprinklers In Rear, Value In Land, Yard","Hiking , Rural","Automatic Gate, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Security System, Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV24149810","","3","3","2","1","Owner","","","","","Auto Driveway Gate, Driveway, Concrete, Driveway Level, Garage, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Three Door, Garage Door Opener, Gated, Private","True","Patio, Rear Porch, Stone","True","71","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","Close Plus 3 Days","2457.51","A landmark oceanfront chateau with distinctive architecture by famed architect Gerard Colcord on a 33,000 sq ft lot. It offers a vast and deep-set backyard with privacy. It has 7 bdrm/9ba and is convenient for everything SoCal offers. With panoramic views of the California coastlines- from the beach cities to Malibu and white water, this home embodies Palos Verdes Estates' prestige with its excellent location. Listen to the waves, watch the sails and seagulls go by, and enjoy the blue ocean during the day and twinkling city lights during the night, which is the famed ""Queen's necklace view!"" The main floor has a living room, formal dining room, library/family room, spacious kitchen, pantry, and a vast primary bedroom wing, with a spacious his & her bath, which opens up to the garden and pool for a morning or evening swim. Also, the living room and library/family room all have tall French doors that open to the view terrace. The lower level offers one bedroom with a bathroom, a wine cellar, and a handsome entertainment room with a rock fireplace. On the 2nd level, there are five bedrooms, all with private bathrooms except for one and another family/playroom. Further highlights include custom-made wood floors, three fireplaces, and a recently remodeled kitchen with all top-of-line appliances and baths. It is fully fenced and gated with a huge motor court. Entertain from the terrace with magnificent views and privacy. Originally christened Les Ailes de la Mer('The Wing of the Sea'), renowned architect Gerard Colcord crafted it; he was known as a ""Hollywood Society Architect,"" designing traditional homes and shying away from Modernism, he worked with one client at a time, just to name a few who owned homes with his design: Dean Martin, Robert Wagner, Bob Newhart, Richard Chamberlain, Harrison Ford, JoBeth Williams, John Pasquin, Madonna, and Rudolph Valentino. It features hand-sewn form and style authentic to French craftsmanship and architectural tradition: plaster ceiling moldings, custom-milled pieces, lead glass windows, parquetry flooring, wrought iron, etc. It is truly a rare opportunity not to be missed.","Tile","Family Room, Formal Entry, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Sauna, Separate Family Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text 310-902-7799 with time of showing, agency information and prequalification info of buyer. 48 hours notice is appreciated. Please do not use showtime, would not be able to confirm any appt. in a timely manner, many tks!","True","","","True","6872","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Three Or More ","","","Paseo Del Mar","","605","","","French","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6886","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bluff, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Water, White Water","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/468599","","French/Mullioned","1970","90274","1220","PVR1YY"
