flooring. Additional upgrades include ceiling fan, tank-less water heater, and floor heating boiler.  The primary bath has a Toto washlet, and glass door that opens onto a tiled floor with an Americh jetted tub and separate shower. The guest bath has a glass door shower with tiled floor.  Beautifully landscaped backyard with a pergola covered large brick patio, with many mature fruit trees and flowers. The brick patio provides a perfect area for alfresco dining just in time for summer!   There is a two-car attached garage with epoxy coated flooring. In addition, you have additional off street parking on the side of the garage. Conveniently located in the award-winning Palos Verdes School District, PV Golf and Tennis Clubs, horse stables, iconic Palos Verdes trail system. Just minutes to the pristine South Bay Beaches, sidewalk cafes, boutiques, and many restaurants for fine dining.","Fiberglass, Mixed","All Bedrooms Down, Center Hall, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Active subject to cancellation of existing offer.  Please use showing time to show/preview property. Thank you!","True","None","False","","1625","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Via Valmonte","","4208","","","See Remarks","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","City Lights, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","Blinds, Plantation Shutters","1950","90274","",""
