ed entry with weaving staircase leads to private courtyard and main entry.  Newer tile roof, newer premium paint inside & custom wooden blinds throughout.  Stunning custom laid Chestnut Oak wood flooring and baseboards throughout most living areas. New custom black & white tile in hall bath with new Subway tiles w black liner in Ensuite Bath. Formal Living Room w/ Fireplace and custom designed Mahogany book shelf overlooks the PV Hills Nature Preserve and Fairways of PVCC.  The Kitchen and Family Room reside in the middle leading out to Courtyard.  The bright Primary Bedroom & Ensuite Full Bath are in the back right corner flanked by windows to the Backyard & Courtyard.  The second Bedroom is in the back left and leads to a 3/4 bath.  Third bedroom sits off kitchen with new paint, chandelier and views of PV Nature Preserve. Between the Bath & Kitchen is a dedicated Laundry area with sink and exterior door to side. Large Utility Closet presents a possible place to convert to Powder Room. Picturesque rock pathway from Courtyard to Backyard, which is terraced with rail road ties leading to a grassy area with viewing deck and Playhouse with swing set.  All this while enjoying close proximity to; PV golf course, PV Horse Stables, PV Beach & Athletic Club, Malaga Cove Plaza, Pristine Beaches, Hollywood Riviera restaurants & shops + coveted award winning PVPUSD (Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District)!  Any alterations desired should be approved by City.","Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Joe Alessi 310-738-3262","False","None","False","True","1987","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","N","Palos Verdes","","2909","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","","Golf Course, Hills","True","https://youtu.be/35cz8QZp9Ac","","","1954","902