tch","","CLW-C123014","","","","","CLW-X71845","310-247-7780","Westside Estate Agency Inc.","310-247-7770","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.388945","111x122","","13482","Back Yard","","24 Hour Security, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Gated Community, Smoke Detector(s)","","","","24443641","","","2","","","","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Driveway Down Slope From Street","True","","","1","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1086.17","Welcome to this rare one-of-a-kind home in the prestigious Grove section of Valmonte, Palos Verdes Estates! This 4-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom home, with 2,762 sq ft of thoughtfully designed living space, has been lovingly maintained by the same family for over 40 years and is now available for the first time in a generation. Situated on a generous 13,482 sq ft corner lot, this property combines elegance and comfort in a highly coveted neighborhood, renowned for its tree-lined streets and tranquil environment.This unique home retains many charming, original vintage details. Step into the expansive primary suitea true retreat featuring a decorative fireplace with handcrafted tile, a spacious walk-in closet, and a serene ensuite bath. The secondary bedroom shares a bath with the lanai, while the third bedroom offers an ensuite bathroom and large closet. The 4th bedroom offers versatility as an office or cozy den, seamlessly adapting to your lifestyle. Integrated storage is thoughtfully designed throughout, ensuring everything has its place.Designed for gatherings, the inviting courtyard with a spa flows effortlessly into the indoor spaces, including the lanai, creating an ideal setting for entertaining family and friends. The sumptuous kitchen, with its dine-in breakfast nook, offers charming peek-a-boo ocean views from the sink, adding a touch of serenity to everyday living.Additional conveniences include a dedicated laundry room with a half bath, direct garage access, and an extra-large driveway for ample parking and flat grassy areas throughout the lot.PVE has direct garbage service.Nestled near the stunning Palos Verdes Beach and Athletic Club, this home ensures effortless access to the renowned Palos Verdes Golf Club, designed by George Thomas and William Bell. You'll also find the scenic Valmonte Trail just a stone's throw away, seamlessly connecting you to nature and recreational pursuits. This neighborhood is celebrated for its exceptional public schools and a warm community spirit, highlighted by friendly 4th of July block parties just around the corner. With the beach, dining, and boutique shopping all within reach, this location perfectly blends tranquility and convenience.Don't miss this unique opportunity to become part of the Valmonte legacy and create cherished memories for years to come!","Concrete, Tile","Living Room","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Easier to show with a 2 hour notice. Please contact listing agent. Showing Information: Call LA 1,Text LA 1,Do Not Contact Occupant ","True","In Ground","True","","2762","Appraiser","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Via Anita","","2421","","","Mid Century Modern","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1951","90274","1008","PVR1*"
