ue","28","","None","False","","937.34","Looking for a Horse Property in PV? Look no further! Welcome to the charming community of Larga Vista nestled in the picturesque Rolling Hills Estate. This captivating ranch-style home is perched in a tranquil cul-de-sac, offering breathtaking canyon views and direct access to a scenic horse trails right from your backyard. This home features 4 bedrooms and 2.5 baths, with a rare and distinctive floor plan. Upon entry, be greeted by the sunken formal living room characterized by its unique half-moon architecture reminiscent of the timeless 1960s era Accented by plenty of windows and a peek-a-boo of the city lights making it the perfect spot to relax and savor your favorite moments. The kitchen showcases new countertops and flooring, seamlessly flowing into the cozy family room with a wood burning brick fireplace and scenic views of the lush backyard foliage where you will enjoy the variety of fruit trees, such as plum, grape, tangerine, orange and more. Down the hall, discover the large main bedroom with upgraded bathroom and three bedrooms accompanied by a convenient laundry area. Outside, a wooden deck extends gracefully over the canyon ridge, providing an ideal setting to unwind amidst serene surroundings and gentle breezes. The expansive side yard offers amenities for equestrian enthusiasts, including a horse pen, shaded cover, and a charming chicken coop. Embark on leisurely strolls down the hillside to a designated horse landing, where your equine companions can graze and unwind. Saddle up and explore the area of nearby destinations via the bridal trail, whether it be the equestrian park, George F. Canyon Traily, or other scenic riding trails. This property is in a prime location, and offers a perfect blend of tranquility and convenience, ideal for those seeking a peaceful retreat within close proximity to urban amenities.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Ve