,"PV23084174","","6","6","","1","Owner","L.A. Cell","","310-293-6991","","","","","","64","","None","False","","953.57","Are you looking to leave The Westside and raise your family in an amazing community with award winning public schools? Welcome to 35 Moccasin Lane. This is a newly remodeled Tudor style equestrian farmhouse, sitting on one of the largest usable flat lots on Palos Verdes Peninsula. An unsurpassed cul-de-sac location, with a unique 20,000 square feet field for a backyard. The tasteful remodel features vaulted open beam ceilings, new kitchen, 4 new bathrooms, hardwood floors, travertine, and much more. The Gourmet kitchen is a chef's delight with Viking appliances, beverage center, farmhouse style stainless steel sink, an oversized island, Quartz countertops, along with marble backsplash and a pot filler. In addition to an oversized drive through 2 car garage, an additional detached 4 car garage in the back can be converted into a guest house, game room, workshop, horse barn or storage. The humongous field in the back is ready for, whether be horse sheds, stalls, riding arena, aviary, bee hives, greenhouse, veggie beds, fruit orchard, mini golf or even a 300 feet long zipline. Horses, goats, cows, chicken, bees! The bridle trail in the back, provides access to Ernie Howlett Park, Peter Weber Equestrian Center, South Coast Botanical Gardens, and the main PV Landfill preserve.","","Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Foyer, Game Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Rancho Vista","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Text Co-listing Agent Fred Nayebi at 310-259-5411 or Listing Agent Nazzy at 310-293-6991 to arrange a showing.","True","","","True","3403","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Moccasin","","35","Lane","","English,